e afterwards"}},detach:{summary:"Lets the thread run independently; it can no longer be joined.",parameters:[],return:{meaning:"nothing; the thread is no longer joinable (it must not touch objects that die first)"}},lock:{summary:"Locks the mutex (or locks several with deadlock avoidance when std::lock is used); blocks until acquired.",parameters:[],return:{meaning:"nothing; the caller now owns the lock and must unlock it (prefer lock_guard / scoped_lock)"}},unlock:{summary:"Releases a mutex the calling thread holds.",parameters:[],return:{meaning:"nothing; unlocking a mutex you do not own is undefined behavior"}},wait:{summary:"Blocks on a condition variable (or future) until notified / ready; the predicate overload re-checks the condition to survive spurious wakeups.",parameters:[{name:"lock",meaning:"a unique_lock holding the associated mutex (released while waiting)"},{name:"pred",meaning:"optional predicate: stop waiting when it returns true"}],return:{meaning:"nothing (future::wait) - for condition_variable the lock is held again on return"}},wait_for:{summary:"Waits with a timeout.",parameters:[{name:"duration",meaning:"maximum time to wait"},{name:"pred",meaning:"optional predicate"}],return:{meaning:"std::cv_status::timeout / no_timeout (without predicate), or the predicate value (with predicate); future::wait_for returns std::future_status"}},notify_one:{summary:"Wakes one thread waiting on the condition variable.",parameters:[],return:{meaning:"nothing"}},notify_all:{summary:"Wakes all threads waiting on the condition variable.",parameters:[],return:{meaning:"nothing"}},async:{summary:"Runs a callable asynchronously and returns a std::future for its result.",parameters:[{name:"policy",meaning:"optional launch policy: std::launch::async (new thread) or deferred (lazy, runs on get/wait)"},{name:"callable",meaning:"function to run"},{name:"args",meaning:"its arguments"}],return:{meaning:"a std::future; the destructor of an async future BLOCKS until the task 