",msg:"Cannot allocate memory",note:"記憶體不足（或位址空間、ulimit、cgroup 限制）"},{code:"13",name:"EACCES",msg:"Permission denied",note:"檔案或資料夾的權限不允許（rwx、擁有者、SELinux／AppArmor、掛載選項 noexec）"},{code:"14",name:"EFAULT",msg:"Bad address",note:"傳給核心的指標無效（常是程式 bug）"},{code:"15",name:"ENOTBLK",msg:"Block device required",note:"需要區塊裝置"},{code:"16",name:"EBUSY",msg:"Device or resource busy",note:"裝置或資源忙碌中（正被使用、掛載點正在使用）"},{code:"17",name:"EEXIST",msg:"File exists",note:"檔案已經存在（建立時不能覆蓋）"},{code:"18",name:"EXDEV",msg:"Invalid cross-device link",note:"不能跨檔案系統做硬連結或 rename，改用複製再刪除"},{code:"19",name:"ENODEV",msg:"No such device",note:"沒有這個裝置（驅動沒載入、不支援的操作）"},{code:"20",name:"ENOTDIR",msg:"Not a directory",note:"路徑中的某一段不是資料夾"},{code:"21",name:"EISDIR",msg:"Is a directory",note:"對資料夾做了只能對檔案做的操作"},{code:"22",name:"EINVAL",msg:"Invalid argument",note:"參數無效（旗標組合不合法、長度或對齊不對、值超出範圍）"},{code:"23",name:"ENFILE",msg:"Too many open files in system",note:"系統層級開啟的檔案數已滿"},{code:"24",name:"EMFILE",msg:"Too many open files",note:"行程開啟的檔案數超過上限（ulimit -n），常是忘了 close（檔案描述子洩漏）"},{code:"25",name:"ENOTTY",msg:"Inappropriate ioctl for device",note:"這個裝置不支援該 ioctl（常見：對非終端機呼叫終端機操作）"},{code:"26",name:"ETXTBSY",msg:"Text file busy",note:"執行檔正在被執行，無法寫入"},{code:"27",name:"EFBIG",msg:"File too large",note:"檔案超過大小上限"},{code:"28",name:"ENOSPC",msg:"No space left on device",note:"磁碟空間不足（也可能是 inode 用完、或 inotify 監看數用完）"},{code:"29",name:"ESPIPE",msg:"Illegal seek",note:"對管線或 socket 做了 seek"},{code:"30",name:"EROFS",msg:"Read-only file system",note:"檔案系統是唯讀的"},{code:"31",name:"EMLINK",msg:"Too many links",note:"連結數過多"},{code:"32",name:"EPIPE",msg:"Broken pipe",note:"寫入時對方已關閉（會同時收到 SIGPIPE）"},{code:"33",name:"EDOM",msg:"Numerical argument out of domain",note:"數學函式的引數超出定義域"},{code:"34",name:"ERANGE",msg:"Numerical result out of range",note:"結果超出範圍，或緩衝區太小"},{code:"35",name:"EDEADLK",msg:"Resource deadlock avoided",note:"偵測到鎖死"},{code:"36",name:"ENAMETOOLONG",msg:"File name too long",note:"檔名或路徑太長"},{code:"37",name:"ENOLCK",msg:"No locks available",note:"沒有可用的鎖"},{code:"38",name:"ENOSYS",msg:"Function not implemented",note:"這個系統呼叫在目前核心／架構沒實作"},{code:"39",name:"ENOTEMPTY",msg:"Directory not empty",note:"資料夾不是空的，無法刪除"},{code:"40",name:"ELOOP",msg:"Too many levels of symbolic links",note:"符號連結層級太多（可能形成迴圈）"},{code:"61",name:"ENODATA",msg:"No data available",note:"沒有資料（例如 getxattr 找不到該屬性）"},{code:"62",name:"ETIME",msg:"Timer expired",note:"計時器逾時"},{code:"71",name:"EPROTO",msg:"Protocol error",note:"協定錯誤"},{code:"74",name:"EBADMSG",msg:"Bad message",note:"訊息格式錯誤"},{code:"75",name:"EOVERFLOW",msg:"Value too large for defined data type",note:"值太大，放不進資料型別"},{code:"84",name:"EILSEQ",msg:"Invalid or incomplete multibyte or wide character",note:"多位元組字元序列無效（編碼不符）"},{code:"88",name:"ENOTSOCK",msg:"Socket operation on non-socket",note:"對非 socket 做了 socket 操作"},{code:"89",name:"EDESTADDRREQ",msg:"Destination address required",note:"需要目的位址"},{code:"90",name:"EMSGSIZE",msg:"Message too long",note:"訊息太長（超過 UDP／socket 限制）"},{code:"91",name:"EPROTOTYPE",msg:"Protocol wrong type for socket",note:"socket 類型與協定不符"},{code:"92",name:"ENOPROTOOPT",msg:"Protocol not available",note:"這個協定不支援該選項"},{code:"93",name:"EPROTONOSUPPORT",msg:"Protocol not supported",note:"不支援這個協定"},{code:"95",name:"EOPNOTSUPP",msg:"Operation not supported",note:"這個操作不被支援（也是 ENOTSUP）"},{code:"97",name:"EAFNOSUPPORT",msg:"Address family not supported by protocol",note:"不支援的位址家族"},{code:"98",name:"EADDRINUSE",msg:"Address already in use",note:"位址（埠號）已被使用；伺服器重啟時常見，可設 SO_REUSEADDR"},{code:"99",name:"EADDRNOTAVAIL",msg:"Cannot assign requested address",note:"無法使用該位址（本機沒有這個 IP）"},{code:"100",name:"ENETDOWN",msg:"Network is down",note:"網路介面停用"},{code:"101",name:"ENETUNREACH",msg:"Network is unreachable",note:"網路不可達（沒有路由）"},{code:"103",name:"ECONNABORTED",msg:"Software caused connection abort",note:"連線被本機軟體中止"},{code:"104",name:"ECONNRESET",msg:"Connection reset by peer",note:"連線被對方重設（對方行程崩潰、防火牆、對方強制關閉）"},{code:"105",name:"ENOBUFS",msg:"No buffer space available",note:"沒有緩衝區空間"},{code:"106",name:"EISCONN",msg:"Transport endpoint is already connected",note:"已經連線"},{code:"107",name:"ENOTCONN",msg:"Transport endpoint is not connected",note:"尚未連線"},{code:"110",name:"ETIMEDOUT",msg:"Connection timed out",note:"連線逾時（對方沒回應或被防火牆丟棄）"},{code:"111",name:"ECONNREFUSED",msg:"Connection refused",note:"連線被拒絕（對方埠沒有服務在聽）"},{code:"112",name:"EHOSTDOWN",msg:"Host is down",note:"主機關機"},{code:"113",name:"EHOSTUNREACH",msg:"No route to host",note:"找不到通往主機的路由"},{code:"114",name:"EALREADY",msg:"Operation already in progress",note:"操作已在進行中"},{code:"115",name:"EINPROGRESS",msg:"Operation now in progress",note:"非阻塞連線正在進行（要等可寫再檢查 SO_ERROR）"},{code:"116",name:"ESTALE",msg:"Stale file handle",note:"檔案控制代碼過期（NFS）"},{code:"122",name:"EDQUOT",msg:"Disk quota exceeded",note:"超過磁碟配額"},{code:"125",name:"ECANCELED",msg:"Operation canceled",note:"操作被取消"},{code:"130",name:"EOWNERDEAD",msg:"Owner died",note:"持有互斥鎖的行程已死"},{code:"131",name:"ENOTRECOVERABLE",msg:"State not recoverable",note:"狀態無法復原"},{code:"133",name:"EHWPOISON",msg:"Memory page has hardware error",note:"記憶體頁有硬體錯誤"},{code:"512",name:"ERESTARTSYS",msg:"To be restarted if SA_RESTART is set",note:"核心內部：被訊號打斷、可能重啟（不會傳到使用者空間）"}],signal:[{code:"1",name:"SIGHUP",msg:"Hangup",note:"終端機掛斷或控制行程結束；常用來通知常駐程式重新讀設定"},{code:"2",name:"SIGINT",msg:"Interrupt",note:"使用者按 Ctrl+C"},{code:"3",name:"SIGQUIT",msg:"Quit",note:"使用者按 Ctrl+\\，會產生 core dump"},{code:"4",name:"SIGILL",msg:"Illegal instruction",note:"執行了非法指令（跑錯架構的程式、程式碼損毀、用了 CPU 不支援的指令）"},{code:"5",name:"SIGTRAP",msg:"Trace/breakpoint trap",note:"除錯中斷點（int3）"},{code:"6",name:"SIGABRT",msg:"Aborted",note:"程式呼叫 abort()：assert 失敗、glibc 偵測到 heap 損毀、未捕捉的 C++ 例外"},{code:"7",name:"SIGBUS",msg:"Bus error",note:"匯流排錯誤：未對齊存取、存取 mmap 檔案已被截斷的區域"},{code:"8",name:"SIGFPE",msg:"Floating point exception",note:"算術例外：整數除以零、溢位（不一定是浮點）"},{code:"9",name:"SIGKILL",msg:"Killed",note:"被強制結束，無法捕捉；常是 OOM killer 或 kill -9"},{code:"10",name:"SIGUSR1",msg:"User defined signal 1",note:"使用者自訂訊號 1"},{code:"11",name:"SIGSEGV",msg:"Segmentation fault",note:"存取了無效記憶體位址：空指標、野指標、堆疊溢位、寫入唯讀區"},{code:"12",name:"SIGUSR2",msg:"User defined signal 2",note:"使用者自訂訊號 2"},{code:"13",name:"SIGPIPE",msg:"Broken pipe",note:"寫入已關閉的管線或 socket（預設會終止行程；伺服器常設為忽略）"},{code:"14",name:"SIGALRM",msg:"Alarm clock",note:"alarm() 計時到"},{code:"15",name:"SIGTERM",msg:"Terminated",note:"請求結束（kill 預設、systemd stop），可以捕捉做清理"},{code:"17",name:"SIGCHLD",msg:"Child exited",note:"子行程結束或暫停"},{code:"18",name:"SIGCONT",msg:"Continued",note:"繼續被暫停的行程"},{code:"19",name:"SIGSTOP",msg:"Stopped (signal)",note:"暫停行程，無法捕捉"},{code:"20",name:"SIGTSTP",msg:"Stopped",note:"使用者按 Ctrl+Z"},{code:"24",name:"SIGXCPU",msg:"CPU time limit exceeded",note:"超過 CPU 時間限制"},{code:"25",name:"SIGXFSZ",msg:"File size limit exceeded",note:"超過檔案大小限制"},{code:"31",name:"SIGSYS",msg:"Bad system call",note:"錯誤的系統呼叫（被 seccomp 擋下常見）"}],exit:[{code:"0",name:"SUCCESS",msg:"Success",note:"成功"},{code:"1",name:"GENERAL",msg:"General error",note:"一般性錯誤（程式自訂；很多工具用 1 表示失敗；grep 用 1 表示沒找到）"},{code:"2",name:"MISUSE",msg:"Misuse of shell builtins / usage error",note:"用法錯誤：參數不對（bash 內建與許多 CLI 的慣例）"},{code:"126",name:"NOT_EXECUTABLE",msg:"Command invoked cannot execute",note:"找到命令但不能執行（沒有執行權限、是資料夾、格式不對）"},{code:"127",name:"NOT_FOUND",msg:"Command not found",note:"找不到命令（PATH 沒有、拼錯、或腳本的直譯器路徑不存在）"},{code:"128",name:"INVALID_EXIT",msg:"Invalid argument to exit",note:"exit 的引數無效"},{code:"130",name:"SIGINT",msg:"Terminated by Ctrl+C",note:"被 Ctrl+C（SIGINT）結束，即 128+2"},{code:"134",name:"SIGABRT",msg:"Aborted",note:"被 SIGABRT 結束，即 128+6（assert／abort）"},{code:"137",name:"SIGKILL",msg:"Killed",note:"被 SIGKILL 結束，即 128+9（OOM killer 或 kill -9；容器記憶體超限常見）"},{code:"139",name:"SIGSEGV",msg:"Segmentation fault",note:"被 SIGSEGV 結束，即 128+11（記憶體存取錯誤）"},{code:"141",name:"SIGPIPE",msg:"Broken pipe",note:"被 SIGPIPE 結束，即 128+13"},{code:"143",name:"SIGTERM",msg:"Terminated",note:"被 SIGTERM 結束，即 128+15（正常的停止請求）"},{code:"255",name:"OUT_OF_RANGE",msg:"Exit status out of range",note:"退出碼超出範圍或 ssh 連線層級失敗（ssh 用 255 表示連線錯誤）"}],win32:[{code:"0",name:"ERROR_SUCCESS",msg:"The operation completed successfully.",note:"成功"},{code:"1",name:"ERROR_INVALID_FUNCTION",msg:"Incorrect function.",note:"功能無效（常見：對不支援的裝置呼叫 DeviceIoControl）"},{code:"2",name:"ERROR_FILE_NOT_FOUND",msg:"The system cannot find the file specified.",note:"找不到檔案（路徑、檔名錯誤）"},{code:"3",name:"ERROR_PATH_NOT_FOUND",msg:"The system cannot find the path specified.",note:"找不到路徑（中間的資料夾不存在）"},{code:"4",name:"ERROR_TOO_MANY_OPEN_FILES",msg:"The system cannot open the file.",note:"開啟的檔案太多"},{code:"5",name:"ERROR_ACCESS_DENIED",msg:"Access is denied.",note:"存取被拒：權限不足、需要以系統管理員身分執行、檔案被獨占鎖定、UAC／完整性層級"},{code:"6",name:"ERROR_INVALID_HANDLE",msg:"The handle is invalid.",note:"控制代碼無效（已關閉、未初始化、類型不對）"},{code:"8",name:"ERROR_NOT_ENOUGH_MEMORY",msg:"Not enough memory resources are available to process this command.",note:"記憶體不足"},{code:"13",name:"ERROR_INVALID_DATA",msg:"The data is invalid.",note:"資料無效"},{code:"14",name:"ERROR_OUTOFMEMORY",msg:"Not enough storage is available to complete this operation.",note:"記憶體（儲存空間）不足"},{code:"15",name:"ERROR_INVALID_DRIVE",msg:"The system cannot find the drive specified.",note:"找不到磁碟機代號"},{code:"17",name:"ERROR_NOT_SAME_DEVICE",msg:"The system cannot move the file to a different disk drive.",note:"不能跨磁碟移動"},{code:"18",name:"ERROR_NO_MORE_FILES",msg:"There are no more files.",note:"列舉已經結束（FindNextFile 的正常結尾，不是錯誤）"},{code:"19",name:"ERROR_WRITE_PROTECT",msg:"The media is write protected.",note:"媒體寫入保護"},{code:"21",name:"ERROR_NOT_READY",msg:"The device is not ready.",note:"裝置未就緒（光碟機沒碟、網路磁碟機斷線）"},{code:"23",name:"ERROR_CRC",msg:"Data error (cyclic redundancy check).",note:"資料錯誤（CRC），常是儲存媒體損壞"},{code:"24",name:"ERROR_BAD_LENGTH",msg:"The program issued a command but the command length is incorrect.",note:"命令長度不對（結構大小欄位沒設）"},{code:"31",name:"ERROR_GEN_FAILURE",msg:"A device attached to the system is not functioning.",note:"連接的裝置無法運作（一般裝置失敗）"},{code:"32",name:"ERROR_SHARING_VIOLATION",msg:"The process cannot access the file because it is being used by another process.",note:"檔案被另一個行程以不相容的共用模式開著（防毒、編輯器、另一個執行個體）"},{code:"33",name:"ERROR_LOCK_VIOLATION",msg:"The process cannot access the file because another process has locked a portion of the file.",note:"檔案區段被別的行程鎖住"},{code:"38",name:"ERROR_HANDLE_EOF",msg:"Reached the end of the file.",note:"讀到檔案結尾"},{code:"50",name:"ERROR_NOT_SUPPORTED",msg:"The request is not supported.",note:"不支援這個要求"},{code:"53",name:"ERROR_BAD_NETPATH",msg:"The network path was not found.",note:"找不到網路路徑（主機名稱或共用名稱錯誤）"},{code:"55",name:"ERROR_DEV_NOT_EXIST",msg:"The specified network resource or device is no longer available.",note:"網路資源或裝置已消失"},{code:"65",name:"ERROR_NETWORK_ACCESS_DENIED",msg:"Network access is denied.",note:"網路存取被拒"},{code:"67",name:"ERROR_BAD_NET_NAME",msg:"The network name cannot be found.",note:"找不到網路名稱（共用資料夾名稱錯誤）"},{code:"80",name:"ERROR_FILE_EXISTS",msg:"The file exists.",note:"檔案已存在"},{code:"82",name:"ERROR_CANNOT_MAKE",msg:"The directory or file cannot be created.",note:"無法建立"},{code:"87",name:"ERROR_INVALID_PARAMETER",msg:"The parameter is incorrect.",note:"參數不正確：旗標組合不合法、結構欄位未初始化、值超出範圍"},{code:"89",name:"ERROR_NO_PROC_SLOTS",msg:"The system cannot start another process at this time.",note:"暫時無法再啟動行程"},{code:"109",name:"ERROR_BROKEN_PIPE",msg:"The pipe has been ended.",note:"管線已結束（對方關閉）"},{code:"112",name:"ERROR_DISK_FULL",msg:"There is not enough space on the disk.",note:"磁碟空間不足"},{code:"122",name:"ERROR_INSUFFICIENT_BUFFER",msg:"The data area passed to a system call is too small.",note:"緩衝區太小：用回傳的所需大小重新配置後再呼叫"},{code:"123",name:"ERROR_INVALID_NAME",msg:"The filename, directory name, or volume label syntax is incorrect.",note:"檔名、資料夾名稱或磁碟標籤的語法錯誤（含非法字元）"},{code:"126",name:"ERROR_MOD_NOT_FOUND",msg:"The specified module could not be found.",note:"找不到模組：LoadLibrary 載入 DLL 失敗，常因缺少相依的 DLL（用 Dependencies 工具檢查）"},{code:"127",name:"ERROR_PROC_NOT_FOUND",msg:"The specified procedure could not be found.",note:"找不到函式：GetProcAddress 失敗，DLL 版本不符或匯出名稱錯"},{code:"145",name:"ERROR_DIR_NOT_EMPTY",msg:"The directory is not empty.",note:"資料夾不是空的"},{code:"158",name:"ERROR_NOT_LOCKED",msg:"The segment is already unlocked.",note:"已經解除鎖定"},{code:"170",name:"ERROR_BUSY",msg:"The requested resource is in use.",note:"資源使用中"},{code:"183",name:"ERROR_ALREADY_EXISTS",msg:"Cannot create a file when that file already exists.",note:"已經存在（建立檔案、具名物件如 mutex／event 時；常用來偵測程式重複執行）"},{code:"193",name:"ERROR_BAD_EXE_FORMAT",msg:"%1 is not a valid Win32 application.",note:"不是有效的 Win32 應用程式（32／64 位元不符、檔案損毀）"},{code:"206",name:"ERROR_FILENAME_EXCED_RANGE",msg:"The filename or extension is too long.",note:"檔名或路徑太長（超過 MAX_PATH 260；可用 \\\\?\\ 前綴或啟用長路徑）"},{code:"216",name:"ERROR_EXE_MACHINE_TYPE_MISMATCH",msg:"This version of %1 is not compatible with the version of Windows you're running.",note:"執行檔的 CPU 架構與系統不符"},{code:"231",name:"ERROR_PIPE_BUSY",msg:"All pipe instances are busy.",note:"具名管線的所有執行個體都忙碌"},{code:"232",name:"ERROR_NO_DATA",msg:"The pipe is being closed.",note:"管線正在關閉"},{code:"234",name:"ERROR_MORE_DATA",msg:"More data is available.",note:"還有更多資料：緩衝區放不下，需再讀或加大緩衝區（不是失敗）"},{code:"258",name:"WAIT_TIMEOUT",msg:"The wait operation timed out.",note:"等待逾時"},{code:"259",name:"ERROR_NO_MORE_ITEMS",msg:"No more data is available.",note:"列舉結束"},{code:"267",name:"ERROR_DIRECTORY",msg:"The directory name is invalid.",note:"資料夾名稱無效（或對檔案當資料夾用）"},{code:"298",name:"ERROR_TOO_MANY_POSTS",msg:"Too many posts were made to a semaphore.",note:"號誌釋放次數過多"},{code:"299",name:"ERROR_PARTIAL_COPY",msg:"Only part of a ReadProcessMemory or WriteProcessMemory request was completed.",note:"只完成部分記憶體讀寫（目標位址部分不可存取）"},{code:"317",name:"ERROR_MR_MID_NOT_FOUND",msg:"The system cannot find message text for message number in the message file.",note:"找不到訊息文字（FormatMessage 常見）"},{code:"377",name:"ERROR_NOT_ENOUGH_QUOTA",msg:"Not enough quota is available to process this command.",note:"配額不足"},{code:"487",name:"ERROR_INVALID_ADDRESS",msg:"Attempt to access invalid address.",note:"存取無效位址"},{code:"534",name:"ERROR_ARITHMETIC_OVERFLOW",msg:"Arithmetic result exceeded 32 bits.",note:"算術結果溢位"},{code:"535",name:"ERROR_PIPE_CONNECTED",msg:"There is a process on other end of the pipe.",note:"管線另一端已有行程連上（ConnectNamedPipe 的正常情況）"},{code:"536",name:"ERROR_PIPE_LISTENING",msg:"Waiting for a process to open the other end of the pipe.",note:"等待另一端開啟管線"},{code:"565",name:"ERROR_TOO_MANY_THREADS",msg:"Too many threads.",note:"執行緒太多"},{code:"577",name:"ERROR_INVALID_IMAGE_HASH",msg:"Windows cannot verify the digital signature for this file.",note:"無法驗證檔案的數位簽章（驅動或程式簽章問題）"},{code:"593",name:"ERROR_INVALID_CREATE_FLAGS",msg:"Invalid flags.",note:"旗標無效"},{code:"740",name:"ERROR_ELEVATION_REQUIRED",msg:"The requested operation requires elevation.",note:"需要提高權限（以系統管理員身分執行）"},{code:"997",name:"ERROR_IO_PENDING",msg:"Overlapped I/O operation is in progress.",note:"重疊 I/O 進行中（非同步的正常回傳，不是失敗）"},{code:"998",name:"ERROR_NOACCESS",msg:"Invalid access to memory location.",note:"記憶體存取無效"},{code:"1004",name:"ERROR_INVALID_FLAGS",msg:"Invalid flags.",note:"旗標無效"},{code:"1008",name:"ERROR_NO_TOKEN",msg:"An attempt was made to reference a token that does not exist.",note:"參考不存在的權杖"},{code:"1058",name:"ERROR_SERVICE_DISABLED",msg:"The service cannot be started, either because it is disabled or because it has no enabled devices associated with it.",note:"服務已停用，無法啟動"},{code:"1060",name:"ERROR_SERVICE_DOES_NOT_EXIST",msg:"The specified service does not exist as an installed service.",note:"服務不存在"},{code:"1062",name:"ERROR_SERVICE_NOT_ACTIVE",msg:"The service has not been started.",note:"服務沒有啟動"},{code:"1053",name:"ERROR_SERVICE_REQUEST_TIMEOUT",msg:"The service did not respond to the start or control request in a timely fashion.",note:"服務沒有及時回應啟動或控制要求"},{code:"1056",name:"ERROR_SERVICE_ALREADY_RUNNING",msg:"An instance of the service is already running.",note:"服務已在執行"},{code:"1067",name:"ERROR_PROCESS_ABORTED",msg:"The process terminated unexpectedly.",note:"行程意外終止"},{code:"1168",name:"ERROR_NOT_FOUND",msg:"Element not found.",note:"找不到項目"},{code:"1210",name:"ERROR_INVALID_COMPUTERNAME",msg:"The format of the specified computer name is invalid.",note:"電腦名稱格式無效"},{code:"1219",name:"ERROR_SESSION_CREDENTIAL_CONFLICT",msg:"Multiple connections to a server or shared resource by the same user are not allowed.",note:"同一使用者以不同認證連到同一伺服器衝突"},{code:"1223",name:"ERROR_CANCELLED",msg:"The operation was canceled by the user.",note:"使用者取消"},{code:"1225",name:"ERROR_CONNECTION_REFUSED",msg:"The remote system refused the network connection.",note:"遠端系統拒絕連線"},{code:"1326",name:"ERROR_LOGON_FAILURE",msg:"The user name or password is incorrect.",note:"使用者名稱或密碼錯誤"},{code:"1331",name:"ERROR_ACCOUNT_DISABLED",msg:"This user account has been disabled.",note:"帳戶已停用"},{code:"1332",name:"ERROR_NONE_MAPPED",msg:"No mapping between account names and security IDs was done.",note:"帳戶名稱找不到對應的 SID"},{code:"1314",name:"ERROR_PRIVILEGE_NOT_HELD",msg:"A required privilege is not held by the client.",note:"缺少所需的特殊權限（例如 SeDebugPrivilege、SeBackupPrivilege）；要用 AdjustTokenPrivileges 啟用，或以系統管理員執行"},{code:"1450",name:"ERROR_NO_SYSTEM_RESOURCES",msg:"Insufficient system resources exist to complete the requested service.",note:"系統資源不足"},{code:"1455",name:"ERROR_COMMITMENT_LIMIT",msg:"The paging file is too small for this operation to complete.",note:"分頁檔太小，提交記憶體超過上限"},{code:"1722",name:"RPC_S_SERVER_UNAVAILABLE",msg:"The RPC server is unavailable.",note:"RPC 伺服器不可用（服務沒啟動、防火牆、名稱解析）"},{code:"1784",name:"ERROR_INVALID_USER_BUFFER",msg:"The supplied user buffer is not valid for the requested operation.",note:"使用者緩衝區無效"},{code:"1813",name:"ERROR_RESOURCE_TYPE_NOT_FOUND",msg:"The specified resource type cannot be found in the image file.",note:"映像檔裡找不到該資源類型"},{code:"1814",name:"ERROR_RESOURCE_NAME_NOT_FOUND",msg:"The specified resource name cannot be found in the image file.",note:"映像檔裡找不到該資源名稱"},{code:"1920",name:"ERROR_CANT_ACCESS_FILE",msg:"The file cannot be accessed by the system.",note:"系統無法存取該檔案"},{code:"2250",name:"ERROR_NOT_CONNECTED",msg:"The network connection does not exist.",note:"網路連線不存在"}],winsock:[{code:"10004",name:"WSAEINTR",msg:"A blocking operation was interrupted by a call to WSACancelBlockingCall.",note:"阻塞操作被中斷"},{code:"10009",name:"WSAEBADF",msg:"The file handle supplied is not valid.",note:"控制代碼無效"},{code:"10013",name:"WSAEACCES",msg:"An attempt was made to access a socket in a way forbidden by its access permissions.",note:"socket 權限不允許（例如綁定到被獨占的埠、廣播未設選項）"},{code:"10014",name:"WSAEFAULT",msg:"The system detected an invalid pointer address in attempting to use a pointer argument of a call.",note:"指標位址無效"},{code:"10022",name:"WSAEINVAL",msg:"An invalid argument was supplied.",note:"參數無效（常見：未先 bind 就 listen／accept）"},{code:"10024",name:"WSAEMFILE",msg:"Too many open sockets.",note:"socket 太多"},{code:"10035",name:"WSAEWOULDBLOCK",msg:"A non-blocking socket operation could not be completed immediately.",note:"非阻塞操作暫時無法完成，稍後再試（不是真的錯誤）"},{code:"10036",name:"WSAEINPROGRESS",msg:"A blocking operation is currently executing.",note:"有阻塞操作正在進行"},{code:"10037",name:"WSAEALREADY",msg:"An operation was attempted on a non-blocking socket that already had an operation in progress.",note:"非阻塞 socket 已有操作在進行"},{code:"10038",name:"WSAENOTSOCK",msg:"An operation was attempted on something that is not a socket.",note:"對非 socket 做 socket 操作（socket 已關閉或值無效）"},{code:"10040",name:"WSAEMSGSIZE",msg:"A message sent on a datagram socket was larger than the internal message buffer.",note:"資料報太大或接收緩衝區太小"},{code:"10043",name:"WSAEPROTONOSUPPORT",msg:"The requested protocol has not been configured into the system.",note:"不支援的協定"},{code:"10047",name:"WSAEAFNOSUPPORT",msg:"An address incompatible with the requested protocol was used.",note:"位址家族不支援"},{code:"10048",name:"WSAEADDRINUSE",msg:"Only one usage of each socket address (protocol/network address/port) is normally permitted.",note:"位址（埠）已被使用"},{code:"10049",name:"WSAEADDRNOTAVAIL",msg:"The requested address is not valid in its context.",note:"位址在此環境無效（本機沒有這個 IP）"},{code:"10050",name:"WSAENETDOWN",msg:"A socket operation encountered a dead network.",note:"網路掛了"},{code:"10051",name:"WSAENETUNREACH",msg:"A socket operation was attempted to an unreachable network.",note:"網路不可達"},{code:"10053",name:"WSAECONNABORTED",msg:"An established connection was aborted by the software in your host computer.",note:"連線被本機軟體中止（逾時、通訊協定錯誤）"},{code:"10054",name:"WSAECONNRESET",msg:"An existing connection was forcibly closed by the remote host.",note:"連線被遠端強制關閉（對方崩潰、重設、防火牆）"},{code:"10055",name:"WSAENOBUFS",msg:"An operation on a socket could not be performed because the system lacked sufficient buffer space or because a queue was full.",note:"緩衝區空間不足"},{code:"10056",name:"WSAEISCONN",msg:"A connect request was made on an already connected socket.",note:"已經連線"},{code:"10057",name:"WSAENOTCONN",msg:"A request to send or receive data was disallowed because the socket is not connected.",note:"socket 尚未連線"},{code:"10058",name:"WSAESHUTDOWN",msg:"A request to send or receive data was disallowed because the socket had already been shut down in that direction.",note:"該方向已 shutdown"},{code:"10060",name:"WSAETIMEDOUT",msg:"A connection attempt failed because the connected party did not properly respond after a period of time.",note:"連線逾時"},{code:"10061",name:"WSAECONNREFUSED",msg:"No connection could be made because the target machine actively refused it.",note:"對方主動拒絕（埠沒有服務在聽）"},{code:"10064",name:"WSAEHOSTDOWN",msg:"A socket operation failed because the destination host was down.",note:"目的主機關機"},{code:"10065",name:"WSAEHOSTUNREACH",msg:"A socket operation was attempted to an unreachable host.",note:"找不到通往主機的路由"},{code:"10091",name:"WSASYSNOTREADY",msg:"Network subsystem is unavailable.",note:"網路子系統不可用"},{code:"10093",name:"WSANOTINITIALISED",msg:"Successful WSAStartup not yet performed.",note:"還沒呼叫 WSAStartup"},{code:"11001",name:"WSAHOST_NOT_FOUND",msg:"No such host is known.",note:"找不到主機（DNS 查詢失敗）"},{code:"11002",name:"WSATRY_AGAIN",msg:"This is usually a temporary error during hostname resolution.",note:"名稱解析暫時失敗，稍後再試"},{code:"11004",name:"WSANO_DATA",msg:"The requested name is valid, but no data of the requested type was found.",note:"名稱有效但沒有該類型的紀錄"}],hresult:[{code:"0x00000000",name:"S_OK",msg:"Operation successful",note:"成功"},{code:"0x00000001",name:"S_FALSE",msg:"Operation successful (false)",note:"成功但結果為「否」"},{code:"0x80004001",name:"E_NOTIMPL",msg:"Not implemented",note:"沒有實作"},{code:"0x80004002",name:"E_NOINTERFACE",msg:"No such interface supported",note:"物件不支援要求的介面（QueryInterface 失敗）"},{code:"0x80004003",name:"E_POINTER",msg:"Pointer that is not valid",note:"指標無效（傳了 NULL）"},{code:"0x80004004",name:"E_ABORT",msg:"Operation aborted",note:"操作中止"},{code:"0x80004005",name:"E_FAIL",msg:"Unspecified failure",note:"未指定的失敗（沒有更細的原因，需看其他日誌）"},{code:"0x8000FFFF",name:"E_UNEXPECTED",msg:"Catastrophic failure",note:"嚴重／非預期的失敗"},{code:"0x80070005",name:"E_ACCESSDENIED",msg:"General access denied error",note:"存取被拒（即 Win32 ERROR_ACCESS_DENIED）"},{code:"0x80070006",name:"E_HANDLE",msg:"Handle that is not valid",note:"控制代碼無效"},{code:"0x8007000E",name:"E_OUTOFMEMORY",msg:"Failed to allocate necessary memory",note:"記憶體不足"},{code:"0x80070057",name:"E_INVALIDARG",msg:"One or more arguments are not valid",note:"參數無效（即 ERROR_INVALID_PARAMETER 87）"},{code:"0x800700B7",name:"HRESULT_ALREADY_EXISTS",msg:"Cannot create a file when that file already exists",note:"已存在（Win32 183）"},{code:"0x80070002",name:"HRESULT_FILE_NOT_FOUND",msg:"The system cannot find the file specified",note:"找不到檔案（Win32 2）"},{code:"0x80070003",name:"HRESULT_PATH_NOT_FOUND",msg:"The system cannot find the path specified",note:"找不到路徑（Win32 3）"},{code:"0x8007007E",name:"HRESULT_MOD_NOT_FOUND",msg:"The specified module could not be found",note:"找不到模組／DLL（Win32 126）"},{code:"0x800704C7",name:"HRESULT_CANCELLED",msg:"The operation was canceled by the user",note:"使用者取消（Win32 1223）"},{code:"0x80040154",name:"REGDB_E_CLASSNOTREG",msg:"Class not registered",note:"COM 類別沒註冊（DLL／TLB 沒 regsvr32，或位元數不符）"},{code:"0x80040150",name:"REGDB_E_READREGDB",msg:"Could not read key from registry",note:"讀不到登錄機碼"},{code:"0x800401F0",name:"CO_E_NOTINITIALIZED",msg:"CoInitialize has not been called",note:"沒有呼叫 CoInitialize"},{code:"0x800401F3",name:"CO_E_CLASSSTRING",msg:"Invalid class string",note:"CLSID／ProgID 字串無效"},{code:"0x80010106",name:"RPC_E_CHANGED_MODE",msg:"Cannot change thread mode after it is set",note:"執行緒的 COM 模型（STA／MTA）已設定，不能改"},{code:"0x80010108",name:"RPC_E_DISCONNECTED",msg:"The object invoked has disconnected from its clients",note:"被呼叫的物件已與用戶端斷線"},{code:"0x800706BA",name:"RPC_S_SERVER_UNAVAILABLE_HR",msg:"The RPC server is unavailable",note:"RPC 伺服器不可用"},{code:"0x800706BE",name:"RPC_S_CALL_FAILED",msg:"The remote procedure call failed",note:"遠端程序呼叫失敗"},{code:"0x80020009",name:"DISP_E_EXCEPTION",msg:"Exception occurred",note:"IDispatch 呼叫發生例外"},{code:"0x80020005",name:"DISP_E_TYPEMISMATCH",msg:"Type mismatch",note:"型別不符"},{code:"0x8002000E",name:"DISP_E_BADPARAMCOUNT",msg:"Invalid number of parameters",note:"參數數量不對"},{code:"0x80030005",name:"STG_E_ACCESSDENIED",msg:"Access denied",note:"結構化儲存存取被拒"},{code:"0x80070490",name:"HRESULT_NOT_FOUND",msg:"Element not found",note:"找不到項目（Win32 1168）"},{code:"0x8007139F",name:"HRESULT_INVALID_STATE",msg:"The group or resource is not in the correct state to perform the requested operation",note:"狀態不正確，無法執行"},{code:"0x80072EE2",name:"WININET_E_TIMEOUT",msg:"The operation timed out",note:"網路操作逾時（WinINet）"},{code:"0x80072EE7",name:"WININET_E_NAME_NOT_RESOLVED",msg:"The server name or address could not be resolved",note:"無法解析伺服器名稱"},{code:"0x80072EFD",name:"WININET_E_CANNOT_CONNECT",msg:"A connection with the server could not be established",note:"無法連到伺服器"},{code:"0x80072F8F",name:"WININET_E_DECODING_FAILED",msg:"A security error occurred",note:"TLS／安全連線錯誤（時間不對或憑證）"},{code:"0x887A0005",name:"DXGI_ERROR_DEVICE_REMOVED",msg:"The video card has been physically removed from the system, or a driver upgrade has occurred",note:"顯示卡被移除或驅動更新，裝置遺失，需重建 D3D 裝置"},{code:"0x887A0006",name:"DXGI_ERROR_DEVICE_HUNG",msg:"The application's device failed due to badly formed commands",note:"顯示裝置掛住（GPU 超時、命令錯誤）"},{code:"0x887A0007",name:"DXGI_ERROR_DEVICE_RESET",msg:"The device failed due to a badly formed command",note:"裝置重設"},{code:"0x887A0001",name:"DXGI_ERROR_INVALID_CALL",msg:"The application made a call that is invalid",note:"DXGI 呼叫無效"},{code:"0x8876086C",name:"D3DERR_INVALIDCALL",msg:"Invalid call",note:"D3D9 呼叫無效"},{code:"0x80090016",name:"NTE_BAD_KEYSET",msg:"Keyset does not exist",note:"金鑰容器不存在（CryptoAPI）"},{code:"0x8009000F",name:"NTE_EXISTS",msg:"Object already exists",note:"物件已存在"},{code:"0x80090008",name:"NTE_BAD_ALGID",msg:"Invalid algorithm specified",note:"演算法無效"},{code:"0x80090305",name:"SEC_E_SECPKG_NOT_FOUND",msg:"The specified security package does not exist",note:"安全套件不存在"},{code:"0x80090308",name:"SEC_E_INVALID_TOKEN",msg:"The token supplied to the function is invalid",note:"權杖無效"},{code:"0x8009030C",name:"SEC_E_LOGON_DENIED",msg:"The logon attempt failed",note:"登入失敗"},{code:"0x80092004",name:"CRYPT_E_NOT_FOUND",msg:"Cannot find object or property",note:"找不到憑證或屬性"},{code:"0x800B0109",name:"CERT_E_UNTRUSTEDROOT",msg:"A certificate chain processed, but terminated in a root certificate which is not trusted",note:"憑證鏈的根憑證不受信任"},{code:"0x800B010A",name:"CERT_E_CHAINING",msg:"A certificate chain could not be built to a trusted root authority",note:"無法建立到受信任根的憑證鏈"},{code:"0x800B0101",name:"CERT_E_EXPIRED",msg:"A required certificate is not within its validity period",note:"憑證過期或尚未生效"},{code:"0x80240022",name:"WU_E_ALL_UPDATES_FAILED",msg:"Operation failed for all the updates",note:"Windows Update 所有更新失敗"},{code:"0x8024402C",name:"WU_E_PT_WINHTTP_NAME_NOT_RESOLVED",msg:"Windows Update Agent could not resolve the proxy or server name",note:"Windows Update 無法解析名稱（網路或 proxy）"}],ntstatus:[{code:"0x00000000",name:"STATUS_SUCCESS",msg:"STATUS_SUCCESS",note:"成功"},{code:"0x00000103",name:"STATUS_PENDING",msg:"The operation that was requested is pending completion",note:"操作進行中（非同步）"},{code:"0x40000000",name:"STATUS_OBJECT_NAME_EXISTS_INFO",msg:"An object name already exists",note:"資訊：物件名稱已存在"},{code:"0x80000005",name:"STATUS_BUFFER_OVERFLOW",msg:"The data was too large to fit into the specified buffer",note:"緩衝區放不下（警告）：已填入部分資料"},{code:"0x80000006",name:"STATUS_NO_MORE_FILES",msg:"No more files were found which match the file specification",note:"沒有更多檔案"},{code:"0x80000011",name:"STATUS_DEVICE_BUSY",msg:"The device is currently busy",note:"裝置忙碌"},{code:"0x80000026",name:"STATUS_LONGJUMP",msg:"A long jump has been executed",note:"執行了 longjmp"},{code:"0x80000002",name:"STATUS_DATATYPE_MISALIGNMENT",msg:"A datatype misalignment was detected in a load or store instruction",note:"載入／儲存指令的資料型別未對齊"},{code:"0x80000003",name:"STATUS_BREAKPOINT",msg:"A breakpoint has been reached",note:"中斷點（int3；除錯器）"},{code:"0x80000004",name:"STATUS_SINGLE_STEP",msg:"A single step or trace operation has just been completed",note:"單步執行完成"},{code:"0xC0000001",name:"STATUS_UNSUCCESSFUL",msg:"{Operation Failed} The requested operation was unsuccessful",note:"操作未成功（通用失敗）"},{code:"0xC0000002",name:"STATUS_NOT_IMPLEMENTED",msg:"{Not Implemented} The requested operation is not implemented",note:"沒有實作"},{code:"0xC0000005",name:"STATUS_ACCESS_VIOLATION",msg:"The instruction at 0x%p referenced memory at 0x%p. The memory could not be %s",note:"記憶體存取違規：讀／寫了無效或未配置的位址（空指標、野指標、使用已釋放記憶體、DEP 阻擋執行）；程式崩潰最常見的原因，等同 Linux 的 SIGSEGV"},{code:"0xC0000008",name:"STATUS_INVALID_HANDLE",msg:"An invalid HANDLE was specified",note:"控制代碼無效"},{code:"0xC000000D",name:"STATUS_INVALID_PARAMETER",msg:"An invalid parameter was passed to a service or function",note:"參數無效"},{code:"0xC000000F",name:"STATUS_NO_SUCH_FILE",msg:"The file does not exist",note:"檔案不存在"},{code:"0xC0000017",name:"STATUS_NO_MEMORY",msg:"{Not Enough Quota} Not enough virtual memory or paging file quota is available",note:"記憶體或分頁檔額度不足"},{code:"0xC0000022",name:"STATUS_ACCESS_DENIED",msg:"{Access Denied} A process has requested access to an object, but has not been granted those access rights",note:"存取被拒"},{code:"0xC0000023",name:"STATUS_BUFFER_TOO_SMALL",msg:"The buffer is too small to contain the entry",note:"緩衝區太小"},{code:"0xC0000034",name:"STATUS_OBJECT_NAME_NOT_FOUND",msg:"Object Name not found",note:"找不到物件名稱"},{code:"0xC0000035",name:"STATUS_OBJECT_NAME_COLLISION",msg:"Object Name already exists",note:"物件名稱已存在"},{code:"0xC000003A",name:"STATUS_OBJECT_PATH_NOT_FOUND",msg:"The path does not exist",note:"路徑不存在"},{code:"0xC0000043",name:"STATUS_SHARING_VIOLATION",msg:"A file cannot be opened because the share access flags are incompatible",note:"共用違規：檔案被別人以不相容模式開著"},{code:"0xC0000054",name:"STATUS_FILE_LOCK_CONFLICT",msg:"A requested read/write cannot be granted due to a conflicting file lock",note:"檔案鎖衝突"},{code:"0xC000005A",name:"STATUS_INVALID_OWNER",msg:"Indicates a particular security ID may not be assigned as the owner of an object",note:"無效的擁有者"},{code:"0xC0000094",name:"STATUS_INTEGER_DIVIDE_BY_ZERO",msg:"{EXCEPTION} Integer divide by zero",note:"整數除以零"},{code:"0xC0000095",name:"STATUS_INTEGER_OVERFLOW",msg:"{EXCEPTION} Integer overflow",note:"整數溢位"},{code:"0xC000001D",name:"STATUS_ILLEGAL_INSTRUCTION",msg:"{EXCEPTION} Illegal Instruction",note:"非法指令"},{code:"0xC0000025",name:"STATUS_NONCONTINUABLE_EXCEPTION",msg:"{EXCEPTION} Windows cannot continue from this exception",note:"無法從這個例外繼續"},{code:"0xC0000026",name:"STATUS_INVALID_DISPOSITION",msg:"An invalid exception disposition was returned by an exception handler",note:"例外處理器回傳無效處置"},{code:"0xC000008C",name:"STATUS_ARRAY_BOUNDS_EXCEEDED",msg:"{EXCEPTION} Array bounds exceeded",note:"陣列越界"},{code:"0xC000008E",name:"STATUS_FLOAT_DIVIDE_BY_ZERO",msg:"{EXCEPTION} Floating-point division by zero",note:"浮點除以零"},{code:"0xC0000090",name:"STATUS_FLOAT_INVALID_OPERATION",msg:"{EXCEPTION} Floating-point invalid operation",note:"浮點無效運算"},{code:"0xC00000FD",name:"STATUS_STACK_OVERFLOW",msg:"A new guard page for the stack cannot be created",note:"堆疊溢位（無限遞迴、過大的區域變數）"},{code:"0xC0000135",name:"STATUS_DLL_NOT_FOUND",msg:"{Unable To Locate Component} This application has failed to start because %hs was not found",note:"找不到 DLL：程式啟動失敗（缺少 VC++ 執行階段或相依 DLL），常見訊息「0xC0000135」"},{code:"0xC0000139",name:"STATUS_ENTRYPOINT_NOT_FOUND",msg:"The procedure entry point could not be located in the dynamic link library",note:"在 DLL 中找不到匯出函式（DLL 版本不符）"},{code:"0xC0000142",name:"STATUS_DLL_INIT_FAILED",msg:"{DLL Initialization Failed} Initialization of the dynamic library %hs failed",note:"DLL 初始化失敗，行程將結束"},{code:"0xC0000148",name:"STATUS_INVALID_PARAMETER_MIX",msg:"An invalid combination of parameters was specified",note:"參數組合無效"},{code:"0xC000014B",name:"STATUS_PIPE_BROKEN",msg:"The pipe operation has failed because the other end of the pipe has been closed",note:"管線另一端已關閉"},{code:"0xC0000194",name:"STATUS_POSSIBLE_DEADLOCK",msg:"{EXCEPTION} Possible deadlock condition",note:"可能死鎖"},{code:"0xC000010A",name:"STATUS_PROCESS_IS_TERMINATING",msg:"An attempt was made to access an exiting process",note:"行程正在結束"},{code:"0xC000012D",name:"STATUS_COMMITMENT_LIMIT",msg:"{Out of Virtual Memory} Your system is low on virtual memory",note:"虛擬記憶體（提交額度）用完"},{code:"0xC0000185",name:"STATUS_IO_DEVICE_ERROR",msg:"The I/O device reported an I/O error",note:"I/O 裝置錯誤"},{code:"0xC000020C",name:"STATUS_CONNECTION_DISCONNECTED",msg:"The transport connection is now disconnected",note:"傳輸連線已斷開"},{code:"0xC000021A",name:"STATUS_SYSTEM_PROCESS_TERMINATED",msg:"{Fatal System Error} The system process terminated unexpectedly",note:"系統行程意外終止（會藍屏）"},{code:"0xC0000225",name:"STATUS_NOT_FOUND",msg:"Not Found",note:"找不到"},{code:"0xC0000227",name:"STATUS_ALREADY_COMMITTED",msg:"The specified address range is already committed",note:"位址範圍已提交"},{code:"0xC0000240",name:"STATUS_REQUEST_ABORTED",msg:"The request was aborted",note:"要求被中止"},{code:"0xC000026E",name:"STATUS_VOLUME_DISMOUNTED",msg:"An operation was attempted to a volume after it was dismounted",note:"磁碟區已卸載"},{code:"0xC0000374",name:"STATUS_HEAP_CORRUPTION",msg:"A heap has been corrupted",note:"堆積（heap）損毀：重複釋放、緩衝區溢位、寫入已釋放記憶體"},{code:"0xC0000409",name:"STATUS_STACK_BUFFER_OVERRUN",msg:"The system detected an overrun of a stack-based buffer in this application",note:"偵測到堆疊緩衝區溢位（/GS、__fastfail，也用於 fail-fast 例外）"},{code:"0xC0000417",name:"STATUS_INVALID_CRUNTIME_PARAMETER",msg:"An invalid parameter was passed to a C runtime function",note:"傳給 C 執行階段函式的參數無效"},{code:"0xC0000420",name:"STATUS_ASSERTION_FAILURE",msg:"An assertion failure has occurred",note:"斷言失敗"},{code:"0xC0000602",name:"STATUS_FAIL_FAST_EXCEPTION",msg:"A fail fast exception occurred",note:"Fail-fast 例外：程式偵測到嚴重錯誤主動終止"},{code:"0xC06D007E",name:"VCPP_E_MOD_NOT_FOUND",msg:"Delay-load module not found",note:"延遲載入的模組找不到（Visual C++）"},{code:"0xC06D007F",name:"VCPP_E_PROC_NOT_FOUND",msg:"Delay-load procedure not found",note:"延遲載入的函式找不到"},{code:"0xE06D7363",name:"CXX_EXCEPTION",msg:"Microsoft C++ exception",note:"未被處理的 C++ 例外（例外碼 'msc'）：看例外類型與訊息，常是 std::exception"},{code:"0xE0434352",name:"CLR_EXCEPTION",msg:".NET CLR exception",note:"未處理的 .NET 例外（'CCR'）"},{code:"0x40010005",name:"DBG_CONTROL_C",msg:"Control-C",note:"使用者按 Ctrl+C"},{code:"0x40010006",name:"DBG_PRINTEXCEPTION_C",msg:"Debug print exception",note:"OutputDebugString 產生的例外（除錯器用）"},{code:"0x406D1388",name:"MS_VC_EXCEPTION",msg:"Thread name exception",note:"設定執行緒名稱的特殊例外（除錯器用，可忽略）"}]},commands:{mpirun:{name:"mpirun",aliases:["mpiexec","mpiexec.hydra","mpiexec.mpich","orterun","mpirun.mpich","mpirun_rsh"],summary:"啟動 MPI 程式（MPICH／MVAPICH2 用 Hydra，Open MPI 用 orterun）：在一或多台機器上開 N 個行程",synopsis:"mpirun -np N [選項] 程式 [引數...]",options:[{flag:"-np",arg:"數量",desc:"啟動的 MPI 行程總數"},{flag:"-n",arg:"數量",desc:"同 -np"},{flag:"-ppn",arg:"數量",desc:"每個節點啟動幾個行程（Hydra）"},{flag:"--map-by",arg:"規則",desc:"行程如何分配到節點與核心（Open MPI，例如 ppr:2:node、socket）"},{flag:"--bind-to",arg:"目標",desc:"把行程綁到核心、插座或不綁（core、socket、none）；效能與可重現性相關"},{flag:"-hosts",arg:"主機清單",desc:"以逗號分隔的主機名稱（Hydra）"},{flag:"-f",arg:"檔案",desc:"主機清單檔（Hydra 的 hostfile）"},{flag:"-hostfile",arg:"檔案",desc:"主機清單檔"},{flag:"--hostfile",arg:"檔案",desc:"主機清單檔（Open MPI）"},{flag:"-machinefile",arg:"檔案",desc:"主機清單檔"},{flag:"-host",arg:"主機",desc:"指定主機（Open MPI）"},{flag:"-x",arg:"變數",desc:"把環境變數傳給所有行程（Open MPI）"},{flag:"-genv",arg:"變數 值",desc:"設定所有行程的環境變數（Hydra），例如 -genv MV2_ENABLE_AFFINITY 0"},{flag:"-genvall",arg:"",desc:"傳遞所有環境變數"},{flag:"-env",arg:"變數 值",desc:"為單一程式設定環境變數（Hydra）"},{flag:"-wdir",arg:"目錄",desc:"工作目錄"},{flag:"-launcher",arg:"方式",desc:"遠端啟動方式（ssh、rsh、slurm、ll…）"},{flag:"-bootstrap",arg:"方式",desc:"同 -launcher（Hydra）"},{flag:"-prepend-rank",arg:"",desc:"在每行輸出前加上行程編號"},{flag:"-l",arg:"",desc:"同 -prepend-rank"},{flag:"-oversubscribe",arg:"",desc:"允許行程數超過核心數（Open MPI）"},{flag:"--mca",arg:"參數 值",desc:"設定 Open MPI 元件參數（例如 btl ^openib）"},{flag:"-verbose",arg:"",desc:"顯示啟動過程"},{flag:"-v",arg:"",desc:"顯示啟動過程（詳細）"},{flag:"-iface",arg:"介面",desc:"使用的網路介面"},{flag:"-nolocal",arg:"",desc:"不在本機啟動行程"},{flag:"-launcher-exec",arg:"程式",desc:"指定遠端啟動程式"},{flag:"--allow-run-as-root",arg:"",desc:"允許以 root 執行（Open MPI）"}],subs:{},lists:{}},mpicc:{name:"mpicc",aliases:["mpicxx","mpic++","mpif90","mpifort","mpif77","mpicc.mpich","mpicxx.mpich"],summary:"MPI 編譯包裝：呼叫底層編譯器並自動加上 MPI 的標頭路徑與函式庫（用法同 gcc／g++／gfortran）",synopsis:"mpicc [選項] 檔案... -o 輸出",options:[{flag:"-show",arg:"",desc:"只印出實際呼叫的完整編譯命令，不執行（MPICH／MVAPICH2）"},{flag:"-showme",arg:"",desc:"只印出實際呼叫的完整編譯命令，不執行（Open MPI）"},{flag:"-cc=*",arg:"",desc:"指定底層 C 編譯器 {v}（MPICH／MVAPICH2）"},{flag:"-cxx=*",arg:"",desc:"指定底層 C++ 編譯器 {v}"},{flag:"-compile-info",arg:"",desc:"顯示編譯時的選項（MPICH）"},{flag:"-link-info",arg:"",desc:"顯示連結時的選項（MPICH）"},{flag:"-c",arg:"",desc:"只編譯與組譯成目的檔（.o），不連結"},{flag:"-S",arg:"",desc:"只編譯成組合語言（.s），不組譯"},{flag:"-E",arg:"",desc:"只做前處理（展開 #include、巨集），結果輸出到標準輸出"},{flag:"-o",arg:"檔案",desc:"指定輸出檔名"},{flag:"-x",arg:"語言",desc:"指定輸入檔語言而不看副檔名（c、c++、assembler、assembler-with-cpp、none）"},{flag:"-O0",arg:"",desc:"不最佳化（預設）；編譯最快，除錯最方便"},{flag:"-O1",arg:"",desc:"基本最佳化"},{flag:"-O2",arg:"",desc:"常用的一般最佳化（不含以空間換時間的展開）；發行版預設選擇"},{flag:"-O3",arg:"",desc:"積極最佳化：更多內聯、迴圈展開與向量化；程式碼可能變大"},{flag:"-Os",arg:"",desc:"為縮小程式碼而最佳化（嵌入式常用）"},{flag:"-Oz",arg:"",desc:"比 -Os 更積極縮小（clang）"},{flag:"-Og",arg:"",desc:"為除錯體驗做的最佳化（除錯建置建議）"},{flag:"-Ofast",arg:"",desc:"-O3 加上不嚴格遵守標準的數學最佳化（-ffast-math）；浮點結果可能不同"},{flag:"-g",arg:"",desc:"產生除錯資訊（預設 DWARF），讓 gdb 能顯示原始碼與變數"},{flag:"-g0",arg:"",desc:"不產生除錯資訊"},{flag:"-g1",arg:"",desc:"最少的除錯資訊（只有回溯所需）"},{flag:"-g2",arg:"",desc:"一般除錯資訊（與 -g 相同）"},{flag:"-g3",arg:"",desc:"除錯資訊含巨集定義"},{flag:"-ggdb",arg:"",desc:"產生 gdb 最適用的除錯資訊格式"},{flag:"-gdwarf-*",arg:"",desc:"指定 DWARF 版本 {v}"},{flag:"-Wall",arg:"",desc:"開啟大多數有用的警告（並不是「全部」）"},{flag:"-Wextra",arg:"",desc:"開啟額外的警告（未使用參數、比較有號與無號等）"},{flag:"-Werror",arg:"",desc:"把警告當成錯誤，有警告就編譯失敗"},{flag:"-Werror=*",arg:"",desc:"只把指定警告 {v} 當成錯誤"},{flag:"-Wpedantic",arg:"",desc:"嚴格依標準給出警告"},{flag:"-pedantic",arg:"",desc:"嚴格依 ISO 標準，拒絕非標準擴充"},{flag:"-pedantic-errors",arg:"",desc:"違反標準的地方直接當成錯誤"},{flag:"-Wno-*",arg:"",desc:"關閉警告 {v}"},{flag:"-W*",arg:"",desc:"開啟警告 -W{v}（例如 -Wshadow、-Wconversion、-Wformat=2、-Wunused）"},{flag:"-w",arg:"",desc:"關閉所有警告"},{flag:"-std=*",arg:"",desc:"指定語言標準 {v}（c99、c11、c17、gnu11、c++11、c++17、c++20、gnu++17 …）"},{flag:"-ansi",arg:"",desc:"等於 -std=c90"},{flag:"-I*",arg:"",desc:"增加標頭檔搜尋路徑 {v}"},{flag:"-isystem",arg:"目錄",desc:"增加「系統」標頭檔搜尋路徑（警告會被抑制）"},{flag:"-iquote",arg:"目錄",desc:'只用於 #include "..." 的搜尋路徑'},{flag:"-idirafter",arg:"目錄",desc:"搜尋路徑最後才找的目錄"},{flag:"-include",arg:"檔案",desc:"在每個原始檔最前面強制 #include 該檔"},{flag:"-L*",arg:"",desc:"增加函式庫搜尋路徑 {v}（連結階段）"},{flag:"-l*",arg:"",desc:"連結函式庫 lib{v}.so 或 lib{v}.a（例如 -lm 數學、-lpthread 執行緒、-ldl 動態載入、-lrt 即時）"},{flag:"-D*",arg:"",desc:"定義前處理巨集 {v}（-DNAME 等於 -DNAME=1）"},{flag:"-U*",arg:"",desc:"取消定義前處理巨集 {v}"},{flag:"-shared",arg:"",desc:"產生共享函式庫（.so／.dll），通常要搭配 -fPIC"},{flag:"-static",arg:"",desc:"靜態連結：把函式庫打包進可執行檔，不依賴執行時的共享函式庫"},{flag:"-static-libgcc",arg:"",desc:"靜態連結 libgcc"},{flag:"-static-libstdc++",arg:"",desc:"靜態連結 C++ 標準函式庫"},{flag:"-pie",arg:"",desc:"產生位置獨立執行檔（配合 ASLR）"},{flag:"-no-pie",arg:"",desc:"不產生位置獨立執行檔"},{flag:"-rdynamic",arg:"",desc:"把所有符號匯出到動態符號表（讓 dlsym、backtrace_symbols 看得到）"},{flag:"-pthread",arg:"",desc:"啟用 POSIX 執行緒：編譯與連結都需要（等於 -D_REENTRANT -lpthread）"},{flag:"-fopenmp",arg:"",desc:"啟用 OpenMP：處理 #pragma omp 並連結 libgomp"},{flag:"-fopenacc",arg:"",desc:"啟用 OpenACC"},{flag:"-fPIC",arg:"",desc:"產生位置獨立程式碼（共享函式庫必要；大型 GOT 版本）"},{flag:"-fpic",arg:"",desc:"產生位置獨立程式碼（小型 GOT 版本）"},{flag:"-fPIE",arg:"",desc:"產生位置獨立的可執行檔程式碼"},{flag:"-fno-*",arg:"",desc:"關閉功能 -f{v}（例如 -fno-builtin、-fno-exceptions、-fno-rtti、-fno-omit-frame-pointer）"},{flag:"-fsanitize=*",arg:"",desc:"啟用執行期檢查工具：{v}（address 記憶體錯誤、undefined 未定義行為、thread 資料競爭、leak 洩漏）"},{flag:"-fstack-protector",arg:"",desc:"為有陣列的函式加堆疊保護（Canary）"},{flag:"-fstack-protector-strong",arg:"",desc:"更廣泛地加堆疊保護"},{flag:"-fstack-protector-all",arg:"",desc:"為所有函式加堆疊保護"},{flag:"-fvisibility=*",arg:"",desc:"預設符號可見度 {v}（hidden 讓共享函式庫預設不匯出）"},{flag:"-ffunction-sections",arg:"",desc:"每個函式放自己的段，讓連結器能搭配 --gc-sections 移除未使用的函式"},{flag:"-fdata-sections",arg:"",desc:"每個資料物件放自己的段"},{flag:"-flto",arg:"",desc:"連結時最佳化：跨檔案內聯與最佳化（編譯與連結都要加）"},{flag:"-fno-omit-frame-pointer",arg:"",desc:"保留框架指標，讓除錯與效能分析的回溯更準"},{flag:"-fomit-frame-pointer",arg:"",desc:"省略框架指標（-O1 以上預設）"},{flag:"-fno-strict-aliasing",arg:"",desc:"不假設嚴格別名規則（舊程式碼與核心常用）"},{flag:"-ffreestanding",arg:"",desc:"獨立環境：不假設有標準函式庫（核心、啟動碼、韌體）"},{flag:"-fno-builtin",arg:"",desc:"不把 memcpy、printf 等當成內建函式特別處理"},{flag:"-fcommon",arg:"",desc:"未初始化的全域變數放 common 區（GCC 10 起預設是 -fno-common）"},{flag:"-funroll-loops",arg:"",desc:"展開迴圈"},{flag:"-ffast-math",arg:"",desc:"放寬浮點規則以換取速度（不保證 IEEE 精確）"},{flag:"-fno-exceptions",arg:"",desc:"不支援 C++ 例外"},{flag:"-fno-rtti",arg:"",desc:"不產生 C++ 執行期型別資訊"},{flag:"-fprofile-generate",arg:"",desc:"產生剖析資料用的偵測程式碼（PGO 第一步）"},{flag:"-fprofile-use",arg:"",desc:"使用剖析資料最佳化（PGO 第二步）"},{flag:"-fverbose-asm",arg:"",desc:"組合語言輸出附上註解"},{flag:"-fdiagnostics-color=*",arg:"",desc:"診斷訊息上色：{v}"},{flag:"-fmax-errors=*",arg:"",desc:"最多報 {v} 個錯誤就停止"},{flag:"-m32",arg:"",desc:"產生 32 位元程式碼（x86）"},{flag:"-m64",arg:"",desc:"產生 64 位元程式碼（x86）"},{flag:"-mthumb",arg:"",desc:"產生 Thumb 指令集程式碼（ARM，較省空間）"},{flag:"-marm",arg:"",desc:"產生 ARM 指令集程式碼"},{flag:"-march=*",arg:"",desc:"指定目標指令集架構 {v}（例如 x86-64、native 為本機、armv7-a、armv8-a+crypto、rv64gc）"},{flag:"-mtune=*",arg:"",desc:"針對特定處理器調校排程 {v}（不改變可使用的指令）"},{flag:"-mcpu=*",arg:"",desc:"指定目標處理器 {v}（ARM：cortex-a53、cortex-m4 等；同時決定 -march 與 -mtune）"},{flag:"-mfpu=*",arg:"",desc:"指定 ARM 浮點單元 {v}（neon、vfpv4 …）"},{flag:"-mfloat-abi=*",arg:"",desc:"ARM 浮點呼叫慣例 {v}（soft 軟體浮點、softfp、hard 硬體浮點暫存器傳參）"},{flag:"-mabi=*",arg:"",desc:"指定 ABI {v}（RISC-V：lp64d、ilp32 等）"},{flag:"-msse4.2",arg:"",desc:"允許使用 SSE4.2 指令"},{flag:"-mavx",arg:"",desc:"允許使用 AVX 指令"},{flag:"-mavx2",arg:"",desc:"允許使用 AVX2 指令"},{flag:"-mfma",arg:"",desc:"允許使用 FMA（融合乘加）指令"},{flag:"-mno-*",arg:"",desc:"關閉機器相關功能 -m{v}"},{flag:"-m*",arg:"",desc:"機器相關選項 -m{v}（依目標架構而異）"},{flag:"-pipe",arg:"",desc:"用管線取代暫存檔在各階段傳遞資料"},{flag:"-v",arg:"",desc:"顯示詳細的編譯過程（呼叫了哪些子程式、搜尋路徑）"},{flag:"--version",arg:"",desc:"顯示版本"},{flag:"-dumpmachine",arg:"",desc:"印出目標機器三元組（例如 x86_64-linux-gnu、arm-none-eabi）"},{flag:"-dumpversion",arg:"",desc:"印出編譯器版本"},{flag:"-print-search-dirs",arg:"",desc:"印出編譯器搜尋路徑"},{flag:"-print-file-name=*",arg:"",desc:"印出函式庫 {v} 的完整路徑"},{flag:"-save-temps",arg:"",desc:"保留中間檔（.i、.s、.o）"},{flag:"-M",arg:"",desc:"輸出相依規則（Makefile 格式）並停在前處理"},{flag:"-MM",arg:"",desc:"同 -M 但略過系統標頭"},{flag:"-MD",arg:"",desc:"編譯同時輸出 .d 相依檔（含系統標頭）"},{flag:"-MMD",arg:"",desc:"編譯同時輸出 .d 相依檔（不含系統標頭）；Makefile 增量編譯常用"},{flag:"-MP",arg:"",desc:"為每個標頭加一條空目標，避免標頭被刪除時 make 報錯"},{flag:"-MF",arg:"檔案",desc:"指定相依檔輸出位置"},{flag:"-MT",arg:"目標",desc:"指定相依規則的目標名稱"},{flag:"-Wl,*",arg:"",desc:"把逗號分隔的選項 {v} 傳給連結器（例如 -Wl,--gc-sections、-Wl,-rpath,/path、-Wl,-Map=out.map）"},{flag:"-Wa,*",arg:"",desc:"把選項 {v} 傳給組譯器"},{flag:"-Wp,*",arg:"",desc:"把選項 {v} 傳給前處理器"},{flag:"-Xlinker",arg:"選項",desc:"把一個選項原樣傳給連結器"},{flag:"-Xassembler",arg:"選項",desc:"把一個選項原樣傳給組譯器"},{flag:"-T",arg:"腳本",desc:"使用指定的連結器腳本（嵌入式、核心常用）"},{flag:"-nostdlib",arg:"",desc:"不連結標準函式庫與啟動檔"},{flag:"-nostartfiles",arg:"",desc:"不連結標準啟動檔（crt0）"},{flag:"-nodefaultlibs",arg:"",desc:"不連結預設函式庫"},{flag:"-nostdinc",arg:"",desc:"不搜尋標準系統標頭目錄"},{flag:"-specs=*",arg:"",desc:"使用規格檔 {v}（例如 -specs=nosys.specs、nano.specs，嵌入式 newlib 常用）"},{flag:"--sysroot=*",arg:"",desc:"以 {v} 為根目錄搜尋標頭與函式庫（交叉編譯）"},{flag:"-B*",arg:"",desc:"增加編譯器子程式與資料檔的搜尋前綴 {v}"},{flag:"-pg",arg:"",desc:"產生 gprof 剖析用的程式碼"},{flag:"--coverage",arg:"",desc:"產生程式碼覆蓋率資訊（gcov），等於 -fprofile-arcs -ftest-coverage 並連結 gcov"},{flag:"-r",arg:"",desc:"產生可重定位的目的檔（部分連結）"},{flag:"-s",arg:"",desc:"連結後移除符號表（縮小檔案）"},{flag:"-z",arg:"關鍵字",desc:"傳給連結器的 -z 選項（例如 noexecstack、relro、now）"},{flag:"-Q",arg:"",desc:"顯示每個函式編譯時的統計"},{flag:"-H",arg:"",desc:"顯示每個被引入的標頭"},{flag:"-trigraphs",arg:"",desc:"支援三字元序列"},{flag:"-C",arg:"",desc:"前處理時保留註解"},{flag:"-P",arg:"",desc:"前處理時不產生 #line 標記"},{flag:"-undef",arg:"",desc:"不預先定義系統特定的巨集"},{flag:"-fno-common",arg:"",desc:"未初始化全域變數不放 common 區（重複定義會連結失敗）"}],subs:{},lists:{},inherit:"gcc"},nvcc:{name:"nvcc",aliases:["nvcc.exe"],summary:"NVIDIA CUDA 編譯器：把 .cu 拆成主機程式碼（交給 gcc／MSVC）與裝置程式碼（編成 PTX 或 cubin）",synopsis:"nvcc [選項] 檔案.cu -o 輸出",options:[{flag:"-o",arg:"檔案",desc:"輸出檔名"},{flag:"-c",arg:"",desc:"只編譯成目的檔"},{flag:"-arch=*",arg:"",desc:"目標 GPU 架構 {v}（例如 sm_80 為 Ampere；compute_80 只產生 PTX；native 為本機 GPU）"},{flag:"-gencode",arg:"設定",desc:"指定要產生的虛擬與實體架構組合，例如 arch=compute_80,code=sm_80（可重複，產生支援多種 GPU 的 fatbin）"},{flag:"-code=*",arg:"",desc:"要產生的實體架構 {v}"},{flag:"-O0",arg:"",desc:"不最佳化主機程式碼"},{flag:"-O1",arg:"",desc:"主機最佳化等級 1"},{flag:"-O2",arg:"",desc:"主機最佳化等級 2"},{flag:"-O3",arg:"",desc:"主機最佳化等級 3"},{flag:"-G",arg:"",desc:"產生裝置端除錯資訊（會關閉裝置最佳化，變慢，cuda-gdb 用）"},{flag:"-g",arg:"",desc:"產生主機端除錯資訊"},{flag:"-lineinfo",arg:"",desc:"在最佳化的裝置程式碼中保留行號資訊（效能分析用，nsight 可對到原始碼行）"},{flag:"-std=*",arg:"",desc:"C++ 標準 {v}（c++14、c++17、c++20）"},{flag:"-I*",arg:"",desc:"增加標頭路徑 {v}"},{flag:"-L*",arg:"",desc:"增加函式庫路徑 {v}"},{flag:"-l*",arg:"",desc:"連結函式庫 {v}（例如 -lcublas、-lcudnn、-lcurand、-lcufft、-lcudart）"},{flag:"-D*",arg:"",desc:"定義巨集 {v}"},{flag:"-Xcompiler",arg:"選項",desc:"傳給主機編譯器的選項（例如 -Xcompiler -fopenmp,-Wall）"},{flag:"-Xlinker",arg:"選項",desc:"傳給主機連結器的選項"},{flag:"-Xptxas",arg:"選項",desc:"傳給 PTX 組譯器 ptxas（例如 -Xptxas -v 顯示暫存器與共用記憶體用量）"},{flag:"--ptxas-options=*",arg:"",desc:"傳給 ptxas 的選項 {v}（-v 顯示每個核心函式的暫存器、共用記憶體、spill 數）"},{flag:"-maxrregcount=*",arg:"",desc:"限制每個執行緒最多使用 {v} 個暫存器（提高佔用率，可能造成 spill）"},{flag:"--use_fast_math",arg:"",desc:"使用快速但精度較低的數學函式"},{flag:"-ftz=*",arg:"",desc:"把非正規化浮點數視為零 {v}"},{flag:"-prec-div=*",arg:"",desc:"除法精確度 {v}"},{flag:"-prec-sqrt=*",arg:"",desc:"平方根精確度 {v}"},{flag:"-rdc=*",arg:"",desc:"可重定位的裝置程式碼 {v}（true 才能跨檔案呼叫 __device__ 函式，也是動態平行必要）"},{flag:"-dc",arg:"",desc:"編譯成可重定位裝置目的檔（等於 -rdc=true -c）"},{flag:"-dlink",arg:"",desc:"連結可重定位的裝置程式碼"},{flag:"-ptx",arg:"",desc:"只產生 PTX 檔"},{flag:"-cubin",arg:"",desc:"只產生 cubin（特定架構的機器碼）"},{flag:"-fatbin",arg:"",desc:"只產生 fatbin"},{flag:"-keep",arg:"",desc:"保留所有中間檔（可看 .ptx、.cubin）"},{flag:"-lcuda",arg:"",desc:"連結 CUDA 驅動程式 API"},{flag:"-shared",arg:"",desc:"產生共享函式庫"},{flag:"-Xcudafe",arg:"選項",desc:"傳給 CUDA 前端的選項（例如 --diag_suppress=）"},{flag:"-extended-lambda",arg:"",desc:"允許在 __host__ __device__ 與 __global__ 的 lambda 使用擴充語法"},{flag:"--expt-relaxed-constexpr",arg:"",desc:"讓裝置程式碼可呼叫主機的 constexpr 函式"},{flag:"--expt-extended-lambda",arg:"",desc:"同 -extended-lambda"},{flag:"-v",arg:"",desc:"顯示編譯步驟"},{flag:"--version",arg:"",desc:"顯示版本"},{flag:"-ccbin",arg:"編譯器",desc:"指定主機編譯器"},{flag:"-pg",arg:"",desc:"剖析"},{flag:"-t",arg:"數量",desc:"平行編譯多個架構的執行緒數"},{flag:"--threads",arg:"數量",desc:"平行編譯執行緒數"}],subs:{},lists:{}},"nvidia-smi":{name:"nvidia-smi",aliases:["nvidia-smi.exe"],summary:"NVIDIA 系統管理介面：查看與管理 GPU（使用率、記憶體、溫度、執行中的行程、拓撲）",synopsis:"nvidia-smi [選項]",options:[{flag:"-L",arg:"",desc:"列出所有 GPU 與 UUID"},{flag:"-l",arg:"秒數",desc:"每隔幾秒重複顯示"},{flag:"-i",arg:"編號",desc:"只看指定 GPU"},{flag:"-q",arg:"",desc:"顯示所有詳細資訊"},{flag:"-d",arg:"類別",desc:"只顯示指定類別（MEMORY、UTILIZATION、ECC、TEMPERATURE、POWER、CLOCK、PIDS…）"},{flag:"--query-gpu=*",arg:"",desc:"查詢指定欄位 {v}（例如 name,memory.used,utilization.gpu）"},{flag:"--format=*",arg:"",desc:"輸出格式 {v}（csv、noheader、nounits）"},{flag:"-pm",arg:"0|1",desc:"設定持久模式（需要 root）"},{flag:"-pl",arg:"瓦數",desc:"設定功耗上限（需要 root）"},{flag:"-c",arg:"模式",desc:"設定運算模式（DEFAULT、EXCLUSIVE_PROCESS）"},{flag:"-r",arg:"",desc:"重設 GPU"},{flag:"-ac",arg:"設定",desc:"設定應用程式時脈"},{flag:"dmon",arg:"",desc:"持續監看每張 GPU 的功耗、溫度、使用率等"},{flag:"pmon",arg:"",desc:"持續監看每個行程的 GPU 使用"},{flag:"topo",arg:"",desc:"顯示 GPU 與網卡的互連拓撲（topo -m 為矩陣：NV# 為 NVLink、PIX／PXB／PHB／SYS 為不同 PCIe 距離）"},{flag:"nvlink",arg:"",desc:"顯示 NVLink 狀態"},{flag:"mig",arg:"",desc:"管理多執行個體 GPU（MIG）"},{flag:"-mig",arg:"",desc:"啟用或停用 MIG 模式"},{flag:"--gpu-reset",arg:"",desc:"重設 GPU"}],subs:{},lists:{}},"compute-sanitizer":{name:"compute-sanitizer",aliases:["cuda-memcheck"],summary:"NVIDIA 的 CUDA 錯誤檢查工具：偵測越界存取、競爭條件、未初始化記憶體與同步錯誤",synopsis:"compute-sanitizer [選項] 程式 [引數...]",options:[{flag:"--tool",arg:"工具",desc:"檢查工具：memcheck（記憶體錯誤，預設）、racecheck（共用記憶體資料競爭）、initcheck（未初始化的全域記憶體）、synccheck（同步錯誤）"},{flag:"--leak-check",arg:"full|no",desc:"是否回報記憶體洩漏"},{flag:"--show-backtrace",arg:"模式",desc:"是否顯示呼叫堆疊"},{flag:"--log-file",arg:"檔案",desc:"輸出到檔案"},{flag:"--print-limit",arg:"數量",desc:"最多印出幾筆錯誤"},{flag:"--error-exitcode",arg:"碼",desc:"發現錯誤時的退出碼"}],subs:{},lists:{}},"cuda-gdb":{name:"cuda-gdb",aliases:[],summary:"NVIDIA 的 GPU 除錯器（gdb 的擴充）：可在 GPU 核心函式中設中斷點、檢視執行緒與暫存器",synopsis:"cuda-gdb [gdb 選項] 程式",options:[{flag:"-q",arg:"",desc:"不顯示啟動訊息"},{flag:"--args",arg:"",desc:"之後的內容是要除錯的程式與它的命令列引數（gdb --args ./a.out -x 1）"},{flag:"-quiet",arg:"",desc:"不顯示啟動版權訊息"},{flag:"-nx",arg:"",desc:"不讀取任何 .gdbinit 初始化檔"},{flag:"-x",arg:"檔案",desc:"執行指定檔案中的 gdb 命令"},{flag:"-ex",arg:"命令",desc:"執行一條 gdb 命令（可重複）"},{flag:"-iex",arg:"命令",desc:"在載入檔案之前執行一條命令"},{flag:"-batch",arg:"",desc:"批次模式：執行完命令就結束（腳本化、CI）"},{flag:"-p",arg:"行程ID",desc:"附加到執行中的行程"},{flag:"-pid",arg:"行程ID",desc:"附加到執行中的行程"},{flag:"-c",arg:"核心檔",desc:"使用核心傾印檔（core dump）進行事後除錯"},{flag:"-core",arg:"核心檔",desc:"同 -c"},{flag:"-d",arg:"目錄",desc:"加入原始碼搜尋目錄"},{flag:"-cd",arg:"目錄",desc:"以指定目錄為工作目錄"},{flag:"-s",arg:"檔案",desc:"從檔案讀取符號"},{flag:"-e",arg:"檔案",desc:"使用檔案作為可執行檔"},{flag:"-tui",arg:"",desc:"啟動文字介面分割視窗（原始碼＋命令）"},{flag:"-w",arg:"",desc:"使用圖形介面（如果有）"},{flag:"-readnow",arg:"",desc:"一開始就讀完所有符號（啟動慢、之後快）"},{flag:"-b",arg:"速率",desc:"設定序列埠傳輸速率"},{flag:"-l",arg:"逾時",desc:"設定遠端除錯逾時（秒）"},{flag:"-ix",arg:"檔案",desc:"在載入檔案前執行命令檔"},{flag:"--version",arg:"",desc:"顯示版本"},{flag:"-v",arg:"",desc:"顯示版本"},{flag:"--configuration",arg:"",desc:"顯示編譯組態"},{flag:"-return-child-result",arg:"",desc:"結束時使用被除錯程式的退出碼"},{flag:"-silent",arg:"",desc:"不顯示啟動訊息"},{flag:"-dbx",arg:"",desc:"模擬 dbx 指令風格"},{flag:"--eval-command=*",arg:"",desc:"同 -ex：執行命令 {v}"},{flag:"--command=*",arg:"",desc:"同 -x：執行檔案 {v}"},{flag:"--pid=*",arg:"",desc:"附加行程 {v}"},{flag:"--core=*",arg:"",desc:"使用核心檔 {v}"},{flag:"--directory=*",arg:"",desc:"加入原始碼目錄 {v}"},{flag:"--tty=*",arg:"",desc:"被除錯程式的輸出使用終端機 {v}"}],subs:{},lists:{commands:[{name:"run",desc:"啟動被除錯的程式（r）；可帶引數，例如 run -v input.txt"},{name:"start",desc:"在 main 暫停地啟動程式"},{name:"starti",desc:"在第一條指令暫停地啟動（看啟動碼、核心、韌體時用）"},{name:"continue",desc:"繼續執行到下一個中斷點（c）"},{name:"next",desc:"單步執行一行，不進入函式（n）"},{name:"step",desc:"單步執行一行，會進入函式（s）"},{name:"nexti",desc:"單步執行一條機器指令，不進入呼叫（ni）"},{name:"stepi",desc:"單步執行一條機器指令（si）"},{name:"finish",desc:"執行到目前函式返回，並顯示回傳值"},{name:"until",desc:"繼續執行到比目前行更大的行（跳出迴圈）"},{name:"advance",desc:"執行到指定位置"},{name:"return",desc:"立即從目前函式返回（可指定回傳值）"},{name:"jump",desc:"從指定位置繼續執行"},{name:"break",desc:"設中斷點（b）：break 函式／break 檔案:行／break *位址／break 位置 if 條件"},{name:"tbreak",desc:"設一次性中斷點"},{name:"rbreak",desc:"對符合正則表示式的所有函式設中斷點"},{name:"watch",desc:"設監看點：變數被寫入時暫停"},{name:"rwatch",desc:"變數被讀取時暫停"},{name:"awatch",desc:"變數被讀或寫時暫停"},{name:"catch",desc:"設攔截點（系統呼叫 syscall、訊號 signal、例外 throw／catch、載入 load、fork、exec）"},{name:"delete",desc:"刪除中斷點／顯示表達式"},{name:"disable",desc:"停用中斷點"},{name:"enable",desc:"啟用中斷點"},{name:"condition",desc:"為中斷點設定條件"},{name:"ignore",desc:"忽略中斷點的前 N 次命中"},{name:"commands",desc:"為中斷點設定命中時自動執行的命令"},{name:"info",desc:"顯示資訊：info breakpoints／registers／locals／args／frame／threads／sharedlibrary／signals／proc／files／line／symbol"},{name:"backtrace",desc:"顯示呼叫堆疊（bt）；bt full 連同區域變數"},{name:"frame",desc:"選擇堆疊框（f 編號）"},{name:"up",desc:"往上一層呼叫者"},{name:"down",desc:"往下一層"},{name:"print",desc:"顯示表達式的值（p）：p var、p *ptr、p arr[0]@10 顯示 10 個元素、p/x 以十六進位"},{name:"x",desc:"檢視記憶體：x/NFU 位址（N 數量、F 格式 x d u o t a c f s i、U 單位 b h w g）；例如 x/16xb $sp、x/8i $pc 看反組譯"},{name:"display",desc:"每次暫停都自動顯示的表達式"},{name:"undisplay",desc:"取消自動顯示"},{name:"output",desc:"只輸出值，不加編號與換行"},{name:"set",desc:"設定變數或選項：set var x=1、set args、set listsize、set disassembly-flavor intel、set confirm off、set pagination off"},{name:"show",desc:"顯示 gdb 設定"},{name:"list",desc:"顯示原始碼（l）"},{name:"disassemble",desc:"反組譯函式或範圍（disas）；disassemble /s 夾雜原始碼，/r 顯示機器碼"},{name:"ptype",desc:"顯示型別的完整定義"},{name:"whatis",desc:"顯示表達式的型別"},{name:"file",desc:"載入要除錯的執行檔與符號"},{name:"symbol-file",desc:"載入符號檔"},{name:"add-symbol-file",desc:"在指定位址載入額外符號（動態載入模組、核心模組）"},{name:"core-file",desc:"載入核心傾印"},{name:"attach",desc:"附加到執行中的行程"},{name:"detach",desc:"與行程分離，讓它繼續跑"},{name:"kill",desc:"結束被除錯的程式"},{name:"quit",desc:"離開 gdb（q）"},{name:"target",desc:"指定除錯目標：target remote host:port 連到 gdbserver 或 QEMU 的 gdb stub；target extended-remote"},{name:"monitor",desc:"傳送命令給遠端目標（例如 QEMU 的 monitor：monitor info registers）"},{name:"load",desc:"把程式載入到遠端目標（嵌入式燒錄）"},{name:"thread",desc:"切換或顯示執行緒"},{name:"inferior",desc:"管理被除錯行程"},{name:"signal",desc:"以指定訊號繼續執行"},{name:"handle",desc:"設定 gdb 如何處理訊號（handle SIGUSR1 nostop noprint pass）"},{name:"source",desc:"執行命令檔"},{name:"define",desc:"定義自己的命令"},{name: