eBindGroup({ layout: pipe.getBindGroupLayout(0), entries: entries });\n  const enc = dev.createCommandEncoder();\n  const pass = enc.beginComputePass();\n  pass.setPipeline(pipe); pass.setBindGroup(0, bg);\n  // 超過單維 65535 個工作群組時改二維派發；著色器以 gid.x + gid.y·4194240（=65535×64）還原扁平索引\n  // groups 給陣列 [x, y, z] 時照三維派發（平鋪矩陣乘用：x 是欄方向的平鋪、y 是列方向、z 是批次）\n  if (Array.isArray(groups)) pass.dispatchWorkgroups(groups[0], groups[1] || 1, groups[2] || 1);\n  else if (groups > 65535) pass.dispatchWorkgroups(65535, Math.ceil(groups / 65535)); else pass.dispatchWorkgroups(groups);\n  pass.end();\n  const rb = bufs.map((b) => (b.out ? dev.createBuffer({ size: b.data.byteLength, usage: USAGE.MAP_READ | USAGE.COPY_DST }) : null));\n  bufs.forEach((b, i) => { if (b.out) enc.copyBufferToBuffer(objs[i], 0, rb[i], 0, b.data.byteLength); });\n  dev.queue.submit([enc.finish()]);\n  const outs = [];\n  for (let i = 0; i < bufs.length; i++) {\n    if (!bufs[i].out) continue;\n    await rb[i].mapAsync(1);\n    outs.push(new (bufs[i].data.constructor === Int32Array ? Int32Array : Float32Array)(rb[i].getMappedRange().slice(0)));\n    rb[i].unmap(); if (rb[i].destroy) rb[i].destroy();\n  }\n  objs.forEach((buf, i) => { if (!bufs[i].cache && buf.destroy) buf.destroy(); });\n  if (ub.destroy) ub.destroy();\n  return outs;\n}\n\n// 先試 T1；沒有 WebGPU、或執行失敗就退到 CPU 參考版，原因照實寫進 info\n// 三層：T1（WGSL）→ T3（WebGL2）→ cpu-js。每一層失敗都把原因接到 reason。\nasync function tryLayers(name, opts, gpuFn, glFn, refFn) {\n  const o = opts || {};\n  const nav = o.navigator !== undefined ? o.navigator : (typeof navigator !== 'undefined' ? navigator : undefined);\n  const notes = [];\n  const glAvail = glSupport(getGl(o)).ok && !!glFn ? 'native' : 'missing';  // webgl2 欄位回報「這個核心的 WebGL2 層是否可用」\n  const g = await getDevice(nav);\n  if (g.dev) {\n    try { return { result: await gpuFn(g.dev), info: layerInfo(name, 'T1', '', glAvail) }; }\n    catch (e) { notes.push('WGSL 執行失敗：' + String((e && e.message) || e)); }\n  } else notes.push(g.reason);\n  const gl = getGl(o);\n  const gs = glSupport(gl);\n  let glState = 'missing';\n  if (gs.ok && glFn) {\n    glState = 'native';\n    try { return { result: glFn(gl), info: layerInfo(name, 'T3', notes.join('；'), 'native') }; }\n    catch (e) { glState = 'failed'; notes.push('WebGL2 執行失敗：' + String((e && e.message) || e)); }\n  } else if (!gs.ok) notes.push(gs.reason);\n  else notes.push('WebGL2 版尚未實作（此核心）');\n  // refFn 可以是非同步的（例如純 CPU 池）：這裡一律 await，同步的參考實作照常\n  return { result: await refFn(), info: layerInfo(name, 'cpu-js', notes.join('；'), glState) };\n}\nfunction layerInfo(op, layer, reason, webgl2) {\n  return { lib: 'cudaweb-nn', op: op, layer: layer, reason: reason || '', webgl2: webgl2 };\n}\n\n// ---------- RMSNorm ----------\n// y[t,i] = x[t,i] · g[i] / sqrt(mean_i(x[t,·]²) + eps)；x 為 T×d 列主序\nfunction rmsnormRef(x, g, T, d, eps) {\n  if (x.length !== T * d) throw new Error('rmsnorm：x 的長度 ' + x.length + ' 與 T×d=' + (T * d) + ' 不符');\n  if (g.length !== d) throw new Error('rmsnorm：g 的長度 ' + g.length + ' 與 d=' + d + ' 不符');\n  const y = new Float64Array(T * d);\n  for (let t = 0; t < T; t++) {\n    let s = 0;\n    for (let i = 0; i < d; i++) s += x[t * d + i] * x[t * d + i];\n    const inv = 1 / Math.sqrt(s / d + eps);\n    for (let i = 0; i < d; i++) y[t * d + i] = x[t * d + i] * inv * g[i];\n  }\n  return y;\n}\n\nconst WGSL_RMSNORM = `\nstruct P { rows: u32, d: u32, eps: f32, pad: u32 }\n@group(0) @binding(0) var<storage, read> x: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(1) var<storage, read> g: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(2) var<storage, read_write> y: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(3) var<uniform> p: P;\n// @kernel rmsnorm\n@compute @workgroup_size(64)\nfn main(@builtin(global_invocation_id) gid: vec3<u32>) {\n  let r = gid.x;\n  if (r >= p.rows) { return; }\n  var s: f32 = 0.0;\n  for (var i: u32 = 0u; i < p.d; i = i + 1u) { let v = x[r * p.d + i]; s = s + v * v; }\n  let inv = 1.0 / sqrt(s / f32(p.d) + p.eps);\n  for (var i: u32 = 0u; i < p.d; i = i + 1u) { y[r * p.d + i] = x[r * p.d + i] * inv * g[i]; }\n}\n`;\n\n// WebGL2 片段著色器：每個輸出像素算自己那一列的平方和（單趟、不用多趟縮減；列長度小時成本可接受，大列再改多趟）\nconst FS_RMSNORM = `#version 300 es\nprecision highp float;\nprecision highp int;\n// @kernel rmsnorm\nuniform highp sampler2D uX;\nuniform highp sampler2D uG;\nuniform int uW;\nuniform int uRows;\nuniform int uD;\nuniform float uEps;\nout vec4 fragColor;\nfloat fetchX(int i) { return texelFetch(uX, ivec2(i % uW, i / uW), 0).r; }\nfloat fetchG(int i) { return texelFetch(uG, ivec2(i % uW, i / uW), 0).r; }\nvoid main() {\n  int idx = int(gl_FragCoord.y) * uW + int(gl_FragCoord.x);\n  if (idx >= uRows * uD) { fragColor = vec4(0.0); return; }\n  int row = idx / uD;\n  int i = idx - row * uD;\n  float s = 0.0;\n  for (int j = 0; j < uD; j++) { float v = fetchX(row * uD + j); s += v * v; }\n  float inv = 1.0 / sqrt(s / float(uD) + uEps);\n  fragColor = vec4(fetchX(idx) * inv * fetchG(i), 0.0, 0.0, 1.0);\n}\n`;\n\nasync function rmsnorm(x, g, T, d, eps, opts) {\n  const xf = Float32Array.from(x), gf = Float32Array.from(g);\n  return tryLayers('rmsnorm', opts,\n    async (dev) => {\n      const uni = new ArrayBuffer(16);\n      new Uint32Array(uni, 0, 2).set([T, d]);\n      new Float32Array(uni, 8, 1)[0] = eps;\n      const outs = await runWgsl(dev, WGSL_RMSNORM,\n        [{ data: xf, out: false }, { data: gf, out: false }, { data: new Float32Array(T * d), out: true }],\n        uni, Math.ceil(T / 64));\n      return outs[0];\n    },\n    (gl) => glRun(gl, FS_RMSNORM, [xf, gf], { i: { uRows: T, uD: d }, f: { uEps: eps } }, T * d, ['uX', 'uG']),\n    () => rmsnormRef(xf, gf, T, d, eps));\n}\n\n// ---------- softmax（沿最後一維，數值穩定：先減最大值）----------\n// x 為 rows×cols 列主序；每列獨立\nfunction softmaxRef(x, rows, cols) {\n  if (x.length !== rows * cols) throw new Error('softmax：x 的長度 ' + x.length + ' 與 rows×cols=' + (rows * cols) + ' 不符');\n  const y = new Float64Array(rows * cols);\n  for (let r = 0; r < rows; r++) {\n    let mx = -Infinity;\n    for (let c = 0; c < cols; c++) if (x[r * cols + c] > mx) mx = x[r * cols + c];\n    let s = 0;\n    for (let c = 0; c < cols; c++) { const e = Math.exp(x[r * cols + c] - mx); y[r * cols + c] = e; s += e; }\n    for (let c = 0; c < cols; c++) y[r * cols + c] /= s;\n  }\n  return y;\n}\n\nconst WGSL_SOFTMAX = `\nstruct P { rows: u32, cols: u32, pad0: u32, pad1: u32 }\n@group(0) @binding(0) var<storage, read> x: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(1) var<storage, read_write> y: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(2) var<uniform> p: P;\n// @kernel softmax\n@compute @workgroup_size(64)\nfn main(@builtin(global_invocation_id) gid: vec3<u32>) {\n  let r = gid.x;\n  if (r >= p.rows) { return; }\n  var mx: f32 = x[r * p.cols];\n  for (var c: u32 = 1u; c < p.cols; c = c + 1u) { mx = max(mx, x[r * p.cols + c]); }\n  var s: f32 = 0.0;\n  for (var c: u32 = 0u; c < p.cols; c = c + 1u) { let e = exp(x[r * p.cols + c] - mx); y[r * p.cols + c] = e; s = s + e; }\n  for (var c: u32 = 0u; c < p.cols; c = c + 1u) { y[r * p.cols + c] = y[r * p.cols + c] / s; }\n}\n`;\n\n// WebGL2 片段著色器：每個輸出像素對自己那一列取最大值與指數和（單趟）\nconst FS_SOFTMAX = `#version 300 es\nprecision highp float;\nprecision highp int;\n// @kernel softmax\nuniform highp sampler2D uX;\nuniform int uW;\nuniform int uRows;\nuniform int uCols;\nout vec4 fragColor;\nfloat fetchX(int i) { return texelFetch(uX, ivec2(i % uW, i / uW), 0).r; }\nvoid main() {\n  int idx = int(gl_FragCoord.y) * uW + int(gl_FragCoord.x);\n  if (idx >= uRows * uCols) { fragColor = vec4(0.0); return; }\n  int row = idx / uCols;\n  float mx = fetchX(row * uCols);\n  for (int c = 1; c < uCols; c++) mx = max(mx, fetchX(row * uCols + c));\n  float s = 0.0;\n  for (int c = 0; c < uCols; c++) s += exp(fetchX(row * uCols + c) - mx);\n  fragColor = vec4(exp(fetchX(idx) - mx) / s, 0.0, 0.0, 1.0);\n}\n`;\n\nasync function softmax(x, rows, cols, opts) {\n  const xf = Float32Array.from(x);\n  return tryLayers('softmax', opts,\n    async (dev) => {\n      const uni = new ArrayBuffer(16);\n      new Uint32Array(uni, 0, 2).set([rows, cols]);\n      const outs = await runWgsl(dev, WGSL_SOFTMAX,\n        [{ data: xf, out: false }, { data: new Float32Array(rows * cols), out: true }],\n        uni, Math.ceil(rows / 64));\n      return outs[0];\n    },\n    (gl) => glRun(gl, FS_SOFTMAX, [xf], { i: { uRows: rows, uCols: cols } }, rows * cols, ['uX']),\n    () => softmaxRef(xf, rows, cols));\n}\n\n// ---------- SiLU（逐元素）：y = x · sigmoid(x) = x / (1 + e^(−x)) ----------\nfunction siluRef(x) {\n  const y = new Float64Array(x.length);\n  for (let i = 0; i < x.length; i++) y[i] = x[i] / (1 + Math.exp(-x[i]));\n  return y;\n}\n\nconst WGSL_SILU = `\nstruct P { n: u32, pad0: u32, pad1: u32, pad2: u32 }\n@group(0) @binding(0) var<storage, read> x: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(1) var<storage, read_write> y: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(2) var<uniform> p: P;\n// @kernel silu\n@compute @workgroup_size(64)\nfn main(@builtin(global_invocation_id) gid: vec3<u32>) {\n  let i = gid.x;\n  if (i >= p.n) { return; }\n  let v = x[i];\n  y[i] = v / (1.0 + exp(-v));\n}\n`;\n\n// WebGL2 片段著色器：逐元素 x / (1 + e^(−x))\nconst FS_SILU = `#version 300 es\nprecision highp float;\nprecision highp int;\n// @kernel silu\nuniform highp sampler2D uX;\nuniform int uW;\nuniform int uN;\nout vec4 fragColor;\nvoid main() {\n  int idx = int(gl_FragCoord.y) * uW + int(gl_FragCoord.x);\n  if (idx >= uN) { fragColor = vec4(0.0); return; }\n  float v = texelFetch(uX, ivec2(idx % uW, idx / uW), 0).r;\n  fragColor = vec4(v / (1.0 + exp(-v)), 0.0, 0.0, 1.0);\n}\n`;\n\nasync function silu(x, opts) {\n  const xf = Float32Array.from(x);\n  return tryLayers('silu', opts,\n    async (dev) => {\n      const uni = new ArrayBuffer(16);\n      new Uint32Array(uni, 0, 1).set([xf.length]);\n      const outs = await runWgsl(dev, WGSL_SILU,\n        [{ data: xf, out: false }, { data: new Float32Array(xf.length), out: true }],\n        uni, Math.ceil(xf.length / 64));\n      return outs[0];\n    },\n    (gl) => glRun(gl, FS_SILU, [xf], { i: { uN: xf.length } }, xf.length, ['uX']),\n    () => siluRef(xf));\n}\n\n// ---------- RoPE（旋轉位置編碼）----------\n// x 為 T×(H·hd) 列主序；每個 head 內相鄰兩維一組，角度 θ = t · 10000^(−2i/hd)；dir=−1 為反向（轉置旋轉）\nfunction ropeRef(x, T, H, hd, dir) {\n  if (x.length !== T * H * hd) throw new Error('rope：x 的長度 ' + x.length + ' 與 T×H×hd=' + (T * H * hd) + ' 不符');\n  if (hd % 2 !== 0) throw new Error('rope：hd 必須是偶數（收到 ' + hd + '）');\n  const y = new Float64Array(x.length), d = H * hd;\n  for (let t = 0; t < T; t++) for (let h = 0; h < H; h++) for (let i = 0; i < hd / 2; i++) {\n    const th = t * Math.pow(10000, -2 * i / hd), c = Math.cos(th), s = dir * Math.sin(th);\n    const o = t * d + h * hd + 2 * i;\n    const a = x[o], b = x[o + 1];\n    y[o] = a * c - b * s;\n    y[o + 1] = a * s + b * c;\n  }\n  return y;\n}\n\nconst WGSL_ROPE = `\nstruct P { T: u32, H: u32, hd: u32, dir: f32 }\n@group(0) @binding(0) var<storage, read> x: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(1) var<storage, read_write> y: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(2) var<uniform> p: P;\n// @kernel rope\n@compute @workgroup_size(64)\nfn main(@builtin(global_invocation_id) gid: vec3<u32>) {\n  let hp = p.hd / 2u;\n  let total = p.T * p.H * hp;\n  let k = gid.x;\n  if (k >= total) { return; }\n  let i = k % hp;\n  let h = (k / hp) % p.H;\n  let t = k / (hp * p.H);\n  let d = p.H * p.hd;\n  let th = f32(t) * pow(10000.0, -2.0 * f32(i) / f32(p.hd));\n  let c = cos(th);\n  let s = p.dir * sin(th);\n  let o = t * d + h * p.hd + 2u * i;\n  let a = x[o];\n  let b = x[o + 1u];\n  y[o] = a * c - b * s;\n  y[o + 1u] = a * s + b * c;\n}\n`;\n\n// WebGL2 片段著色器：每個輸出元素依自己在 (t, h, 對) 中的位置，取出同一對的兩個輸入做旋轉\nconst FS_ROPE = `#version 300 es\nprecision highp float;\nprecision highp int;\n// @kernel rope\nuniform highp sampler2D uX;\nuniform int uW;\nuniform int uT;\nuniform int uH;\nuniform int uHd;\nuniform float uDir;\nout vec4 fragColor;\nfloat fetchX(int i) { return texelFetch(uX, ivec2(i % uW, i / uW), 0).r; }\nvoid main() {\n  int idx = int(gl_FragCoord.y) * uW + int(gl_FragCoord.x);\n  int d = uH * uHd;\n  if (idx >= uT * d) { fragColor = vec4(0.0); return; }\n  int t = idx / d;\n  int rem = idx - t * d;\n  int r2 = rem % uHd;\n  int i = r2 / 2;\n  int o = idx - (r2 - 2 * i);\n  float th = float(t) * pow(10000.0, -2.0 * float(i) / float(uHd));\n  float c = cos(th);\n  float s = uDir * sin(th);\n  float a = fetchX(o);\n  float b = fetchX(o + 1);\n  float v = (r2 == 2 * i) ? (a * c - b * s) : (a * s + b * c);\n  fragColor = vec4(v, 0.0, 0.0, 1.0);\n}\n`;\n\nasync function rope(x, T, H, hd, dir, opts) {\n  const xf = Float32Array.from(x);\n  return tryLayers('rope', opts,\n    async (dev) => {\n      const uni = new ArrayBuffer(16);\n      new Uint32Array(uni, 0, 3).set([T, H, hd]);\n      new Float32Array(uni, 12, 1)[0] = dir;\n      const outs = await runWgsl(dev, WGSL_ROPE,\n        [{ data: xf, out: false }, { data: new Float32Array(xf.length), out: true }],\n        uni, Math.ceil(T * H * (hd / 2) / 64));\n      return outs[0];\n    },\n    (gl) => glRun(gl, FS_ROPE, [xf], { i: { uT: T, uH: H, uHd: hd }, f: { uDir: dir } }, xf.length, ['uX']),\n    () => ropeRef(xf, T, H, hd, dir));\n}\n\n// ---------- AdamW（逐元素，解耦權重衰減）----------\n// m ← b1·m + (1−b1)·g；v ← b2·v + (1−b2)·g²；p ← p − lr·wd·p − lr·(m/c1)/(sqrt(v/c2)+eps)\n// c1 = 1−b1^t、c2 = 1−b2^t 由主機算好傳入。wd=0 時與 lora_ref_train.js 的 adamStep 相同公式。\nfunction adamwCore(p, g, m, v, lr, b1, b2, eps, wd, c1, c2) {\n  const n = p.length, P2 = new Float64Array(n), M2 = new Float64Array(n), V2 = new Float64Array(n);\n  for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n    M2[i] = b1 * m[i] + (1 - b1) * g[i];\n    V2[i] = b2 * v[i] + (1 - b2) * g[i] * g[i];\n    P2[i] = p[i] - lr * wd * p[i] - lr * (M2[i] / c1) / (Math.sqrt(V2[i] / c2) + eps);\n  }\n  return { p: P2, m: M2, v: V2 };\n}\nfunction adamwRef(p, g, m, v, t, lr, b1, b2, eps, wd) {\n  if (p.length !== g.length || p.length !== m.length || p.length !== v.length) throw new Error('adamw：p、g、m、v 長度不同');\n  return adamwCore(p, g, m, v, lr, b1, b2, eps, wd, 1 - Math.pow(b1, t), 1 - Math.pow(b2, t));\n}\n\nconst WGSL_ADAMW = `\nstruct P { n: u32, lr: f32, b1: f32, b2: f32, eps: f32, wd: f32, c1: f32, c2: f32 }\n@group(0) @binding(0) var<storage, read_write> pp: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(1) var<storage, read> gg: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(2) var<storage, read_write> mm: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(3) var<storage, read_write> vv: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(4) var<uniform> u: P;\n// @kernel adamw\n@compute @workgroup_size(64)\nfn main(@builtin(global_invocation_id) gid: vec3<u32>) {\n  let i = gid.x;\n  if (i >= u.n) { return; }\n  let g = gg[i];\n  let m2 = u.b1 * mm[i] + (1.0 - u.b1) * g;\n  let v2 = u.b2 * vv[i] + (1.0 - u.b2) * g * g;\n  let p0 = pp[i];\n  mm[i] = m2;\n  vv[i] = v2;\n  pp[i] = p0 - u.lr * u.wd * p0 - u.lr * (m2 / u.c1) / (sqrt(v2 / u.c2) + u.eps);\n}\n`;\n\n// WebGL2：AdamW 三個輸出各一趟（不用多個 draw buffer）。每趟都從四個輸入重算 m2、v2，所以三趟互不依賴。\nfunction fsAdamw(tag, outExpr) {\n  return `#version 300 es\nprecision highp float;\nprecision highp int;\n// @kernel ${tag}\nuniform highp sampler2D uP;\nuniform highp sampler2D uG;\nuniform highp sampler2D uM;\nuniform highp sampler2D uV;\nuniform int uW;\nuniform int uN;\nuniform float uLr;\nuniform float uB1;\nuniform float uB2;\nuniform float uEps;\nuniform float uWd;\nuniform float uC1;\nuniform float uC2;\nout vec4 fragColor;\nfloat fetch(sampler2D t, int i) { return texelFetch(t, ivec2(i % uW, i / uW), 0).r; }\nvoid main() {\n  int idx = int(gl_FragCoord.y) * uW + int(gl_FragCoord.x);\n  if (idx >= uN) { fragColor = vec4(0.0); return; }\n  float p = fetch(uP, idx);\n  float g = fetch(uG, idx);\n  float m = fetch(uM, idx);\n  float v = fetch(uV, idx);\n  float m2 = uB1 * m + (1.0 - uB1) * g;\n  float v2 = uB2 * v + (1.0 - uB2) * g * g;\n  fragColor = vec4(${outExpr}, 0.0, 0.0, 1.0);\n}\n`;\n}\nconst FS_ADAMW_P = fsAdamw('adamw_p', 'p - uLr * uWd * p - uLr * (m2 / uC1) / (sqrt(v2 / uC2) + uEps)');\nconst FS_ADAMW_M = fsAdamw('adamw_m', 'm2');\nconst FS_ADAMW_V = fsAdamw('adamw_v', 'v2');\n\nasync function adamw(p, g, m, v, t, lr, b1, b2, eps, wd, opts) {\n  const pf = Float32Array.from(p), gf = Float32Array.from(g), mf = Float32Array.from(m), vf = Float32Array.from(v);\n  const n = pf.length;\n  return tryLayers('adamw', opts,\n    async (dev) => {\n      const c1 = 1 - Math.pow(b1, t), c2 = 1 - Math.pow(b2, t);\n      const uni = new ArrayBuffer(32);\n      new Uint32Array(uni, 0, 1)[0] = n;\n      const fl = new Float32Array(uni, 4, 7);\n      fl.set([lr, b1, b2, eps, wd, c1, c2]);\n      const outs = await runWgsl(dev, WGSL_ADAMW,\n        [{ data: pf, out: true }, { data: gf, out: false }, { data: mf, out: true }, { data: vf, out: true }],\n        uni, Math.ceil(n / 64));\n      return { p: outs[0], m: outs[1], v: outs[2] };\n    },\n    (gl) => {\n      const c1 = 1 - Math.pow(b1, t), c2 = 1 - Math.pow(b2, t);\n      const ins = [pf, gf, mf, vf], names = ['uP', 'uG', 'uM', 'uV'];\n      const uni = { i: { uN: n }, f: { uLr: lr, uB1: b1, uB2: b2, uEps: eps, uWd: wd, uC1: c1, uC2: c2 } };\n      return {\n        p: glRun(gl, FS_ADAMW_P, ins, uni, n, names),\n        m: glRun(gl, FS_ADAMW_M, ins, uni, n, names),\n        v: glRun(gl, FS_ADAMW_V, ins, uni, n, names),\n      };\n    },\n    () => adamwRef(pf, gf, mf, vf, t, lr, b1, b2, eps, wd));\n}\n\n// ---------- 交叉熵（O8）：前向 loss 與反向 dl 一次派發，一個工作群組算一列 ----------\n// 輸入 lg（T×V f32）、tg（T 個 u32 目標）、invT（=1/T）。輸出 dl（T×V）＝(softmax − onehot)·invT，rows（T）＝每列 −log p_t（未除 T）。\n// 主機把 rows 加總再除以 T 得到平均 loss。數值：列內先取最大值（數值穩定），再 exp 求和。\nconst WGSL_CE = `\nstruct P { T: u32, V: u32, invT: f32 }\n@group(0) @binding(0) var<storage, read> lg: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(1) var<storage, read> tg: array<u32>;\n@group(0) @binding(2) var<storage, read_write> dl: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(3) var<storage, read_write> rows: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(4) var<uniform> u: P;\nvar<workgroup> red: array<f32, 64>;\n// @kernel cross_entropy\n@compute @workgroup_size(64)\nfn main(@builtin(workgroup_id) wid: vec3<u32>, @builtin(local_invocation_id) lid: vec3<u32>) {\n  let row = wid.x;\n  let t = lid.x;\n  let base = row * u.V;\n  var mx: f32 = -3.0e38;\n  for (var j: u32 = t; j < u.V; j = j + 64u) { mx = max(mx, lg[base + j]); }\n  red[t] = mx;\n  workgroupBarrier();\n  for (var s: u32 = 32u; s > 0u; s = s >> 1u) { if (t < s) { red[t] = max(red[t], red[t + s]); } workgroupBarrier(); }\n  let rmax = red[0];\n  workgroupBarrier();\n  var sm: f32 = 0.0;\n  for (var j: u32 = t; j < u.V; j = j + 64u) { sm = sm + exp(lg[base + j] - rmax); }\n  red[t] = sm;\n  workgroupBarrier();\n  for (var s: u32 = 32u; s > 0u; s = s >> 1u) { if (t < s) { red[t] = red[t] + red[t + s]; } workgroupBarrier(); }\n  let total = red[0];\n  let tgt = tg[row];\n  for (var j: u32 = t; j < u.V; j = j + 64u) {\n    let p = exp(lg[base + j] - rmax) / total;\n    var one: f32 = 0.0;\n    if (j == tgt) { one = 1.0; }\n    dl[base + j] = (p - one) * u.invT;\n  }\n  if (t == 0u) { rows[row] = log(total) - (lg[base + tgt] - rmax); }\n}\n`;\n// f64 參考：rows[t] = −log p_t；dl = (p − onehot)·invT。\nfunction crossEntropyRef(lg, tg, T, V, invT) {\n  const rows = new Float64Array(T), dl = new Float64Array(T * V);\n  for (let t = 0; t < T; t++) {\n    let mx = -Infinity; for (let j = 0; j < V; j++) if (lg[t * V + j] > mx) mx = lg[t * V + j];\n    let s = 0; for (let j = 0; j < V; j++) s += Math.exp(lg[t * V + j] - mx);\n    rows[t] = Math.log(s) - (lg[t * V + tg[t]] - mx);\n    for (let j = 0; j < V; j++) dl[t * V + j] = (Math.exp(lg[t * V + j] - mx) / s - (j === tg[t] ? 1 : 0)) * invT;\n  }\n  return { rows, dl };\n}\n// 獨立呼叫（與其他運算一樣走三層降級）。回傳 { result: { loss（平均）, dl }, info }。\nasync function crossEntropy(lg, tg, T, V, opts) {\n  if (T > 65535) throw new Error('cross_entropy：T 超過 65535（一列一個工作群組，單維派發上限）');\n  const invT = 1 / T;\n  return tryLayers('cross_entropy', opts,\n    async (dev) => {\n      const uni = new ArrayBuffer(16); new Uint32Array(uni, 0, 2).set([T, V]); new Float32Array(uni, 8, 1)[0] = invT;\n      const outs = await runWgsl(dev, WGSL_CE,\n        [{ data: Float32Array.from(lg), out: false }, { data: Uint32Array.from(tg), out: false },\n          { data: new Float32Array(T * V), out: true }, { data: new Float32Array(T), out: true }],\n        uni, T);\n      const rows = outs[1]; let s = 0; for (let t = 0; t < T; t++) s += rows[t];\n      return { loss: s / T, dl: outs[0] };\n    },\n    null,\n    () => { const r = crossEntropyRef(lg, tg, T, V, invT); let s = 0; for (let t = 0; t < T; t++) s += r.rows[t]; return { loss: s / T, dl: r.dl }; });\n}\n\n// ---------- 逐元素批次運算（O8 每層一次提交用）：axpy、mul、scal ----------\nconst WGSL_AXPY_B = `\nstruct P { n: u32, s: f32 }\n@group(0) @binding(0) var<storage, read> xa: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(1) var<storage, read> xb: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(2) var<storage, read_write> yo: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(3) var<uniform> u: P;\n// @kernel axpy_batch\n@compute @workgroup_size(64)\nfn main(@builtin(global_invocation_id) gid: vec3<u32>) {\n  let i = gid.x; if (i >= u.n) { return; }\n  yo[i] = xa[i] + u.s * xb[i];\n}\n`;\nconst WGSL_MUL_B = `\nstruct P { n: u32, s: f32 }\n@group(0) @binding(0) var<storage, read> xa: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(1) var<storage, read> xb: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(2) var<storage, read_write> yo: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(3) var<uniform> u: P;\n// @kernel mul_batch\n@compute @workgroup_size(64)\nfn main(@builtin(global_invocation_id) gid: vec3<u32>) {\n  let i = gid.x; if (i >= u.n) { return; }\n  yo[i] = xa[i] * xb[i];\n}\n`;\nconst WGSL_SCAL_B = `\nstruct P { n: u32, s: f32 }\n@group(0) @binding(0) var<storage, read> xa: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(1) var<storage, read_write> yo: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(2) var<uniform> u: P;\n// @kernel scal_batch\n@compute @workgroup_size(64)\nfn main(@builtin(global_invocation_id) gid: vec3<u32>) {\n  let i = gid.x; if (i >= u.n) { return; }\n  yo[i] = u.s * xa[i];\n}\n`;\n// IEEE 半精度：f32 → f16 位元（就近偶數捨入；溢位成 ±Inf、極小值成次正規數或 0）與反向解碼。\nconst _f32buf = new Float32Array(1), _u32buf = new Uint32Array(_f32buf.buffer);\nfunction f32ToF16Bits(x) {\n  _f32buf[0] = x; const b = _u32buf[0];\n  const sign = (b >>> 16) & 0x8000, exp = (b >>> 23) & 0xff; let mant = b & 0x7fffff;\n  if (exp === 0xff) return sign | 0x7c00 | (mant ? 0x200 : 0);\n  const e = exp - 127 + 15;\n  if (e >= 31) return sign | 0x7c00;\n  if (e <= 0) {\n    if (e < -10) return sign;\n    mant |= 0x800000; const shift = 14 - e; let half = mant >>> shift;\n    const rem = mant & ((1 << shift) - 1), halfway = 1 << (shift - 1);\n    if (rem > halfway || (rem === halfway && (half & 1))) half++;\n    return sign | half;\n  }\n  let half = (e << 10) | (mant >>> 13); const rem = mant & 0x1fff;\n  if (rem > 0x1000 || (rem === 0x1000 && (half & 1))) half++;\n  return sign | half;\n}\nfunction f16ToF32(h) {\n  const s = (h & 0x8000) ? -1 : 1, e = (h >>> 10) & 0x1f, m = h & 0x3ff;\n  if (e === 0) return s * m * Math.pow(2, -24);\n  if (e === 0x1f) return m ? NaN : s * Infinity;\n  return s * (1024 + m) * Math.pow(2, e - 25);\n}\nconst MM_F16_CODE = core.mmTileWgsl({ marker: 'matmul_f16', dtype: 'f16' });\n\n// ---------- 批次提交：同一個 command encoder、中間結果留在 GPU 緩衝區，只在 read() 時回讀 ----------\n// 用法：const b = createBatch(dev); const x = b.upload(arr); const y = b.rmsnorm(x, g, T, d, eps); ...\n//       const [out] = await b.read([[y, n]]);   // 整批只 submit 一次、回讀只在最後\n// 目前涵蓋 RMSNorm、softmax、SiLU、RoPE（同一層內的逐元素與列運算）與 matmul（2026-11-18 加入，與 gpu_core 共用核心）。\n// 注意力、q8mm、MatMulNBits 還沒進批次（見 docs/CHECKLIST.cudaweb-optimize.md 的 O6）。\n// 動態量化（O6，與 infer_ops.quantizeDynamicRef 同一套規則）：兩段。\n// 第一段：單一工作群組求全域最小／最大（先含 0，與參考版一致），算出 scale、zp，寫進 st[0..3] = [mn, mx, scale, zp]。\n// 第二段：逐元素 q = clamp(round(x/scale)+zp, 0, 255) − zp（int32）。scale 為 0 時 scale 記 1、zp 記 0（與參考版一致）。\nconst WGSL_QDYN_STATS = `\n// @kernel qdyn_stats\n@group(0) @binding(0) var<storage, read> x: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(1) var<storage, read_write> st: array<f32>;\nstruct U { n: u32 };\n@group(0) @binding(2) var<uniform> u: U;\nvar<workgroup> smn: array<f32, 256>;\nvar<workgroup> smx: array<f32, 256>;\n@compute @workgroup_size(256)\nfn main(@builtin(local_invocation_id) lid: vec3<u32>) {\n  let t = lid.x;\n  var mn: f32 = 0.0;\n  var mx: f32 = 0.0;\n  var i: u32 = t;\n  loop {\n    if (i >= u.n) { break; }\n    let v = x[i];\n    mn = min(mn, v);\n    mx = max(mx, v);\n    i = i + 256u;\n  }\n  smn[t] = mn;\n  smx[t] = mx;\n  workgroupBarrier();\n  var s: u32 = 128u;\n  loop {\n    if (s == 0u) { break; }\n    if (t < s) {\n      smn[t] = min(smn[t], smn[t + s]);\n      smx[t] = max(smx[t], smx[t + s]);\n    }\n    workgroupBarrier();\n    s = s >> 1u;\n  }\n  if (t == 0u) {\n    let mnv = smn[0];\n    let mxv = smx[0];\n    let scale = (mxv - mnv) / 255.0;\n    var sc: f32 = scale;\n    var zp: f32 = 0.0;\n    if (scale == 0.0) { sc = 1.0; } else { zp = clamp(round(-mnv / scale), 0.0, 255.0); }\n    st[0] = mnv;\n    st[1] = mxv;\n    st[2] = sc;\n    st[3] = zp;\n  }\n}`;\nconst WGSL_QDYN = `\n// @kernel qdyn\n@group(0) @binding(0) var<storage, read> x: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(1) var<storage, read> st: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(2) var<storage, read_write> q: array<i32>;\nstruct U { n: u32 };\n@group(0) @binding(3) var<uniform> u: U;\n@compute @workgroup_size(64)\nfn main(@builtin(global_invocation_id) gid: vec3<u32>) {\n  let i = gid.x;\n  if (i >= u.n) { return; }\n  let sc = st[2];\n  let zp = st[3];\n  let qf = clamp(round(x[i] / sc) + zp, 0.0, 255.0);\n  q[i] = i32(qf) - i32(zp);\n}`;\n// O7 融合：單列（解碼 T=1）的 RMSNorm＋動態量化，一個工作群組（256 執行緒）一次派發完成。\n// 步驟：平方和（並行歸約）→ inv → 每個元素 v = x·inv·g（寫進 y，給殘差或需要時用）→ min／max 歸約 → scale、zp 寫進 st → 逐元素量化（重算 v，不讀 y，避免儲存緩衝的跨執行緒可見性問題）。\n// 與「rmsnorm（每列一個執行緒、逐元素串列）＋quantizeDyn（兩段）」比，派發數 1 對 3。\nconst WGSL_RMSQ_FUSED = `\n// @kernel rmsq_fused\nstruct P { d: u32, eps: f32 }\n@group(0) @binding(0) var<storage, read> x: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(1) var<storage, read> g: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(2) var<storage, read_write> y: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(3) var<storage, read_write> q: array<i32>;\n@group(0) @binding(4) var<storage, read_write> st: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(5) var<uniform> p: P;\nvar<workgroup> sh: array<f32, 256>;\nvar<workgroup> smn: array<f32, 256>;\nvar<workgroup> smx: array<f32, 256>;\n@compute @workgroup_size(256)\nfn main(@builtin(local_invocation_id) lid: vec3<u32>) {\n  let t = lid.x;\n  var s: f32 = 0.0;\n  var i: u32 = t;\n  loop { if (i >= p.d) { break; } let v = x[i]; s = s + v * v; i = i + 256u; }\n  sh[t] = s;\n  workgroupBarrier();\n  var r: u32 = 128u;\n  loop { if (r == 0u) { break; } if (t < r) { sh[t] = sh[t] + sh[t + r]; } workgroupBarrier(); r = r >> 1u; }\n  let inv = 1.0 / sqrt(sh[0] / f32(p.d) + p.eps);\n  var mn: f32 = 0.0;\n  var mx: f32 = 0.0;\n  i = t;\n  loop {\n    if (i >= p.d) { break; }\n    let v = x[i] * inv * g[i];\n    y[i] = v;\n    mn = min(mn, v);\n    mx = max(mx, v);\n    i = i + 256u;\n  }\n  smn[t] = mn;\n  smx[t] = mx;\n  workgroupBarrier();\n  var c: u32 = 128u;\n  loop {\n    if (c == 0u) { break; }\n    if (t < c) { smn[t] = min(smn[t], smn[t + c]); smx[t] = max(smx[t], smx[t + c]); }\n    workgroupBarrier();\n    c = c >> 1u;\n  }\n  let mnv = smn[0];\n  let mxv = smx[0];\n  let scale = (mxv - mnv) / 255.0;\n  var sc: f32 = scale;\n  var zp: f32 = 0.0;\n  if (scale == 0.0) { sc = 1.0; } else { zp = clamp(round(-mnv / scale), 0.0, 255.0); }\n  if (t == 0u) { st[0] = mnv; st[1] = mxv; st[2] = sc; st[3] = zp; }\n  i = t;\n  loop {\n    if (i >= p.d) { break; }\n    let v = x[i] * inv * g[i];\n    q[i] = i32(clamp(round(v / sc) + zp, 0.0, 255.0)) - i32(zp);\n    i = i + 256u;\n  }\n}`;\n// 對照用（O7 拆開量）：單列 RMSNorm，同樣的並行歸約，但只輸出 f32（不量化）。用來分開「rmsnorm 並行化」與「融合」的貢獻。\nconst WGSL_RMS_PAR = `\nstruct P { d: u32, eps: f32 }\n@group(0) @binding(0) var<storage, read> x: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(1) var<storage, read> g: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(2) var<storage, read_write> y: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(3) var<uniform> p: P;\nvar<workgroup> sh: array<f32, 256>;\n@compute @workgroup_size(256)\nfn main(@builtin(local_invocation_id) lid: vec3<u32>) {\n  let t = lid.x;\n  var s: f32 = 0.0;\n  var i: u32 = t;\n  loop { if (i >= p.d) { break; } let v = x[i]; s = s + v * v; i = i + 256u; }\n  sh[t] = s;\n  workgroupBarrier();\n  var r: u32 = 128u;\n  loop { if (r == 0u) { break; } if (t < r) { sh[t] = sh[t] + sh[t + r]; } workgroupBarrier(); r = r >> 1u; }\n  let inv = 1.0 / sqrt(sh[0] / f32(p.d) + p.eps);\n  i = t;\n  loop { if (i >= p.d) { break; } y[i] = x[i] * inv * g[i]; i = i + 256u; }\n}`;\nconst MM_TILED_CODE = core.mmTileWgsl({ marker: 'matmul', dtype: 'f32' });\nconst MM_VEC4_CODE = core.mmTileWgslVec4({ marker: 'matmul_vec4' });\nfunction createBatch(dev) {\n  const enc = dev.createCommandEncoder();\n  let submitted = false;\n  const pool = GP.poolFor(dev);\n  // 這個批次借來的緩衝區；submit 之後整批歸還池（佇列依序執行，之後的寫入排在這次讀取之後，安全）\n  const temps = [];\n  const stats = { dispatches: 0, readbacks: 0, submits: 0, pipelineHits: 0, pipelineMisses: 0, pool: pool.stats };\n  function storage(n) {\n    const buf = pool.acquire(Math.max(4, n * 4), USAGE.STORAGE | USAGE.COPY_SRC | USAGE.COPY_DST);\n    temps.push(buf);\n    return buf;\n  }\n  function upload(arr) { const f = arr instanceof Float32Array ? arr : Float32Array.from(arr); const buf = storage(f.length); dev.queue.writeBuffer(buf, 0, f); return { buf: buf, n: f.length }; }\n  // f16 上傳：每個值存成半精度位元（2 位元組），長度為奇數時補一個 0 讓 writeBuffer 的長度是 4 的倍數\n  function uploadF16(arr) {\n    const n = arr.length, bits = new Uint16Array(n + (n & 1));\n    for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) bits[i] = f32ToF16Bits(arr[i]);\n    const buf = storage(bits.length / 2); dev.queue.writeBuffer(buf, 0, bits);\n    return { buf: buf, n: n, f16: true };\n  }\n  function uploadU32(arr) { const u = arr instanceof Uint32Array ? arr : Uint32Array.from(arr); const buf = storage(u.length); dev.queue.writeBuffer(buf, 0, u); return { buf: buf, n: u.length }; }\n  function dispatch(code, bindBufs, uniform, groups) {\n    if (submitted) throw new Error('批次已經提交，不能再加入運算');\n    const ub = pool.acquire(Math.max(16, Math.ceil(uniform.byteLength / 16) * 16), USAGE.UNIFORM | USAGE.COPY_DST);\n    temps.push(ub);\n    dev.queue.writeBuffer(ub, 0, uniform);\n    const got = GP.pipelineFor(dev, code);\n    if (got.hit) stats.pipelineHits++; else stats.pipelineMisses++;\n    const pipe = got.pipe;\n    const entries = bindBufs.map((b, i) => ({ binding: i, resource: { buffer: b } }));\n    entries.push({ binding: bindBufs.length, resource: { buffer: ub } });\n    const bg = dev.createBindGroup({ layout: pipe.getBindGroupLayout(0), entries: entries });\n    const pass = enc.beginComputePass();\n    pass.setPipeline(pipe); pass.setBindGroup(0, bg);\n    if (Array.isArray(groups)) pass.dispatchWorkgroups(groups[0], groups[1], groups[2]); else pass.dispatchWorkgroups(groups);\n    pass.end();\n    stats.dispatches++;\n  }\n  const b = {\n    upload: upload,\n    uploadU32: uploadU32,\n    uploadF16: uploadF16,\n    rmsnorm(x, g, T, d, eps) {\n      const y = storage(T * d);\n      const uni = new ArrayBuffer(16); new Uint32Array(uni, 0, 2).set([T, d]); new Float32Array(uni, 8, 1)[0] = eps;\n      dispatch(WGSL_RMSNORM, [x.buf, g.buf, y], uni, Math.ceil(T / 64));\n      return { buf: y, n: T * d };\n    },\n    softmax(x, rows, cols) {\n      const y = storage(rows * cols);\n      const uni = new ArrayBuffer(16); new Uint32Array(uni, 0, 2).set([rows, cols]);\n      dispatch(WGSL_SOFTMAX, [x.buf, y], uni, Math.ceil(rows / 64));\n      return { buf: y, n: rows * cols };\n    },\n    // （批次內的 rmsnorm、softmax、silu、rope 都只走 T1；批次是 GPU 內連續運算，不經過 WebGL2）\n    silu(x) {\n      const y = storage(x.n);\n      const uni = new ArrayBuffer(16); new Uint32Array(uni, 0, 1)[0] = x.n;\n      dispatch(WGSL_SILU, [x.buf, y], uni, Math.ceil(x.n / 64));\n      return { buf: y, n: x.n };\n    },\n    rope(x, T, H, hd, dir) {\n      const y = storage(T * H * hd);\n      const uni = new ArrayBuffer(16); new Uint32Array(uni, 0, 3).set([T, H, hd]); new Float32Array(uni, 12, 1)[0] = dir;\n      dispatch(WGSL_ROPE, [x.buf, y], uni, Math.ceil(T * H * (hd / 2) / 64));\n      return { buf: y, n: T * H * hd };\n    },\n    // 矩陣乘（與 gpu_core 的 wgMatmul 同一組核心：K、N 為 4 的倍數時用 vec4 版）。A 是 M×K 的句柄，B 是 K×N 的句柄（常駐權重也可以）\n    // fl（選用）：{ transA, transB }（O5 的轉置版，走同一份平鋪核心的 p0 旗標；轉置時不用 vec4 版）\n    // fl.f16 = true：輸入必須是 uploadF16 的句柄（儲存 f16、累加 f32），走 f16 平鋪核心（需要 shader-f16）。\n    matmul(A, B, M, K, N, fl) {\n      const y = storage(M * N);\n      const flags = core.mmTileFlags(fl);\n      const f16 = !!(fl && fl.f16);\n      if (f16 && !(A.f16 && B.f16)) throw new Error('matmul f16：輸入必須用 uploadF16 上傳');\n      if (!f16 && (A.f16 || B.f16)) throw new Error('matmul：f16 句柄必須帶 fl.f16');\n      const v4 = !f16 && core.mmTileVec4Ok(M, K, N, flags);\n      const uni = new ArrayBuffer(32); new Uint32Array(uni).set(core.mmTileWords(M, K, N, flags, 1));\n      dispatch(f16 ? MM_F16_CODE : (v4 ? MM_VEC4_CODE : MM_TILED_CODE), [A.buf, B.buf, y], uni, core.mmTileDispatch(M, N, 1));\n      return { buf: y, n: M * N };\n    },\n    // 逐元素（同一命令編碼器內，不回讀）：axpy＝x + s·y、mul＝x·y、scal＝s·x\n    axpy(x, y, s) { const o = storage(x.n); const uni = new ArrayBuffer(16); new Uint32Array(uni, 0, 1)[0] = x.n; new Float32Array(uni, 4, 1)[0] = s; dispatch(WGSL_AXPY_B, [x.buf, y.buf, o], uni, Math.ceil(x.n / 64)); return { buf: o, n: x.n }; },\n    mul(x, y) { const o = storage(x.n); const uni = new ArrayBuffer(16); new Uint32Array(uni, 0, 1)[0] = x.n; dispatch(WGSL_MUL_B, [x.buf, y.buf, o], uni, Math.ceil(x.n / 64)); return { buf: o, n: x.n }; },\n    scal(x, s) { const o = storage(x.n); const uni = new ArrayBuffer(16); new Uint32Array(uni, 0, 1)[0] = x.n; new Float32Array(uni, 4, 1)[0] = s; dispatch(WGSL_SCAL_B, [x.buf, o], uni, Math.ceil(x.n / 64)); return { buf: o, n: x.n }; },\n    // 交叉熵（O8）：logits 是 T×V 的句柄，tgt 是 uploadU32 的句柄；回傳 dl（T×V，已乘 invT）與 rows（T，未除 T）\n    crossEntropy(logits, tgt, T, V, invT) {\n      const dl = storage(T * V), rows = storage(T);\n      const uni = new ArrayBuffer(16); new Uint32Array(uni, 0, 2).set([T, V]); new Float32Array(uni, 8, 1)[0] = invT;\n      dispatch(WGSL_CE, [logits.buf, tgt.buf, dl, rows], uni, T);\n      return { dl: { buf: dl, n: T * V }, rows: { buf: rows, n: T } };\n    },\n    // O7 融合：單列 RMSNorm＋動態量化，一次派發。回傳 { y: {buf,n}（正規化後的 f32）, q: {buf,n,st}（i32 xq；st＝[mn,mx,scale,zp]） }\n    rmsQuantFused(x, g, d, eps) {\n      const y = storage(d), q = storage(d), st = storage(4);\n      const uni = new ArrayBuffer(16); new Uint32Array(uni, 0, 1)[0] = d; new Float32Array(uni, 4, 1)[0] = eps;\n      dispatch(WGSL_RMSQ_FUSED, [x.buf, g.buf, y, q, st], uni, 1);\n      return { y: { buf: y, n: d }, q: { buf: q, n: d, st: { buf: st, n: 4 } } };\n    },\n    // 對照用（O7）：單列 RMSNorm 並行版（一次派發，只輸出 f32）\n    rmsParallel(x, g, d, eps) {\n      const y = storage(d);\n      const uni = new ArrayBuffer(16); new Uint32Array(uni, 0, 1)[0] = d; new Float32Array(uni, 4, 1)[0] = eps;\n      dispatch(WGSL_RMS_PAR, [x.buf, g.buf, y], uni, 1);\n      return { buf: y, n: d };\n    },\n    // 動態量化：回傳 { buf, n }（i32 的 xq，已扣 zero point）與 st（[mn, mx, scale, zp] 的句柄，讀回用 read([[st, 4]])）\n    quantizeDyn(x) {\n      const n = x.n;\n      const st = storage(4), q = storage(n);\n      const u1 = new ArrayBuffer(16); new Uint32Array(u1, 0, 1)[0] = n;\n      dispatch(WGSL_QDYN_STATS, [x.buf, st], u1, 1);\n      dispatch(WGSL_QDYN, [x.buf, st, q], u1, Math.ceil(n / 64));\n      return { buf: q, n: n, st: { buf: st, n: 4 } };\n    },\n    // 一次 submit，整批的回讀都在這裡；specs = [[handle, n], ...]，回傳 Float32Array 陣列\n    async read(specs) {\n      if (submitted) throw new Error('批次已經提交過');\n      submitted = true;\n      const rbs = specs.map(([h, n]) => {\n        const rb = pool.acquire(Math.max(4, n * 4), USAGE.MAP_READ | USAGE.COPY_DST);\n        enc.copyBufferToBuffer(h.buf, 0, rb, 0, n * 4);\n        return rb;\n      });\n      dev.queue.submit([enc.finish()]);\n      stats.submits++;\n      // 命令已排進佇列，中間緩衝區可以歸還（之後的重用排在這次提交之後）\n      for (const t of temps) pool.release(t);\n      temps.length = 0;\n      const out = [];\n      for (let i = 0; i < rbs.length; i++) {\n        const rb = rbs[i], n = specs[i][1];\n        await rb.mapAsync(1);\n        // 池裡的緩衝區可能比要求的大（分桶），只取前 n 個值\n        out.push(new Float32Array(rb.getMappedRange().slice(0, n * 4)));\n        rb.unmap();\n        pool.release(rb);\n        stats.readbacks++;\n      }\n      return out;\n    },\n    // 給其他模組（infer_ops 的批次 q8mm）用的底層介面：配置輸出、以指定的儲存緩衝區與 uniform 派發一個核心\n    alloc(n) { return { buf: storage(n), n: n }; },\n    dispatchRaw(code, bindBufs, uniform, groups) { dispatch(code, bindBufs, uniform, groups); },\n    stats: stats,\n  };\n  return b;\n}\n\n// 訓練器用的運算介面（lora_ref_train.js 的 lossAndGradsAsync／adamStepAsync 接受的 ops）。\n// 每次呼叫都走三層降級（T1 → T3 → cpu-js），並把實際使用的層記在 stats 裡，給後端選單與測試用。\nfunction trainerOps(opts) {\n  const o = opts || {};\n  const stats = { calls: 0, layers: {}, last: null };\n  const rec = (op, info) => {\n    stats.calls++;\n    const key = op + ':' + info.layer;\n    stats.layers[key] = (stats.layers[key] || 0) + 1;\n    stats.last = info;\n  };\n  return {\n    stats: stats,\n    rmsnorm: async (x, g, T, d, eps) => { const r = await rmsnorm(x, g, T, d, eps, o); rec('rmsnorm', r.info); return r.result; },\n    softmax: async (x, rows, cols) => { const r = await softmax(x, rows, cols, o); rec('softmax', r.info); return r.result; },\n    silu: async (x) => { const r = await silu(x, o); rec('silu', r.info); return r.result; },\n    rope: async (x, T, H, hd, dir) => { const r = await rope(x, T, H, hd, dir, o); rec('rope', r.info); return r.result; },\n    adamw: async (p, g, m, v, t, lr, b1, b2, eps, wd) => { const r = await adamw(p, g, m, v, t, lr, b1, b2, eps, wd, o); rec('adamw', r.info); return r.result; },\n  };\n}\n\nmodule.exports = { trainerOps, crossEntropy, crossEntropyRef, WGSL_CE, f32ToF16Bits, f16ToF32, WGSL_AXPY_B, WGSL_MUL_B, WGSL_SCAL_B, MM_F16_CODE, rmsnormRef, rmsnorm, softmaxRef, softmax, siluRef, silu, ropeRef, rope, adamwCore, adamwRef, adamw, createBatch, runWgsl, getDevice, getGl, glSupport, glRun, tryLayers, nnBackendInfo, withMeasureLock, measureLockState, requestExclusiveGpu, registerIdleGpuHolder, NN_OPS, WGSL_RMSNORM, WGSL_SOFTMAX, WGSL_SILU, WGSL_ROPE, WGSL_ADAMW, WGSL_RMSQ_FUSED, NOTE_T3 };\n\n};\nMODS[\"onnx_lite\"] = function (module, exports, require) {\n/* onnx_lite.js — 極簡 ONNX 讀取器與改寫器（只用 Uint8Array，Node 與瀏覽器都能跑，不需要 Buffer）。\n * 用途：從現有 q8 模型檔取出權重（推論概念驗證），以及產生「輸出隱藏狀態、不算 lm_head」的變體圖（DESIGN.webgpu-cuda.md §7.3）。\n * 純 UMD。桌面版的 nr-onnx-lite.js 是這份檔案的拷貝（改一邊要同步）。\n *\n * parseModel 的回傳形狀：\n *   { buf, nodes, inits（物件：名稱→張量資訊，舊呼叫端用 m.inits[名稱]）, inputs, outputs（名稱字串）,\n *     graph: { nodes, inits（Map：名稱→同一批張量資訊）, inputs, outputs }（llm_q8_onnx 用）}\n * 2026-11-19 修正：O12f（ffbd0462d）把回傳改成只有 { graph }，舊呼叫端的 m.inits／m.nodes 變成 undefined，\n * 於是 Qwen3 GPU 整段解碼報「Cannot read properties of undefined」與「m.nodes is not iterable」。這裡把舊形狀還原，graph 保留給 O12f。\n * 輸入不合法（空檔、文字／網頁、截斷、缺 graph）會丟出寫明位元組數與檔頭的錯誤，不再回傳 undefined。\n */\n(function (root, factory) {\n  if (typeof module === 'object' && module.exports) module.exports = factory();\n  else root.FaOnnxLite = factory();\n})(typeof self !== 'undefined' ? self : this, function () {\n  'use strict';\n\n  const td = typeof TextDecoder !== 'undefined' ? new TextDecoder('utf-8') : null;\n  const te = typeof TextEncoder !== 'undefined' ? new TextEncoder() : null;\n  const decodeUtf8 = (u8) => (td ? td.decode(u8) : Buffer.from(u8.buffer, u8.byteOffset, u8.length).toString('utf8'));\n  const encodeUtf8 = (s) => (te ? te.encode(s) : new Uint8Array(Buffer.from(s, 'utf8')));\n  const f32At = (u8, p) => new DataView(u8.buffer, u8.byteOffset, u8.byteLength).getFloat32(p, true);\n\n  // 位元組的描述：長度與前 16 位元組（十六進位）。錯誤訊息用，讓人看得出是截斷、空檔還是網頁。\n  function describe(u8) {\n    const head = Array.from(u8.subarray(0, 16), (b) => b.toString(16).padStart(2, '0')).join(' ');\n    return u8.length + ' 位元組，前 16 位元組：' + (head || '（無）');\n  }\n  // 讀 varint，回傳 [值, 新位置]；超出檔案範圍就丟錯（截斷的檔案會在這裡露出來）\n  function varint(buf, pos) {\n    let r = 0, mul = 1;\n    for (;;) {\n      if (pos >= buf.length) throw new Error('onnx_lite：varint 讀到檔案結尾（位置 ' + pos + '，共 ' + buf.length + ' 位元組，可能是截斷）');\n      const b = buf[pos++];\n      r += (b & 0x7f) * mul;\n      if (!(b & 0x80)) break;\n      mul *= 128;\n    }\n    return [r, pos];\n  }\n  // 一段長度為 len 的欄位內容必須在 end 與檔案長度之內；否則丟出寫明數字的錯誤\n  function checkRange(buf, pos, len, field, end) {\n    const limit = Math.min(end, buf.length);\n    if (pos + len > limit) throw new Error('onnx_lite：欄位 ' + field + ' 宣告 ' + len + ' 位元組，但只剩 ' + Math.max(0, limit - pos) + ' 位元組（位置 ' + pos + '，檔案共 ' + buf.length + ' 位元組）；檔案可能被截斷');\n  }\n  // 走一段訊息，對每個欄位呼叫 fn(欄位號, 線型, 值或[起,迄])；線型 2 的值是 [起, 迄]\n  function walk(buf, start, end, fn) {\n    let pos = start;\n    while (pos < end) {\n      let t; [t, pos] = varint(buf, pos);\n      const field = Math.floor(t / 8), wt = t % 8;\n      if (wt === 0) { let v; [v, pos] = varint(buf, pos); fn(field, 0, v); }\n      else if (wt === 2) { let len; [len, pos] = varint(buf, pos); checkRange(buf, pos, len, field, end); fn(field, 2, [pos, pos + len]); pos += len; }\n      else if (wt === 5) { checkRange(buf, pos, 4, field, end); fn(field, 5, [pos, pos + 4]); pos += 4; }\n      else if (wt === 1) { checkRange(buf, pos, 8, field, end); fn(field, 1, [pos, pos + 8]); pos += 8; }\n      else throw new Error('onnx_lite：不支援的線型 ' + wt + '（位置 ' + (pos - 1) + '）');\n    }\n  }\n  const str = (buf, r) => decodeUtf8(buf.subarray(r[0], r[1]));\n\n  function parseTensor(buf, r) {\n    const t = { name: '', dims: [], dtype: 0, raw: null, ext: {} };\n    walk(buf, r[0], r[1], (f, wt, v) => {\n      if (f === 1) { if (wt === 0) t.dims.push(v); else { let p = v[0]; while (p < v[1]) { let x; [x, p] = varint(buf, p); t.dims.push(x); } } }\n      else if (f === 2) t.dtype = v;\n      else if (f === 8) t.name = str(buf, v);\n      else if (f === 9) t.raw = v;  // [起, 迄]，不複製\n      else if (f === 4) { if (!t.floats) t.floats = []; if (wt === 2) { for (let p = v[0]; p < v[1]; p += 4) t.floats.push(f32At(buf, p)); } else t.floats.push(f32At(buf, v[0])); }\n      else if (f === 5) { if (!t.ints) t.ints = []; if (wt === 2) { let p = v[0]; while (p < v[1]) { let x; [x, p] = varint(buf, p); t.ints.push(x); } } else t.ints.push(v); }\n      else if (f === 7) { if (!t.ints) t.ints = []; if (wt === 2) { let p = v[0]; while (p < v[1]) { let x; [x, p] = varint(buf, p); t.ints.push(x); } } else t.ints.push(v); }   // int64_data（小的 int64 常數，例如 Split 的 splits）\n      else if (f === 13) { // external_data：StringStringEntryProto\n        let k = '', val = '';\n        walk(buf, v[0], v[1], (ff, w2, vv) => { if (ff === 1) k = str(buf, vv); else if (ff === 2) val = str(buf, vv); });\n        t.ext[k] = val;\n      }\n    });\n    return t;\n  }\n  function parseAttr(buf, r) {\n    const a = { name: '', i: null, f: null, ints: [], s: null };\n    walk(buf, r[0], r[1], (f, wt, v) => {\n      if (f === 1) a.name = str(buf, v);\n      else if (f === 3) a.i = v;\n      else if (f === 2) a.f = f32At(buf, v[0]);\n      else if (f === 8) { if (wt === 0) a.ints.push(v); }\n      else if (f === 4) a.s = str(buf, v);\n      else if (f === 5) a.tensor = v;  // TensorProto 範圍（Constant 節點的 value）\n      else if (f === 6) a.graph = v;   // GraphProto 範圍（If／Loop 的子圖）\n      else if (f === 9) { if (!a.strings) a.strings = []; a.strings.push(str(buf, v)); }\n    });\n    return a;\n  }\n  // 取得 Constant 節點的值：{ dims, dtype, values（Float32Array 或 BigInt/數字陣列） }\n  function constantValue(m, node) {\n    const a = node.attrs && node.attrs.value;\n    if (!a || !a.tensor) throw new Error('onnx_lite：節點 ' + node.name + ' 不是 tensor 常數');\n    const t = parseTensor(m.buf, a.tensor);\n    let values = null;\n    if (t.floats) values = Float32Array.from(t.floats);\n    else if (t.ints) values = t.ints.slice();\n    else if (t.raw) {\n      const bytes = m.buf.subarray(t.raw[0], t.raw[1]);\n      const dv = new DataView(bytes.buffer, bytes.byteOffset, bytes.byteLength);\n      const n = bytes.byteLength;\n      if (t.dtype === 1) { values = new Float32Array(n / 4); for (let i = 0; i < n / 4; i++) values[i] = dv.getFloat32(i * 4, true); }\n      else if (t.dtype === 6) { values = new Int32Array(n / 4); for (let i = 0; i < n / 4; i++) values[i] = dv.getInt32(i * 4, true); }\n      else if (t.dtype === 7) { values = []; for (let i = 0; i < n / 8; i++) values.push(Number(dv.getBigInt64(i * 8, true))); }\n      else if (t.dtype === 9) { values = Array.from(bytes); }\n      else values = bytes.slice();\n    }\n    return { dims: t.dims, dtype: t.dtype, values };\n  }\n  function parseNode(buf, r) {\n    const n = { name: '', op: '', inputs: [], outputs: [], attrs: {} };\n    walk(buf, r[0], r[1], (f, wt, v) => {\n      if (f === 1) n.inputs.push(str(buf, v));\n      else if (f === 2) n.outputs.push(str(buf, v));\n      else if (f === 3) n.name = str(buf, v);\n      else if (f === 4) n.op = str(buf, v);\n      else if (f === 5) { const a = parseAttr(buf, v); n.attrs[a.name] = a; }\n    });\n    return n;\n  }\n  // 解析一個 GraphProto（範圍 [起, 迄]）：節點、初始值（物件：名稱→張量資訊）、圖輸入名、圖輸出名（輸入不含初始值）\n  function parseGraph(buf, graph) {\n    const nodes = [], inits = {}, inputs = [], outputs = [];\n    const vname = (r) => { let s = ''; walk(buf, r[0], r[1], (f, wt, v) => { if (f === 1) s = str(buf, v); }); return s; };\n    walk(buf, graph[0], graph[1], (f, wt, v) => {\n      if (f === 1) nodes.push(parseNode(buf, v));\n      else if (f === 5) { const t = parseTensor(buf, v); inits[t.name] = t; }\n      else if (f === 11) inputs.push(vname(v));\n      else if (f === 12) outputs.push(vname(v));\n    });\n    return { nodes: nodes, inits: inits, inputs: inputs.filter((x) => !inits[x]), outputs: outputs };\n  }\n  // 輸入檢查：空檔、看起來是文字或網頁的內容，要在解析前就說清楚（否則會變成不知所云的例外）\n  function checkInput(buf) {\n    if (!buf || typeof buf.length !== 'number' || !(buf instanceof Uint8Array)) throw new Error('onnx_lite：輸入不是位元組（需要 Uint8Array）');\n    if (buf.length === 0) throw new Error('onnx_lite：檔案是空的（0 位元組）；常見原因是下載中斷或快取寫入失敗');\n    const n = Math.min(buf.length, 64);\n    let text = true;\n    for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) { const b = buf[i]; if (!(b === 9 || b === 10 || b === 13 || (b >= 32 && b < 127))) { text = false; break; } }\n    if (text) throw new Error('onnx_lite：看起來是文字或網頁，不是 ONNX 二進位（' + describe(buf) + '）；常見原因是下載到錯誤頁');\n  }\n  // 讀整個模型。回傳形狀見檔案開頭。\n  function parseModel(buf) {\n    checkInput(buf);\n    let graph = null; const top = new Set();\n    walk(buf, 0, buf.length, (f, wt, v) => { top.add(f); if (f === 7) graph = v; });\n    if (!graph) throw new Error('onnx_lite：找不到 graph（ModelProto 欄位 7）；頂層欄位號：[' + Array.from(top).sort((a, b) => a - b).join(', ') + ']（' + describe(buf) + '）');\n    const g = parseGraph(buf, graph);\n    const initMap = new Map(Object.keys(g.inits).map((k) => [k, g.inits[k]]));\n    return { buf: buf, nodes: g.nodes, inits: g.inits, inputs: g.inputs, outputs: g.outputs,\n      graph: { nodes: g.nodes, inits: initMap, inputs: g.inputs, outputs: g.outputs } };\n  }\n\n  // ---- 張量的 typed array（llm_q8_onnx 用）：raw_data 不對齊時複製一份；小張量用 float_data／int 欄位 ----\n  const TYPED = { 1: Float32Array, 2: Uint8Array, 3: Int8Array, 6: Int32Array, 10: Uint16Array };\n  function tensorArray(buf, t) {\n    const elems = t.dims.reduce((a, b) => a * b, 1);\n    const C = TYPED[t.dtype];\n    if (t.raw) {\n      if (!C) throw new Error('onnx_lite：dtype ' + t.dtype + ' 暫不取陣列（' + t.name + '）');\n      const bytes = buf.subarray(t.raw[0], t.raw[1]);\n      const need = elems * C.BYTES_PER_ELEMENT;\n      if (bytes.length !== need) throw new Error('onnx_lite：' + t.name + ' 的 raw_data 長度 ' + bytes.length + ' 與形狀需要的 ' + need + ' 不符');\n      if (bytes.byteOffset % C.BYTES_PER_ELEMENT === 0) return new C(bytes.buffer, bytes.byteOffset, elems);\n      return new C(bytes.slice().buffer, 0, elems);\n    }\n    if (t.dtype === 1 && t.floats) return Float32Array.from(t.floats.slice(0, elems || t.floats.length));\n    if (t.dtype === 7 && t.ints) return BigInt64Array.from(t.ints.slice(0, elems || t.ints.length), (x) => BigInt(x));\n    if (t.ints && C) return C.from(t.ints.slice(0, elems || t.ints.length));\n    throw new Error('onnx_lite：' + t.name + ' 沒有 raw_data，也不是可讀的 float_data／int 欄位（dtype ' + t.dtype + '）');\n  }\n\n  // ---- 位元組組裝（只用 Uint8Array）----\n  const enc = (n) => { const o = []; while (n > 127) { o.push((n % 128) | 128); n = Math.floor(n / 128); } o.push(n); return Uint8Array.from(o); };\n  const cat = (list) => {\n    let len = 0; for (const b of list) len += b.length;\n    const out = new Uint8Array(len); let p = 0;\n    for (const b of list) { out.set(b, p); p += b.length; }\n    return out;\n  };\n  const fVarB = (f, v) => cat([enc(f * 8), enc(v)]);\n  const fBytesB = (f, b) => cat([enc(f * 8 + 2), enc(b.length), b]);\n  const fStrB = (f, s) => fBytesB(f, encodeUtf8(s));\n  function valueInfo(name, elem, dims) {  // dims：數字或字串（符號維度，dim_param）\n    const dimMsgs = dims.map((d) => fBytesB(1, typeof d === 'number' ? fVarB(1, d) : fStrB(2, d)));\n    return cat([fStrB(1, name), fBytesB(2, fBytesB(1, cat([fVarB(1, elem), fBytesB(2, cat(dimMsgs))])))]);\n  }\n  // 依序走一段訊息，回傳每個欄位 { f, wt, start, end, vr }（start..end 是含標籤的整段位元組）\n  function fieldsOf(buf, a, b) {\n    const out = [];\n    let pos = a;\n    while (pos < b) {\n      const start = pos;\n      let t; [t, pos] = varint(buf, pos);\n      const f = Math.floor(t / 8), wt = t % 8;\n      let vr;\n      if (wt === 0) { let v; [v, pos] = varint(buf, pos); vr = v; }\n      else if (wt === 2) { let len; [len, pos] = varint(buf, pos); checkRange(buf, pos, len, f, b); vr = [pos, pos + len]; pos += len; }\n      else if (wt === 5) { checkRange(buf, pos, 4, f, b); vr = [pos, pos + 4]; pos += 4; }\n      else if (wt === 1) { checkRange(buf, pos, 8, f, b); vr = [pos, pos + 8]; pos += 8; }\n      else throw new Error('onnx_lite：不支援的線型 ' + wt + '（位置 ' + start + '）');\n      out.push({ f: f, wt: wt, start: start, end: pos, vr: vr });\n    }\n    return out;\n  }\n  // 把模型改成：移除 dropNodeName 節點與之後不再被使用的節點，並把圖輸出 replaceOutput 換成 hiddenName（float32，維度 hiddenDims）\n  // 權重位元組原樣沿用（subarray，不複製）；回傳 { removed, buf():Uint8Array }\n  function buildHiddenStateModel(buf, o) {\n    checkInput(buf);\n    const top = fieldsOf(buf, 0, buf.length);\n    const gf = top.find((x) => x.f === 7);\n    if (!gf) throw new Error('onnx_lite：找不到 graph（ModelProto 欄位 7）（' + describe(buf) + '）');\n    const parts = fieldsOf(buf, gf.vr[0], gf.vr[1]);\n    const nodes = [];\n    parts.forEach((p, i) => { if (p.f === 1) { const n = parseNode(buf, p.vr); n._i = i; nodes.push(n); } });\n    const drop = new Set();\n    const target = nodes.find((n) => n.name === o.dropNodeName);\n    if (!target) throw new Error('onnx_lite：找不到節點 ' + o.dropNodeName);\n    drop.add(target);\n    const outNames = new Set(); // 圖輸出（扣掉要換掉的）\n    parts.forEach((p) => { if (p.f === 12) { let nm = ''; walk(buf, p.vr[0], p.vr[1], (f, wt, v) => { if (f === 1) nm = str(buf, v); }); if (nm !== o.replaceOutput) outNames.add(nm); } });\n    outNames.add(o.hiddenName);\n    // 反覆清掉沒有任何使用者、也不是圖輸出的節點\n    for (let changed = true; changed;) {\n      changed = false;\n      const used = new Set(outNames);\n      nodes.forEach((n) => { if (!drop.has(n)) n.inputs.forEach((x) => used.add(x)); });\n      nodes.forEach((n) => { if (!drop.has(n) && n.outputs.every((x) => !used.has(x))) { drop.add(n); changed = true; } });\n    }\n    const keepIdx = new Set(); drop.forEach((n) => keepIdx.add(n._i));\n    const gp = [];\n    parts.forEach((p, i) => {\n      if (p.f === 1 && keepIdx.has(i)) return;\n      if (p.f === 12) { let nm = ''; walk(buf, p.vr[0], p.vr[1], (f, wt, v) => { if (f === 1) nm = str(buf, v); }); if (nm === o.replaceOutput) { gp.push(fBytesB(12, valueInfo(o.hiddenName, 1, o.hiddenDims))); return; } }\n      gp.push(buf.subarray(p.start, p.end));\n    });\n    const gLen = gp.reduce((s, b) => s + b.length, 0);\n    const out = [];\n    top.forEach((p) => { if (p === gf) { out.push(cat([enc(7 * 8 + 2), enc(gLen)])); gp.forEach((b) => out.push(b)); } else out.push(buf.subarray(p.start, p.end)); });\n    return { removed: Array.from(drop).map((n) => n.name), buf: function () { return cat(out); } };\n  }\n  // 取張量的位元組（raw_data；外部資料不支援）\n  function tensorBytes(model, name) {\n    const t = model.inits[name];\n    if (!t) throw new Error('onnx_lite：沒有權重 ' + name);\n    if (!t.raw) throw new Error('onnx_lite：權重 ' + name + ' 沒有 raw_data（可能是外部資料或欄位型）');\n    return model.buf.subarray(t.raw[0], t.raw[1]);\n  }\n  // 取純量（scale 為 float、zero_point 為整數）：raw 或 floats／ints 欄位都接受\n  function scalar(model, name) {\n    const t = model.inits[name];\n    if (!t) throw new Error('onnx_lite：沒有權重 ' + name);\n    if (t.floats && t.floats.length) return t.floats[0];\n    if (t.ints && t.ints.length) return t.ints[0];\n    if (t.raw) { const b = model.buf; return t.dtype === 1 ? f32At(b, t.raw[0]) : b[t.raw[0]]; }\n    throw new Error('onnx_lite：權重 ' + name + ' 沒有可讀的純量');\n  }\n  const DTYPE = { 1: 'float32', 2: 'uint8', 3: 'int8', 6: 'int32', 7: 'int64', 10: 'float16' };\n  return { parseModel: parseModel, parseGraph: parseGraph, tensorBytes: tensorBytes, tensorArray: tensorArray, scalar: scalar,\n    buildHiddenStateModel: buildHiddenStateModel, constantValue: constantValue, DTYPE: DTYPE, describe: describe };\n});\n\n};\nMODS[\"moss_decoder\"] = function (module, exports, require) {\n'use strict';\n// MOSS-TTS-Nano 全域解碼一步（moss_tts_decode_step.onnx）的參考版與可注入運算（已逐節點確認）。\n// 結構（GPT-2 式，12 層，隱藏 768，12 頭，頭維 64）：\n//   輸入 ids 是一列 17 個欄位：第 0 欄是文字詞元（wte），第 1..16 欄是 16 條音訊碼本（audio_embeddings.0..15，pad=1024 時該列歸零）；各列相加。\n//   每層：LN(ln_1) → c_attn（768→2304，切成 q/k/v）→ q、k 做交錯式 RoPE（位置 = 過去有效長度，inv_freq = 10000^(−2i/64)）\n//         → 寫入 KV 快取（時間優先佈局 [L][H][D]）→ 因果注意力（縮放 0.125；單一詞元時 j ≤ 過去長度，全部可見）→ c_proj → 殘差\n//         → LN(ln_2) → fc_in → GELU（tanh 近似）→ fc_out → 殘差。\n//   最後 ln_f → global_hidden（768）。LN 權重在圖中都是 h.0.ln_1.weight 的 Identity 別名，這裡照圖解析。\n// 可注入運算 ops：{ linear(x, W, K, N, b) → Promise<Float32Array>, attention(q, Kc, Vc, Ln) → Promise<Float32Array> }。\n// 預設是 CPU 參考；GPU 版（moss_gpu.js）只換這兩個。LN、RoPE、GELU、嵌入仍在 CPU（逐元素、很小）。\nconst lite = require('./onnx_lite.js');\n\nconst D = 768, H = 12, HD = 64, FF = 3072, NL = 12, NCH = 16, PAD = 1024, EPS = 1e-5, SCALE = 0.125, THETA = 10000;\n\nfunction readInit(m, name, dataFiles) {\n  // 圖中有些權重名是 Identity 節點的輸出（別名），照圖解析到來源初始值\n  const nm = (!m.inits[name] && m.aliases && m.aliases[name]) ? m.aliases[name] : name;\n  const t = m.inits[nm];\n  if (!t) throw new Error('moss_decoder：沒有權重 ' + name);\n  let bytes;\n  if (t.raw) bytes = m.buf.subarray(t.raw[0], t.raw[1]);\n  else if (t.ext && t.ext.location) {\n    const f = dataFiles[t.ext.location];\n    if (!f) throw new Error('moss_decoder：缺少外部資料檔 ' + t.ext.location);\n    const off = Number(t.ext.offset || 0), len = Number(t.ext.length);\n    bytes = f.subarray(off, off + len);\n  } else throw new Error('moss_decoder：權重 ' + name + ' 沒有資料');\n  const o = new Float32Array(bytes.length / 4);\n  new Uint8Array(o.buffer).set(bytes);\n  return { data: o, dims: t.dims };\n}\n\n// dataFiles：{ \"檔名.data\": Uint8Array }。回傳模型物件（權重皆為 Float32Array）。\nfunction loadMossDecodeStep(onnxBuf, dataFiles) {\n  const m = lite.parseModel(onnxBuf);\n  m.aliases = {};\n  for (const n of m.nodes) if (n.op === 'Identity' && n.inputs.length && n.outputs.length) m.aliases[n.outputs[0]] = n.inputs[0];\n  // 每個 MatMul 的權重名（節點名含層號後綴）\n  const mmWeight = (base) => {\n    const n = m.nodes.find((x) => x.op === 'MatMul' && x.outputs[0] === base + '/MatMul_output_0');\n    if (!n) throw new Error('moss_decoder：找不到 MatMul ' + base);\n    return readInit(m, n.inputs[1], dataFiles);\n  };\n  const layers = [];\n  for (let i = 0; i < NL; i++) {\n    const sfx = i === 0 ? '' : '_' + i;\n    const p = 'core.model.transformer.h.' + i + '.';\n    layers.push({\n      ln1w: readInit(m, p + 'ln_1.weight', dataFiles).data, ln1b: readInit(m, p + 'ln_1.bias', dataFiles).data,\n      ln2w: readInit(m, p + 'ln_2.weight', dataFiles).data, ln2b: readInit(m, p + 'ln_2.bias', dataFiles).data,\n      cAttnW: mmWeight('/c_attn' + sfx).data, cAttnB: readInit(m, p + 'attn.c_attn.bias', dataFiles).data,\n      cProjW: mmWeight('/c_proj' + sfx).data, cProjB: readInit(m, p + 'attn.c_proj.bias', dataFiles).data,\n      fcInW: mmWeight('/mlp/fc_in' + sfx).data, fcInB: readInit(m, p + 'mlp.fc_in.bias', dataFiles).data,\n      fcOutW: mmWeight('/mlp/fc_out' + sfx).data, fcOutB: readInit(m, p + 'mlp.fc_out.bias', dataFiles).data,\n      dims: { cAttnW: mmWeight('/c_attn' + sfx).dims, cProjW: mmWeight('/c_proj' + sfx).dims, fcInW: mmWeight('/mlp/fc_in' + sfx).dims, fcOutW: mmWeight('/mlp/fc_out' + sfx).dims },\n    });\n  }\n  const audio = [];\n  for (let c = 0; c < NCH; c++) audio.push(readInit(m, 'core.model.audio_embeddings.' + c + '.weight', dataFiles).data);\n  return {\n    wte: readInit(m, 'core.model.transformer.wte.weight', dataFiles).data,\n    audio,\n    layers,\n    lnFw: readInit(m, 'core.model.transformer.ln_f.weight', dataFiles).data,\n    lnFb: readInit(m, 'core.model.transformer.ln_f.bias', dataFiles).data,\n  };\n}\n\n// 逐列 LayerNorm（x 長度 D）\nfunction layerNorm(x, w, b) {\n  let mu = 0; for (let i = 0; i < D; i++) mu += x[i]; mu /= D;\n  let v = 0; for (let i = 0; i < D; i++) v += (x[i] - mu) * (x[i] - mu); v /= D;\n  const r = 1 / Math.sqrt(v + EPS);\n  const o = new Float32Array(D);\n  for (let i = 0; i < D; i++) o[i] = (x[i] - mu) * r * w[i] + b[i];\n  return o;\n}\n\n// y = x · W + b，W 形狀 [K, N]（列優先）— CPU 參考\nfunction linearCpu(x, W, K, N, b) {\n  const y = new Float32Array(N);\n  for (let n = 0; n < N; n++) y[n] = b ? b[n] : 0;\n  for (let k = 0; k < K; k++) {\n    const xv = x[k], wo = k * N;\n    for (let n = 0; n < N; n++) y[n] += xv * W[wo + n];\n  }\n  return y;\n}\n\n// 單一詞元的因果注意力 — CPU 參考。q 長度 D；Kc、Vc 為 Ln×D（時間優先）；回傳長度 D。\nfunction attentionCpu(q, Kc, Vc, Ln) {\n  const ao = new Float32Array(D);\n  for (let hh = 0; hh < H; hh++) {\n    const qo = hh * HD;\n    const sc = new Float64Array(Ln);\n    let mx = -Infinity;\n    for (let j = 0; j < Ln; j++) {\n      let dot = 0; const ko = j * D + hh * HD;\n      for (let d = 0; d < HD; d++) dot += q[qo + d] * Kc[ko + d];\n      sc[j] = dot * SCALE; if (sc[j] > mx) mx = sc[j];\n    }\n    let sum = 0; for (let j = 0; j < Ln; j++) { sc[j] = Math.exp(sc[j] - mx); sum += sc[j]; }\n    for (let j = 0; j < Ln; j++) {\n      const p = sc[j] / sum, vo = j * D + hh * HD;\n      for (let d = 0; d < HD; d++) ao[hh * HD + d] += p * Vc[vo + d];\n    }\n  }\n  return ao;\n}\n\n// GELU（tanh 近似），逐元素，原地回傳新陣列\nfunction geluCpu(f) {\n  const o = new Float32Array(f.length);\n  for (let i = 0; i < f.length; i++) { const g = f[i]; o[i] = 0.5 * g * (1 + Math.tanh(0.7978846 * (g + 0.044715 * g * g * g))); }\n  return o;\n}\n\nconst CPU_OPS = {\n  linear: async (x, W, K, N, b) => linearCpu(x, W, K, N, b),\n  attention: async (q, Kc, Vc, Ln) => attentionCpu(q, Kc, Vc, Ln),\n  layerNorm: async (x, w, b) => layerNorm(x, w, b),\n  rope: async (x, pos) => rope(x, pos),\n  gelu: async (f) => geluCpu(f),\n};\n\n// 交錯式 RoPE（單一詞元，位置 pos）：配對 (2i, 2i+1)，角度 pos·θ^(−2i/64)\nfunction rope(x, pos) {\n  const o = new Float32Array(D);\n  for (let h = 0; h < H; h++) for (let i = 0; i < HD / 2; i++) {\n    const f = pos * Math.pow(THETA, -2 * i / HD), c = Math.cos(f), s = Math.sin(f);\n    const b = h * HD + 2 * i, e = x[b], od = x[b + 1];\n    o[b] = e * c - od * s;\n    o[b + 1] = od * c + e * s;\n  }\n  return o;\n}\n\n// 一步解碼。ids：17 個整數（第 0 欄文字，1..16 音訊碼）；caches：每層 {K, V, L}（K/V 為 L×H×HD，時間優先）。\n// ops：可注入運算（預設 CPU）。回傳 { hidden: Float32Array(768), caches, tiers }（新快取長度 L+1）。\nasync function decodeStep(model, ids, caches, ops) {\n  // 缺的運算項目退回 CPU（讓只替換部分運算的組合也能跑）\n  const O = Object.assign({}, CPU_OPS, ops || {});\n  const past = caches ? caches[0].L : 0;\n  let x = new Float32Array(D);\n  const tw = model.wte, to = ids[0] * D;\n  for (let i = 0; i < D; i++) x[i] = tw[to + i];\n  for (let c = 0; c < NCH; c++) {\n    const id = ids[c + 1];\n    if (id === PAD) continue;\n    const tab = model.audio[c], o = id * D;\n    for (let i = 0; i < D; i++) x[i] += tab[o + i];\n  }\n  const next = [];\n  for (let li = 0; li < NL; li++) {\n    const L = model.layers[li];\n    const h = await O.layerNorm(x, L.ln1w, L.ln1b);\n    const qkv = await O.linear(h, L.cAttnW, D, 3 * D, L.cAttnB);\n    const q = await O.rope(qkv.subarray(0, D), past);\n    const k = await O.rope(qkv.subarray(D, 2 * D), past);\n    const v = qkv.subarray(2 * D, 3 * D);\n    const Ln = past + 1;\n    const Kc = new Float32Array(Ln * D), Vc = new Float32Array(Ln * D);\n    if (past > 0) { Kc.set(caches[li].K.subarray(0, past * D)); Vc.set(caches[li].V.subarray(0, past * D)); }\n    Kc.set(k, past * D); Vc.set(v, past * D);\n    next.push({ K: Kc, V: Vc, L: Ln });\n    const ao = await O.attention(q, Kc, Vc, Ln);\n    const pr = await O.linear(ao, L.cProjW, D, D, L.cProjB);\n    for (let i = 0; i < D; i++) x[i] += pr[i];\n    const h2 = await O.layerNorm(x, L.ln2w, L.ln2b);\n    const f1 = await O.linear(h2, L.fcInW, D, FF, L.fcInB);\n    const g1 = await O.gelu(f1);\n    const f2 = await O.linear(g1, L.fcOutW, FF, D, L.fcOutB);\n    for (let i = 0; i < D; i++) x[i] += f2[i];\n  }\n  const hidden = await O.layerNorm(x, model.lnFw, model.lnFb);\n  return { hidden, caches: next };\n}\n\nmodule.exports = { loadMossDecodeStep, decodeStep, readInit, layerNorm, linearCpu, attentionCpu, rope, geluCpu, CPU_OPS, D, H, HD, FF, NL, NCH, PAD, SCALE, EPS, THETA };\n\n};\nMODS[\"moss_gpu\"] = function (module, exports, require) {\n'use strict';\n// MOSS 解碼一步的 GPU 運算（WGSL）：float32 矩陣乘（單一詞元的 y = x·W + b）與單一詞元的因果注意力。\n// 退路：T1 WGSL 失敗或沒有 WebGPU → cpu-js（moss_decoder.js 的參考實作）。WebGL2 未做。\n// 介面：makeGpuOps(opts) → { linear, attention, tiers }，可直接傳給 moss_decoder.decodeStep(model, ids, caches, ops)。\n// pipeline 由 nn.runWgsl 以 WGSL 字串為鍵快取（第二次呼叫不重建，見 gpu_cache_fallback_test.js）。\nconst nn = require('./nn_ops.js');\nconst M = require('./moss_decoder.js');\n\nconst WGSL_LINEAR = `\nstruct P { K: u32, N: u32, p0: u32, p1: u32 }\n@group(0) @binding(0) var<storage, read> x: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(1) var<storage, read> w: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(2) var<storage, read> b: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(3) var<storage, read_write> y: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(4) var<uniform> p: P;\n// @kernel moss_linear\n@compute @workgroup_size(64)\nfn main(@builtin(global_invocation_id) gid: vec3<u32>) {\n  let n = gid.x;\n  if (n >= p.N) { return; }\n  var acc: f32 = b[n];\n  for (var k: u32 = 0u; k < p.K; k = k + 1u) { acc = acc + x[k] * w[k * p.N + n]; }\n  y[n] = acc;\n}\n`;\n\n// 一個 invocation 算一個頭：兩段式（先求最大值，再算 softmax 加權和）。快取為 L×(H·HD)，時間優先。\nconst WGSL_ATTN = `\nstruct A { L: u32, H: u32, HD: u32, p0: u32, scale: f32, p1: u32, p2: u32, p3: u32 }\n@group(0) @binding(0) var<storage, read> q: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(1) var<storage, read> kc: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(2) var<storage, read> vc: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(3) var<storage, read_write> o: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(4) var<uniform> a: A;\n// @kernel moss_attn\n@compute @workgroup_size(1)\nfn main(@builtin(global_invocation_id) gid: vec3<u32>) {\n  let h = gid.x;\n  if (h >= a.H) { return; }\n  let D = a.H * a.HD;\n  var mx: f32 = -3.0e38;\n  for (var j: u32 = 0u; j < a.L; j = j + 1u) {\n    var dot: f32 = 0.0;\n    for (var d: u32 = 0u; d < a.HD; d = d + 1u) { dot = dot + q[h * a.HD + d] * kc[j * D + h * a.HD + d]; }\n    let s = dot * a.scale;\n    if (s > mx) { mx = s; }\n  }\n  var sum: f32 = 0.0;\n  for (var d: u32 = 0u; d < a.HD; d = d + 1u) { o[h * a.HD + d] = 0.0; }\n  for (var j: u32 = 0u; j < a.L; j = j + 1u) {\n    var dot: f32 = 0.0;\n    for (var d: u32 = 0u; d < a.HD; d = d + 1u) { dot = dot + q[h * a.HD + d] * kc[j * D + h * a.HD + d]; }\n    let e = exp(dot * a.scale - mx);\n    sum = sum + e;\n    for (var d: u32 = 0u; d < a.HD; d = d + 1u) { o[h * a.HD + d] = o[h * a.HD + d] + e * vc[j * D + h * a.HD + d]; }\n  }\n  for (var d: u32 = 0u; d < a.HD; d = d + 1u) { o[h * a.HD + d] = o[h * a.HD + d] / sum; }\n}\n`;\n\n// LayerNorm（單一詞元，D 維）：一個 invocation 逐元素計算均值與變異數（D 小，不做歸約）\nconst WGSL_LN = `\nstruct P { D: u32, p0: u32, p1: u32, p2: u32, eps: f32, p3: u32, p4: u32, p5: u32 }\n@group(0) @binding(0) var<storage, read> x: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(1) var<storage, read> w: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(2) var<storage, read> b: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(3) var<storage, read_write> y: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(4) var<uniform> p: P;\n// @kernel moss_ln\n@compute @workgroup_size(1)\nfn main() {\n  var mu: f32 = 0.0;\n  for (var i: u32 = 0u; i < p.D; i = i + 1u) { mu = mu + x[i]; }\n  mu = mu / f32(p.D);\n  var v: f32 = 0.0;\n  for (var i: u32 = 0u; i < p.D; i = i + 1u) { v = v + (x[i] - mu) * (x[i] - mu); }\n  v = v / f32(p.D);\n  let r = 1.0 / sqrt(v + p.eps);\n  for (var i: u32 = 0u; i < p.D; i = i + 1u) { y[i] = (x[i] - mu) * r * w[i] + b[i]; }\n}\n`;\n// 交錯式 RoPE：一個 invocation 處理一對 (2i, 2i+1)；共 H·32 對（D/2 = 384）\nconst WGSL_ROPE = `\nstruct P { pos: f32, theta: f32, HD: u32, npairs: u32 }\n@group(0) @binding(0) var<storage, read> x: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(1) var<storage, read_write> y: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(2) var<uniform> p: P;\n// @kernel moss_rope\n@compute @workgroup_size(64)\nfn main(@builtin(global_invocation_id) gid: vec3<u32>) {\n  let q = gid.x;\n  if (q >= p.npairs) { return; }\n  let half = p.HD / 2u;\n  let h = q / half;\n  let i = q % half;\n  let b = h * p.HD + 2u * i;\n  let f = p.pos * pow(p.theta, -f32(2u * i) / f32(p.HD));\n  let c = cos(f);\n  let s = sin(f);\n  let e = x[b];\n  let od = x[b + 1u];\n  y[b] = e * c - od * s;\n  y[b + 1u] = od * c + e * s;\n}\n`;\n// GELU（tanh 近似），逐元素\nconst WGSL_GELU = `\nstruct P { n: u32, p0: u32, p1: u32, p2: u32 }\n@group(0) @binding(0) var<storage, read> x: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(1) var<storage, read_write> y: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(2) var<uniform> p: P;\n// @kernel moss_gelu\n@compute @workgroup_size(64)\nfn main(@builtin(global_invocation_id) gid: vec3<u32>) {\n  let i = gid.x;\n  if (i >= p.n) { return; }\n  let g = x[i];\n  // 軟體 WebGPU（SwiftShader）的 tanh 在引數很大時會回 NaN（x³ 溢位 → inf/inf），先夾到 ±15（tanh 在此已飽和為 ±1）\n  let u = clamp(0.7978846 * (g + 0.044715 * g * g * g), -15.0, 15.0);\n  y[i] = 0.5 * g * (1.0 + tanh(u));\n}\n`;\n\nfunction u32Bytes(vals) { const ab = new ArrayBuffer(Math.ceil(vals.length * 4 / 16) * 16); const dv = new DataView(ab); vals.forEach((v, i) => { if (v.f !== undefined) dv.setFloat32(i * 4, v.f, true); else dv.setUint32(i * 4, v, true); }); return new Uint8Array(ab); }\n\n// 一次矩陣乘（T1）：x 長度 K、W 為 K×N（列優先）、b 長度 N；回傳 {result, info}\nfunction linearWgsl(dev, x, W, K, N, b) {\n  return nn.runWgsl(dev, WGSL_LINEAR,\n    [{ data: Float32Array.from(x) }, { data: W, cache: true }, { data: b, cache: true }, { data: new Float32Array(N), out: true }],\n    u32Bytes([K, N, 0, 0]), Math.ceil(N / 64)).then((outs) => outs[0]);\n}\nfunction attnWgsl(dev, q, Kc, Vc, Ln) {\n  return nn.runWgsl(dev, WGSL_ATTN,\n    [{ data: Float32Array.from(q) }, { data: Kc }, { data: Vc }, { data: new Float32Array(M.D), out: true }],\n    u32Bytes([Ln, M.H, M.HD, 0, { f: M.SCALE }, 0, 0, 0]), M.H).then((outs) => outs[0]);\n}\n\nfunction lnWgsl(dev, x, w, b) {\n  return nn.runWgsl(dev, WGSL_LN,\n    [{ data: Float32Array.from(x) }, { data: w, cache: true }, { data: b, cache: true }, { data: new Float32Array(M.D), out: true }],\n    u32Bytes([M.D, 0, 0, 0, { f: M.EPS }, 0, 0, 0]), 1).then((outs) => outs[0]);\n}\nfunction ropeWgsl(dev, x, pos) {\n  const npairs = M.D / 2;\n  return nn.runWgsl(dev, WGSL_ROPE,\n    [{ data: Float32Array.from(x) }, { data: new Float32Array(M.D), out: true }],\n    u32Bytes([{ f: pos }, { f: M.THETA }, M.HD, npairs]), Math.ceil(npairs / 64)).then((outs) => outs[0]);\n}\nfunction geluWgsl(dev, f) {\n  const n = f.length;\n  return nn.runWgsl(dev, WGSL_GELU,\n    [{ data: Float32Array.from(f) }, { data: new Float32Array(n), out: true }],\n    u32Bytes([n, 0, 0, 0]), Math.ceil(n / 64)).then((outs) => outs[0]);\n}\n\n// 建立 GPU 運算組：每次呼叫都記錄層級（T1／cpu-js），方便驗證頁確認真的走了 GPU。\nfunction makeGpuOps(opts) {\n  const o = opts || {};\n  const tiers = { linear: {}, attention: {}, layerNorm: {}, rope: {}, gelu: {} };\n  const tally = (k, tier) => { tiers[k][tier] = (tiers[k][tier] || 0) + 1; };\n  return {\n    tiers,\n    linear: async (x, W, K, N, b) => {\n      const r = await nn.tryLayers('moss_linear', { navigator: o.navigator },\n        async (dev) => linearWgsl(dev, x, W, K, N, b), null,\n        () => M.linearCpu(x, W, K, N, b));\n      tally('linear', r.info.layer);\n      return r.result;\n    },\n    attention: async (q, Kc, Vc, Ln) => {\n      const r = await nn.tryLayers('moss_attn', { navigator: o.navigator },\n        async (dev) => attnWgsl(dev, q, Kc, Vc, Ln), null,\n        () => M.attentionCpu(q, Kc, Vc, Ln));\n      tally('attention', r.info.layer);\n      return r.result;\n    },\n    layerNorm: async (x, w, b) => {\n      const r = await nn.tryLayers('moss_ln', { navigator: o.navigator },\n        async (dev) => lnWgsl(dev, x, w, b), null,\n        () => M.layerNorm(x, w, b));\n      tally('layerNorm', r.info.layer);\n      return r.result;\n    },\n    rope: async (x, pos) => {\n      const r = await nn.tryLayers('moss_rope', { navigator: o.navigator },\n        async (dev) => ropeWgsl(dev, x, pos), null,\n        () => M.rope(x, pos));\n      tally('rope', r.info.layer);\n      return r.result;\n    },\n    gelu: async (f) => {\n      const r = await nn.tryLayers('moss_gelu', { navigator: o.navigator },\n        async (dev) => geluWgsl(dev, f), null,\n        () => M.geluCpu(f));\n      tally('gelu', r.info.layer);\n      return r.result;\n    },\n  };\n}\n\nmodule.exports = { WGSL_LINEAR, WGSL_ATTN, WGSL_LN, WGSL_ROPE, WGSL_GELU, makeGpuOps, linearWgsl, attnWgsl, lnWgsl, ropeWgsl, geluWgsl };\n\n};\nMODS[\"moss_local\"] = function (module, exports, require) {\n'use strict';\n// MOSS-TTS-Nano 本地解碼器（moss_tts_local_decoder.onnx，非快取版）的 CPU 參考版（已逐節點確認）。\n// 序列共 17 個位置：0 = global_hidden（768）；1 = 文字詞元的嵌入（model.transformer.wte）；2..16 = 15 條音訊前綴的嵌入（model.audio_embeddings.c，pad=1024 歸零）。\n// 單層 pre-norm 因果 Transformer（12 頭、頭維 64、RoPE 交錯式 θ=10000、縮放 0.125、LN eps 1e-5、GELU tanh 近似），最後 ln_f。\n// 輸出：text_logits = W_text · out[0]；audio_logits[c] = W_audio_c · out[c+1]（c = 0..15）。\nconst lite = require('./onnx_lite.js');\nconst MS = require('./moss_decoder.js');\n\nconst D = 768, H = 12, HD = 64, FF = 3072, NCH_PREFIX = 15, NAUDIO = 16, PAD = 1024, SCALE = 0.125, THETA = 10000;\n\nfunction loadMossLocal(onnxBuf, dataFiles) {\n  const m = lite.parseModel(onnxBuf);\n  m.aliases = {};\n  for (const n of m.nodes) if (n.op === 'Identity' && n.inputs.length && n.outputs.length) m.aliases[n.outputs[0]] = n.inputs[0];\n  const mm = (base) => {\n    const n = m.nodes.find((x) => x.op === 'MatMul' && x.outputs[0] === base + '/MatMul_output_0');\n    if (!n) throw new Error('moss_local：找不到 MatMul ' + base);\n    return MS.readInit(m, n.inputs[1], dataFiles);\n  };\n  const p = 'model.local_transformer.h.0.';\n  const layer = {\n    ln1w: MS.readInit(m, p + 'ln_1.weight', dataFiles).data, ln1b: MS.readInit(m, p + 'ln_1.bias', dataFiles).data,\n    ln2w: MS.readInit(m, p + 'ln_2.weight', dataFiles).data, ln2b: MS.readInit(m, p + 'ln_2.bias', dataFiles).data,\n    cAttn: mm('/c_attn'), cAttnB: MS.readInit(m, p + 'attn.c_attn.bias', dataFiles).data,\n    cProj: mm('/c_proj'), cProjB: MS.readInit(m, p + 'attn.c_proj.bias', dataFiles).data,\n    fcIn: mm('/mlp/fc_in'), fcInB: MS.readInit(m, p + 'mlp.fc_in.bias', dataFiles).data,\n    fcOut: mm('/mlp/fc_out'), fcOutB: MS.readInit(m, p + 'mlp.fc_out.bias', dataFiles).data,\n  };\n  const audioHeads = [];\n  for (let c = 0; c < NAUDIO; c++) audioHeads.push(mm('/audio_lm_heads.' + c));\n  return {\n    wteText: MS.readInit(m, 'model.transformer.wte.weight', dataFiles),\n    audioEmb: Array.from({ length: NCH_PREFIX }, (_, c) => MS.readInit(m, 'model.audio_embeddings.' + c + '.weight', dataFiles)),\n    layer,\n    lnFw: MS.readInit(m, 'model.local_transformer.h.0.ln_1.weight', dataFiles).data,\n    lnFb: MS.readInit(m, 'model.local_transformer.ln_f.bias', dataFiles).data,\n    textHead: mm('/text_lm_head'),\n    audioHeads,\n  };\n}\n\n// 17×768 的因果注意力（列優先 T×D）；q/k 已 RoPE，位置為列號\nfunction ropeRows(X, T) {\n  const o = new Float32Array(T * D);\n  for (let t = 0; t < T; t++) {\n    const r = MS.rope(X.subarray(t * D, (t + 1) * D), t);\n    o.set(r, t * D);\n  }\n  return o;\n}\n\n// 單層前向（非快取）：x 為 T×D。回傳 T×D。\nasync function layerForward(x, T, L, ops) {\n  const O = ops || MS.CPU_OPS;\n  const h = new Float32Array(T * D);\n  for (let t = 0; t < T; t++) h.set(MS.layerNorm(x.subarray(t * D, (t + 1) * D), L.ln1w, L.ln1b), t * D);\n  const qkv = new Float32Array(T * 3 * D);\n  for (let t = 0; t < T; t++) qkv.set(await O.linear(h.subarray(t * D, (t + 1) * D), L.cAttn.data, D, 3 * D, L.cAttnB), t * 3 * D);\n  const q = new Float32Array(T * D), k = new Float32Array(T * D), v = new Float32Array(T * D);\n  for (let t = 0; t < T; t++) { q.set(qkv.subarray(t * 3 * D, t * 3 * D + D), t * D); k.set(qkv.subarray(t * 3 * D + D, t * 3 * D + 2 * D), t * D); v.set(qkv.subarray(t * 3 * D + 2 * D, t * 3 * D + 3 * D), t * D); }\n  const qr = ropeRows(q, T), kr = ropeRows(k, T);\n  const ao = new Float32Array(T * D);\n  for (let t = 0; t < T; t++) for (let hh = 0; hh < H; hh++) {\n    const sc = new Float64Array(t + 1);\n    let mx = -Infinity;\n    for (let j = 0; j <= t; j++) {\n      let dot = 0;\n      for (let d = 0; d < HD; d++) dot += qr[t * D + hh * HD + d] * kr[j * D + hh * HD + d];\n      sc[j] = dot * SCALE; if (sc[j] > mx) mx = sc[j];\n    }\n    let sum = 0; for (let j = 0; j <= t; j++) { sc[j] = Math.exp(sc[j] - mx); sum += sc[j]; }\n    for (let j = 0; j <= t; j++) { const pj = sc[j] / sum; for (let d = 0; d < HD; d++) ao[t * D + hh * HD + d] += pj * v[j * D + hh * HD + d]; }\n  }\n  const out = new Float32Array(T * D);\n  for (let t = 0; t < T; t++) {\n    const pr = await O.linear(ao.subarray(t * D, (t + 1) * D), L.cProj.data, D, D, L.cProjB);\n    for (let i = 0; i < D; i++) out[t * D + i] = x[t * D + i] + pr[i];\n  }\n  const out2 = new Float32Array(T * D);\n  for (let t = 0; t < T; t++) {\n    const h2 = MS.layerNorm(out.subarray(t * D, (t + 1) * D), L.ln2w, L.ln2b);\n    const f1 = await O.linear(h2, L.fcIn.data, D, FF, L.fcInB);\n    const g = MS.geluCpu(f1);\n    const f2 = await O.linear(g, L.fcOut.data, FF, D, L.fcOutB);\n    for (let i = 0; i < D; i++) out2[t * D + i] = out[t * D + i] + f2[i];\n  }\n  return out2;\n}\n\n// 一次本地前向。globalHidden：768；textId：整數；audioPrefix：15 個整數（pad=1024）。\n// 回傳 { textLogits: Float32Array, audioLogits: Float32Array[16] }\nasync function localDecode(model, globalHidden, textId, audioPrefix, ops) {\n  const O = ops || MS.CPU_OPS;\n  const T = 2 + NCH_PREFIX;\n  const x = new Float32Array(T * D);\n  x.set(globalHidden, 0);\n  x.set(model.wteText.data.subarray(textId * D, (textId + 1) * D), D);\n  for (let c = 0; c < NCH_PREFIX; c++) {\n    const id = audioPrefix[c];\n    if (id === PAD) continue;\n    x.set(model.audioEmb[c].data.subarray(id * D, (id + 1) * D), (2 + c) * D);\n  }\n  const out = await layerForward(x, T, model.layer, O);\n  const hf = new Float32Array(T * D);\n  for (let t = 0; t < T; t++) hf.set(MS.layerNorm(out.subarray(t * D, (t + 1) * D), model.lnFw, model.lnFb), t * D);\n  const textLogits = await O.linear(hf.subarray(0, D), model.textHead.data, D, model.textHead.dims[1], new Float32Array(model.textHead.dims[1]));\n  const audioLogits = [];\n  for (let c = 0; c < model.audioHeads.length; c++) { const hd = model.audioHeads[c]; audioLogits.push(await O.linear(hf.subarray((c + 1) * D, (c + 2) * D), hd.data, D, hd.dims[1], new Float32Array(hd.dims[1]))); }\n  return { textLogits, audioLogits };\n}\n\nmodule.exports = { loadMossLocal, localDecode, layerForward, D, PAD };\n\n};\nMODS[\"moss_sampling\"] = function (module, exports, require) {\n'use strict';\n// MOSS-TTS-Nano 整幀取樣（moss_tts_local_fixed_sampled_frame.onnx）的 CPU 參考版，逐節點對照圖後確認。\n// 整幀 = 文字續停判斷 + 16 條音訊碼本依序取樣，每條碼本都先跑一次本地解碼器（moss_local.js 的 localDecode）。\n//\n// 輸入：\n//   globalHidden：768 維（全域解碼器輸出）\n//   seenMask：Int32Array 長度 16×1024（repetition_seen_mask，[c][v]，非零表示該碼本已出現過 v）\n//   uAssistant：單一浮點數 0..1（assistant_random_u，決定續停）\n//   uAudio：16 個浮點數 0..1（audio_random_u，第 c 條碼本用 uAudio[c]）\n// 輸出：{ shouldContinue: 0|1, frameTokenIds: Int32Array(16) }\n//\n// 圖中的常數（已從圖讀出，不是猜的）：\n//   重複懲罰 1.2：已出現過的詞元，logit<0 時乘、否則除。\n//   溫度 0.8：懲罰後的 logit 再除以溫度。\n//   Top-K 25（對溫度後的 logit 取前 25）。\n//   Top-P 0.95：softmax 後累積機率，排除「前面累積 ≥ 0.95」的候選（第一名必留）。\n//   取樣：逆 CDF。過濾後 softmax 的累積和 cum2；計數 n = #{k : cum2[k] < clip(u, 0, 0.9999999404)}；\n//         索引 = clip(n, 0, K−1)；輸出 TopK 索引表中該位置的詞元。\n//   續停：文字頭在詞元 9（續停）與 7（停止）兩個 logit 的 softmax 第 0 項 p0；shouldContinue = (clip(u) ≤ p0)；\n//         下一幀的文字詞元 = shouldContinue ? 9 : 7（本地解碼器的位置 1）。\n//         （圖中 Constant_64 = 9、Constant_65 = 7 是 Gather 的索引，不是 0、1；先前誤判成 0、1 已修正。）\nconst ML = require('./moss_local.js');\n\nconst NAUDIO = 16, V = 1024, PAD = 1024;\nconst REP_PENALTY = 1.2, TEMP = 0.8, TOP_K = 25, TOP_P = 0.95;\nconst U_MAX = 0.9999999403953552;\nconst TEXT_CONT = 9, TEXT_STOP = 7;\n\nfunction softmaxF64(arr) {\n  let mx = -Infinity;\n  for (let i = 0; i < arr.length; i++) if (arr[i] > mx) mx = arr[i];\n  const out = new Float64Array(arr.length);\n  let s = 0;\n  for (let i = 0; i < arr.length; i++) {\n    const e = arr[i] === -Infinity ? 0 : Math.exp(arr[i] - mx);\n    out[i] = e; s += e;\n  }\n  for (let i = 0; i < arr.length; i++) out[i] /= s;\n  return out;\n}\n\nfunction clip(x, lo, hi) { return x < lo ? lo : (x > hi ? hi : x); }\n\n// 一條碼本的取樣：logits（長 V）、seen（長 V，0/1）、u（0..1）→ 詞元 id\nfunction sampleChannel(logits, seen, u) {\n  const x = new Float64Array(V);\n  for (let v = 0; v < V; v++) {\n    let l = logits[v];\n    if (seen[v]) l = l < 0 ? l * REP_PENALTY : l / REP_PENALTY;\n    x[v] = l / TEMP;\n  }\n  // TopK：依值由大到小，同值取索引小者在前（若與 ORT 的排序有差異，以 ORT 對拍為準）\n  const order = Array.from({ length: V }, (_, i) => i);\n  order.sort((a, b) => (x[b] - x[a]) || (a - b));\n  const K = Math.min(TOP_K, V);\n  const idx = order.slice(0, K);\n  const tv = Float64Array.from(idx.map((i) => x[i]));\n  // Top-P：前面所有機率之和（cumsum − 自身）≥ top_p 的候選移除\n  const p = softmaxF64(tv);\n  let cum = 0;\n  const tv2 = new Float64Array(K);\n  for (let k = 0; k < K; k++) {\n    const excl = cum;\n    cum += p[k];\n    tv2[k] = excl >= TOP_P ? -Infinity : tv[k];\n  }\n  const p2 = softmaxF64(tv2);\n  const u0 = clip(u, 0, U_MAX);\n  let c2 = 0, n = 0;\n  for (let k = 0; k < K; k++) {\n    c2 += p2[k];\n    if (c2 < u0) n++;\n  }\n  const j = clip(n, 0, K - 1);\n  return idx[j];\n}\n\n// 一整幀。model 來自 ML.loadMossLocal。\nasync function sampleFrame(model, globalHidden, seenMask, uAssistant, uAudio, ops) {\n  // 1) 文字頭：位置 0 的隱藏狀態只看得到自己（因果遮罩），故其餘位置用 pad 即可\n  const pads = new Array(NAUDIO - 1).fill(PAD);\n  const probe = await ML.localDecode(model, globalHidden, TEXT_STOP, pads, ops);\n  const p0 = softmaxF64(Float64Array.from([probe.textLogits[TEXT_CONT], probe.textLogits[TEXT_STOP]]))[0];\n  const shouldContinue = clip(uAssistant, 0, U_MAX) <= p0 ? 1 : 0;\n  const textTok = shouldContinue ? TEXT_CONT : TEXT_STOP;\n  // 2) 16 條音訊碼本依序：第 c 條用位置 c+1 的隱藏狀態，前綴為已取樣的前 c 條\n  const prefix = new Array(NAUDIO - 1).fill(PAD);\n  const frame = new Int32Array(NAUDIO);\n  for (let c = 0; c < NAUDIO; c++) {\n    const out = await ML.localDecode(model, globalHidden, textTok, prefix, ops);\n    const seen = seenMask.subarray(c * V, (c + 1) * V);\n    const tok = sampleChannel(out.audioLogits[c], seen, uAudio[c]);\n    frame[c] = tok;\n    if (c < NAUDIO - 1) prefix[c] = tok;\n  }\n  return { shouldContinue, frameTokenIds: frame };\n}\n\nmodule.exports = { sampleFrame, sampleChannel, softmaxF64, REP_PENALTY, TEMP, TOP_K, TOP_P, TEXT_CONT, TEXT_STOP };\n\n};\nMODS[\"moss_gpu_runners\"] = function (module, exports, require) {\n'use strict';\n// MOSS-TTS-Nano 的選用 GPU 管線（設定 mossGpu，預設關；DESIGN.webgpu-cuda.md §7.11、§7.12、§7.14）。\n// 把 moss_worker.js 的 runners（prefill／decode／sample）換成 cudaweb 的 WebGPU 版：全域解碼一步（moss_decoder＋moss_gpu）與整幀取樣（moss_sampling＋moss_local）。\n// codec 解碼仍走 ORT（卷積 GPU 版已驗證，但整圖還在 CPU 解釋器，比 wasm 慢，不接）。\n// 預填以逐列 decodeStep 代替 prefill 圖（與驗證頁相同，已對 ORT 通過）。\n// 任何一步的運算掉到 cpu-js 層（沒有 WebGPU、裝置遺失、T1 失敗）就丟錯，呼叫端退回 ORT wasm 路徑；診斷（層別、耗時、退回原因）寫在 info。\n// 注意：這個檔案由 scripts/embed-code-ui.js 連同 gpu/ 底下的模組一起嵌進 MOSS worker，所以只能 require 那份清單裡的檔案。\nconst MD = require('../gpu/moss_decoder.js');\nconst MS = require('../gpu/moss_sampling.js');\nconst ML = require('../gpu/moss_local.js');\nconst MGPU = require('../gpu/moss_gpu.js');\n\nconst now = () => (typeof performance !== 'undefined' ? performance.now() : Date.now());\n\n// 探測 WebGPU（要有 adapter 才算可用）。回 { ok, reason }\nasync function probe(nav) {\n  try {\n    if (!nav || !nav.gpu) return { ok: false, reason: '沒有 WebGPU（navigator.gpu 不存在）' };\n    const ad = await nav.gpu.requestAdapter();\n    if (!ad) return { ok: false, reason: '沒有可用的 WebGPU adapter' };\n    return { ok: true, reason: '' };\n  } catch (e) { return { ok: false, reason: 'WebGPU 探測失敗：' + String((e && e.message) || e) }; }\n}\n\n// 載入權重（一次；之後重用）。deps：{ navigator, fetchBytes(name)→Promise<Uint8Array>, tts: { global, globalData, local, localData }（檔名） }\nasync function load(deps) {\n  const t0 = now(), nav = deps.navigator, p = await probe(nav);\n  if (!p.ok) throw new Error(p.reason);\n  const f = deps.tts, gOnnx = await deps.fetchBytes(f.global), gData = await deps.fetchBytes(f.globalData), lOnnx = await deps.fetchBytes(f.local), lData = await deps.fetchBytes(f.localData);\n  const gModel = MD.loadMossDecodeStep(gOnnx, { [f.globalData]: gData });\n  const lModel = ML.loadMossLocal(lOnnx, { [f.localData]: lData });\n  const ops = MGPU.makeGpuOps({ navigator: nav });\n  return { gModel, lModel, ops, loadMs: Math.round(now() - t0) };\n}\n\n// 任何運算掉到 T1 以外的層就算失敗（cpu-js 比 wasm 慢很多，不值得繼續）\nfunction assertT1(ops, where) {\n  for (const k of Object.keys(ops.tiers)) for (const layer of Object.keys(ops.tiers[k])) if (layer !== 'T1') throw new Error('GPU 運算退到 ' + layer + '（' + k + '，' + where + '）');\n}\n\n// 回 { runners, info }：runners 介面同 moss_core.generate 要的 { prefill, decode, sample }\nfunction makeRunners(state, M) {\n  const { gModel, lModel, ops } = state, info = { tiers: ops.tiers, ms: { prefill: 0, decode: 0, sample: 0 } };\n  const runners = {\n    prefill: async (ids, rows) => {\n      const t0 = now(); let caches = null, hidden = null;\n      for (let r = 0; r < rows; r++) { const o = await MD.decodeStep(gModel, ids.subarray(r * M.ROW, (r + 1) * M.ROW), caches, ops); caches = o.caches; hidden = o.hidden; }\n      assertT1(ops, 'prefill'); info.ms.prefill += now() - t0;\n      return { hidden, past: caches };\n    },\n    decode: async (row, len, past) => {\n      const t0 = now(); const o = await MD.decodeStep(gModel, row, past, ops); assertT1(ops, 'decode'); info.ms.decode += now() - t0;\n      return { hidden: o.hidden, past: o.caches };\n    },\n    sample: async (hidden, seen, u1, u2) => {\n      const t0 = now(); const s = await MS.sampleFrame(lModel, hidden, seen, u1[0], u2, ops); assertT1(ops, 'sample'); info.ms.sample += now() - t0;\n      return { cont: s.shouldContinue === 1, frame: s.frameTokenIds };\n    },\n  };\n  return { runners, info };\n}\n\nmodule.exports = { probe, load, makeRunners, assertT1 };\n\n};\nconst CACHE = {}; function req(p) { const n = String(p).replace(/^(\\.\\.?\\/)+(gpu\\/|tts\\/)?/, '').replace(/\\.js$/, ''); if (n === 'gpu_core') { if (!self.FaGpuCore) throw new Error('FaGpuCore 還沒載入'); return self.FaGpuCore; } if (CACHE[n]) return CACHE[n].exports; if (!MODS[n]) throw new Error('沒有模組 ' + p); const m = { exports: {} }; CACHE[n] = m; MODS[n].call(m.exports, m, m.exports, req); return m.exports; }\nreturn req('moss_gpu_runners');",FA_MIDI_GPU_SRC="const MODS = {};\nMODS[\"nn_ops\"] = function (module, exports, require) {\n// nn_ops.js — 訓練步用的 cudaweb 核心（DESIGN.webgpu-cuda.md §12.4，第三階段後段）。\n// 每個操作三層：T1 = WGSL（WebGPU）、T3 = WebGL2（尚未實作，會寫明）、cpu-js = CPU 參考版。\n// 目前已完成的操作：RMSNorm。之後依序加入 softmax、SiLU、RoPE、AdamW。\n// 注意：WGSL 原始碼在真 WebGPU 上尚未驗證；測試的假裝置用 CPU 參考版執行，只驗證主機端的綁定、回讀與降級流程。\n'use strict';\nconst core = require('./gpu_core.js');\nconst GP = require('./gpu_pool.js');\n\nconst USAGE = { MAP_READ: 0x0001, COPY_SRC: 0x0004, COPY_DST: 0x0008, UNIFORM: 0x0040, STORAGE: 0x0080 };\n// WebGL2 常數（用數字，因為假 WebGL2 上下文沒有這些符號）\nconst GLC = { VERTEX: 0x8B31, FRAG: 0x8B30, COMPILE: 0x8B81, LINK: 0x8B82, TEX2D: 0x0DE1, RGBA32F: 0x8814, RGBA: 0x1908, FLOAT: 0x1406,\n  FB: 0x8D40, COLOR0: 0x8CE0, FB_OK: 0x8CD5, UNIT0: 0x84C0, TRIANGLES: 0x0004, NEAREST: 0x2600, MIN_F: 0x2801, MAG_F: 0x2800, MAX_TEX: 0x0D33 };\nconst NOTE_T3 = 'WebGL2 版尚未實作';  // 僅供舊測試參照；新版降級原因以實際狀態為準\n\n// 取得 WebGL2 上下文：opts.gl 可注入（測試用）；瀏覽器用 OffscreenCanvas；沒有就 null\nfunction getGl(opts) {\n  const o = opts || {};\n  if (o.gl !== undefined) return o.gl;\n  if (typeof OffscreenCanvas !== 'undefined') {\n    try { return new OffscreenCanvas(1, 1).getContext('webgl2'); } catch (e) { return null; }\n  }\n  return null;\n}\n// WebGL2 可用性：需要上下文，且需要 EXT_color_buffer_float（浮點渲染目標）。沒有編碼退路（RGBA8 打包未實作）。\nfunction glSupport(gl) {\n  if (!gl) return { ok: false, reason: 'WebGL2 上下文不可用' };\n  if (!gl.getExtension('EXT_color_buffer_float')) return { ok: false, reason: 'WebGL2 沒有 EXT_color_buffer_float（浮點渲染目標），無法寫入 f32 結果；RGBA8 編碼退路尚未實作' };\n  return { ok: true, reason: '' };\n}\n\n// 全螢幕三角形（用 gl_VertexID，不需要頂點緩衝區）\nconst VS_FULL = '#version 300 es\\nvoid main(){ vec2 p = vec2(float((gl_VertexID << 1) & 2), float(gl_VertexID & 2)); gl_Position = vec4(p * 2.0 - 1.0, 0.0, 1.0); }\\n';\n\n// 把長度 len 的陣列打包成 W×H 的 RGBA32F 紋理（只用 R 通道）\nfunction packTex(gl, arr, W, H) {\n  const px = new Float32Array(W * H * 4);\n  for (let i = 0; i < arr.length; i++) px[i * 4] = arr[i];\n  const tex = gl.createTexture();\n  gl.bindTexture(GLC.TEX2D, tex); // 呼叫端已先選好 texture unit\n  gl.texParameteri(GLC.TEX2D, GLC.MIN_F, GLC.NEAREST);\n  gl.texParameteri(GLC.TEX2D, GLC.MAG_F, GLC.NEAREST);\n  gl.texStorage2D(GLC.TEX2D, 1, GLC.RGBA32F, W, H);\n  gl.texSubImage2D(GLC.TEX2D, 0, 0, 0, W, H, GLC.RGBA, GLC.FLOAT, px);\n  return tex;\n}\n\n// 單趟繪製：ins = [Float32Array]（依序綁定 uniform sampler uIn0、uIn1…，在 shader 裡宣告）；\n// uni = { i: {名稱: 整數}, f: {名稱: 浮點} }；n = 輸出長度。shader 的 uW 由這裡自動給（所有紋理共用寬度）。\n// 回傳 Float32Array(n)：第 k 個元素在紋理的 (k % W, floor(k / W))，取 R 通道。\nfunction glRun(gl, fsSrc, ins, uni, n, samplerNames) {\n  const maxTex = gl.getParameter(GLC.MAX_TEX) || 4096;\n  const longest = Math.max(n, ...ins.map((a) => a.length));\n  const W = Math.max(1, Math.min(maxTex, longest));\n  const outH = Math.ceil(n / W), inH = Math.ceil(longest / W);\n  if (outH > maxTex) throw new Error('WebGL2：輸出 ' + n + ' 個元素超過紋理上限（寬 ' + W + '、高 ' + outH + '），需要分塊（尚未實作）');\n  const vs = gl.createShader(GLC.VERTEX); gl.shaderSource(vs, VS_FULL); gl.compileShader(vs);\n  const fs = gl.createShader(GLC.FRAG); gl.shaderSource(fs, fsSrc); gl.compileShader(fs);\n  if (!gl.getShaderParameter(fs, GLC.COMPILE)) throw new Error('WebGL2 片段著色器編譯失敗：' + gl.getShaderInfoLog(fs));\n  const prog = gl.createProgram(); gl.attachShader(prog, vs); gl.attachShader(prog, fs); gl.linkProgram(prog);\n  if (!gl.getProgramParameter(prog, GLC.LINK)) throw new Error('WebGL2 程式連結失敗：' + gl.getProgramInfoLog(prog));\n  gl.useProgram(prog);\n  const texs = [];\n  ins.forEach((a, k) => {\n    gl.activeTexture(GLC.UNIT0 + k);\n    texs.push(packTex(gl, a, W, inH));\n    gl.uniform1i(gl.getUniformLocation(prog, samplerNames[k]), k);\n  });\n  const uOut = ins.length;\n  const outTex = gl.createTexture();\n  gl.activeTexture(GLC.UNIT0 + uOut); gl.bindTexture(GLC.TEX2D, outTex);\n  gl.texParameteri(GLC.TEX2D, GLC.MIN_F, GLC.NEAREST); gl.texParameteri(GLC.TEX2D, GLC.MAG_F, GLC.NEAREST);\n  gl.texStorage2D(GLC.TEX2D, 1, GLC.RGBA32F, W, outH);\n  const fb = gl.createFramebuffer();\n  gl.bindFramebuffer(GLC.FB, fb);\n  gl.framebufferTexture2D(GLC.FB, GLC.COLOR0, GLC.TEX2D, outTex, 0);\n  if (gl.checkFramebufferStatus(GLC.FB) !== GLC.FB_OK) throw new Error('WebGL2 幀緩衝不完整（可能不支援浮點渲染目標）');\n  gl.uniform1i(gl.getUniformLocation(prog, 'uW'), W);\n  for (const k of Object.keys(uni.i || {})) gl.uniform1i(gl.getUniformLocation(prog, k), uni.i[k]);\n  for (const k of Object.keys(uni.f || {})) gl.uniform1f(gl.getUniformLocation(prog, k), uni.f[k]);\n  gl.viewport(0, 0, W, outH);\n  gl.drawArrays(GLC.TRIANGLES, 0, 3);\n  const px = new Float32Array(W * outH * 4);\n  gl.readPixels(0, 0, W, outH, GLC.RGBA, GLC.FLOAT, px);\n  const out = new Float32Array(n);\n  for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) out[i] = px[i * 4];\n  // 釋放（假上下文不一定有全部方法，逐一檢查）\n  [...texs, outTex].forEach((t) => { if (gl.deleteTexture) gl.deleteTexture(t); });\n  if (gl.deleteFramebuffer) gl.deleteFramebuffer(fb);\n  return out;\n}\n\n// 三層的實際狀態：供 backend_info 與測試使用。ops 只列這個檔案實作的核心。\nconst NN_OPS = ['rmsnorm', 'softmax', 'silu', 'rope', 'adamw'];\nasync function nnBackendInfo(opts) {\n  const o = opts || {};\n  const nav = o.navigator !== undefined ? o.navigator : (typeof navigator !== 'undefined' ? navigator : undefined);\n  const g = await getDevice(nav);\n  const gs = glSupport(getGl(o));\n  const ops = {};\n  for (const op of NN_OPS) ops[op] = { t1: g.dev ? 'native' : 'missing', t3: gs.ok ? 'native' : 'missing', cpu: 'native' };\n  return { webgpu: { available: !!g.dev, reason: g.reason || '' }, webgl2: { available: gs.ok, reason: gs.reason }, ops: ops };\n}\n\n// ---------- GPU 獨占：同一程序內，基準、變體競賽、屋頂量測都要乾淨的 GPU，一次只能有一個在跑 ----------\n// requestExclusiveGpu(reason, { signal }) → Promise<release>：排隊依序取得；signal（AbortSignal）可在排隊中取消（reject，不佔鎖）。\n// 授予前依註冊順序呼叫所有「閒置 GPU 持有者」的 release()（模型引擎用 registerIdleGpuHolder 註冊）。\n//   某個 release 丟錯：記在 release.failures（{ name, error }），仍然授予（後續持有者照常釋放）；呼叫端自己決定這次量測能不能信。\n// release() 可重複呼叫，只釋放一次。持有者被釋放後不必恢復，下次使用時自行重載。\nconst idleGpuHolders = [];   // { name, release }\nfunction registerIdleGpuHolder(name, release) {\n  const h = { name: String(name || 'unnamed'), release: release };\n  idleGpuHolders.push(h);\n  return function unregister() { const i = idleGpuHolders.indexOf(h); if (i >= 0) idleGpuHolders.splice(i, 1); };\n}\nlet exclChain = Promise.resolve();\nlet exclPending = 0;      // 排隊中（尚未授予）\nlet exclHeld = false;     // 目前有人持有\nlet exclHolderReason = '';\nfunction requestExclusiveGpu(reason, opts) {\n  const o = opts || {};\n  const sig = o.signal || null;\n  const why = String(reason || 'gpu');\n  if (sig && sig.aborted) { const e = new Error('已取消排隊中的 GPU 獨占（' + why + '）'); e.name = 'AbortError'; return Promise.reject(e); }\n  exclPending++;\n  return new Promise((resolve, reject) => {\n    let done = false;   // true＝已取消或已授予（之後的事件不再處理）\n    if (sig && typeof sig.addEventListener === 'function') {\n      sig.addEventListener('abort', () => {\n        if (done) return;\n        done = true; exclPending--;\n        const e = new Error('已取消排隊中的 GPU 獨占（' + why + '）'); e.name = 'AbortError'; reject(e);\n      }, { once: true });\n    }\n    exclChain = exclChain.then(() => {\n      if (done) return;            // 已取消：不佔鎖，鏈照常往下走\n      done = true; exclPending--;\n      return grantExclusive(why, resolve);   // 鏈等到 release() 被呼叫才往下\n    });\n  });\n}\n// 授予：先釋放閒置持有者，再把 release 交給呼叫端；鏈上的這一格要等 release() 被呼叫後才結束\nasync function grantExclusive(why, resolve) {\n  exclHeld = true; exclHolderReason = why;\n  const failures = [];\n  for (const h of idleGpuHolders.slice()) {\n    try { await h.release(); } catch (e) { failures.push({ name: h.name, error: String((e && e.message) || e).slice(0, 160) }); }\n  }\n  let releasedOnce = false, resolveGate = null;\n  const gate = new Promise((r) => { resolveGate = r; });\n  const release = () => { if (releasedOnce) return; releasedOnce = true; exclHeld = false; exclHolderReason = ''; resolveGate(); };\n  release.failures = failures;\n  resolve(release);\n  return gate;\n}\n// 量測的包裝：拿獨占後執行 fn({ releaseFailures })；opts.background：有獨占在跑或排隊就跳過（回傳 skipped），不排隊\nfunction withMeasureLock(fn, opts) {\n  const o = opts || {};\n  if (o.background && (exclHeld || exclPending > 0)) {\n    return Promise.resolve({ skipped: true, reason: '有 GPU 獨占在跑或排隊，背景競賽暫停' });\n  }\n  return requestExclusiveGpu(o.reason || 'measure').then(async (release) => {\n    try { return await fn({ releaseFailures: release.failures }); } finally { release(); }\n  });\n}\nfunction measureLockState() { return { running: exclHeld, pending: exclPending, holder: exclHolderReason }; }\n\n// 取得 WebGPU 裝置（每個 navigator 只要一次）。沒有就回傳 dev:null 與原因。\nconst devCache = new Map();\nfunction getDevice(nav) {\n  if (!nav || !nav.gpu) return Promise.resolve({ dev: null, reason: 'WebGPU 不可用（navigator.gpu 不存在）' });\n  if (!devCache.has(nav)) {\n    devCache.set(nav, (async () => {\n      try {\n        const pa = await core.probeAdapter(nav);\n        if (!pa.adapter) return { dev: null, reason: 'WebGPU 沒有可用的介面卡' + (pa.probe && pa.probe.reason ? '（' + pa.probe.reason + '）' : '') };\n        // 只有介面卡真的有 shader-f16 才要求這個功能（沒有就不要求，f16 核心不會被選到）\n        const feats = pa.adapter.features;\n        const wantF16 = !!(feats && (typeof feats.has === 'function' ? feats.has('shader-f16') : false));\n        // subgroups 同理：有才要求（子群組核心 mm_subgroup 需要；沒有時 kernel_select 不會選它）\n        const wantSg = !!(feats && typeof feats.has === 'function' && feats.has('subgroups'));\n        const reqF = [].concat(wantF16 ? ['shader-f16'] : [], wantSg ? ['subgroups'] : []);\n        const dev = await pa.adapter.requestDevice(reqF.length ? { requiredFeatures: reqF } : undefined);\n        try { dev.lost.then((i) => console.warn('[gpu] 裝置遺失（' + i.reason + '）：' + String(i.message).slice(0, 200) + '；最近的 GPU 工作：' + (globalThis.__faGpuLast || '未知'))); } catch (_) { /* 診斷用，失敗不影響 */ }\n        return { dev: dev, reason: null };\n      } catch (e) { return { dev: null, reason: 'WebGPU 初始化失敗：' + String((e && e.message) || e) }; }\n    })());\n  }\n  return devCache.get(nav);\n}\n\n// 通用的單次分派：bufs = [{data: Float32Array, out: bool}]，依序綁定 0..n-1；uniform 綁在最後一個索引\nasync function runWgsl(dev, code, bufs, uniform, groups) {\n  globalThis.__faGpuLast = 'runWgsl:' + ((/@kernel (\\w+)/.exec(code) || [])[1] || (/fn (\\w+)/.exec(code) || [])[1] || '?');\n  // 標 cache:true 的輸入（權重）常駐在 GPU：以 typed array 物件為鍵（WeakMap），同一份權重只上傳一次\n  const rc = dev.__cudawebRes || (dev.__cudawebRes = new WeakMap());\n  const objs = bufs.map((b) => {\n    if (b.cache) { const hit = rc.get(b.data); if (hit) return hit; }\n    const buf = dev.createBuffer({ size: b.data.byteLength, usage: USAGE.STORAGE | USAGE.COPY_SRC | USAGE.COPY_DST });\n    dev.queue.writeBuffer(buf, 0, b.data);\n    if (b.cache) rc.set(b.data, buf);\n    return buf;\n  });\n  const ub = dev.createBuffer({ size: Math.max(16, Math.ceil(uniform.byteLength / 16) * 16), usage: USAGE.UNIFORM | USAGE.COPY_DST });\n  dev.queue.writeBuffer(ub, 0, uniform);\n  // pipeline 快取（同一份 WGSL 只建一次；原本每次呼叫都重建，是注意力比 CPU 慢的主因之一）\n  const pc = dev.__cudawebPipes || (dev.__cudawebPipes = new Map());\n  let pipe = pc.get(code);\n  if (!pipe) { const module = dev.createShaderModule({ code: code }); pipe = dev.createComputePipeline({ layout: 'auto', compute: { module: module, entryPoint: 'main' } }); pc.set(code, pipe); }\n  const entries = objs.map((buf, i) => ({ binding: i, resource: { buffer: buf } }));\n  entries.push({ binding: bufs.length, resource: { buffer: ub } });\n  const bg = dev.createBindGroup({ layout: pipe.getBindGroupLayout(0), entries: entries });\n  const enc = dev.createCommandEncoder();\n  const pass = enc.beginComputePass();\n  pass.setPipeline(pipe); pass.setBindGroup(0, bg);\n  // 超過單維 65535 個工作群組時改二維派發；著色器以 gid.x + gid.y·4194240（=65535×64）還原扁平索引\n  // groups 給陣列 [x, y, z] 時照三維派發（平鋪矩陣乘用：x 是欄方向的平鋪、y 是列方向、z 是批次）\n  if (Array.isArray(groups)) pass.dispatchWorkgroups(groups[0], groups[1] || 1, groups[2] || 1);\n  else if (groups > 65535) pass.dispatchWorkgroups(65535, Math.ceil(groups / 65535)); else pass.dispatchWorkgroups(groups);\n  pass.end();\n  const rb = bufs.map((b) => (b.out ? dev.createBuffer({ size: b.data.byteLength, usage: USAGE.MAP_READ | USAGE.COPY_DST }) : null));\n  bufs.forEach((b, i) => { if (b.out) enc.copyBufferToBuffer(objs[i], 0, rb[i], 0, b.data.byteLength); });\n  dev.queue.submit([enc.finish()]);\n  const outs = [];\n  for (let i = 0; i < bufs.length; i++) {\n    if (!bufs[i].out) continue;\n    await rb[i].mapAsync(1);\n    outs.push(new (bufs[i].data.constructor === Int32Array ? Int32Array : Float32Array)(rb[i].getMappedRange().slice(0)));\n    rb[i].unmap(); if (rb[i].destroy) rb[i].destroy();\n  }\n  objs.forEach((buf, i) => { if (!bufs[i].cache && buf.destroy) buf.destroy(); });\n  if (ub.destroy) ub.destroy();\n  return outs;\n}\n\n// 先試 T1；沒有 WebGPU、或執行失敗就退到 CPU 參考版，原因照實寫進 info\n// 三層：T1（WGSL）→ T3（WebGL2）→ cpu-js。每一層失敗都把原因接到 reason。\nasync function tryLayers(name, opts, gpuFn, glFn, refFn) {\n  const o = opts || {};\n  const nav = o.navigator !== undefined ? o.navigator : (typeof navigator !== 'undefined' ? navigator : undefined);\n  const notes = [];\n  const glAvail = glSupport(getGl(o)).ok && !!glFn ? 'native' : 'missing';  // webgl2 欄位回報「這個核心的 WebGL2 層是否可用」\n  const g = await getDevice(nav);\n  if (g.dev) {\n    try { return { result: await gpuFn(g.dev), info: layerInfo(name, 'T1', '', glAvail) }; }\n    catch (e) { notes.push('WGSL 執行失敗：' + String((e && e.message) || e)); }\n  } else notes.push(g.reason);\n  const gl = getGl(o);\n  const gs = glSupport(gl);\n  let glState = 'missing';\n  if (gs.ok && glFn) {\n    glState = 'native';\n    try { return { result: glFn(gl), info: layerInfo(name, 'T3', notes.join('；'), 'native') }; }\n    catch (e) { glState = 'failed'; notes.push('WebGL2 執行失敗：' + String((e && e.message) || e)); }\n  } else if (!gs.ok) notes.push(gs.reason);\n  else notes.push('WebGL2 版尚未實作（此核心）');\n  // refFn 可以是非同步的（例如純 CPU 池）：這裡一律 await，同步的參考實作照常\n  return { result: await refFn(), info: layerInfo(name, 'cpu-js', notes.join('；'), glState) };\n}\nfunction layerInfo(op, layer, reason, webgl2) {\n  return { lib: 'cudaweb-nn', op: op, layer: layer, reason: reason || '', webgl2: webgl2 };\n}\n\n// ---------- RMSNorm ----------\n// y[t,i] = x[t,i] · g[i] / sqrt(mean_i(x[t,·]²) + eps)；x 為 T×d 列主序\nfunction rmsnormRef(x, g, T, d, eps) {\n  if (x.length !== T * d) throw new Error('rmsnorm：x 的長度 ' + x.length + ' 與 T×d=' + (T * d) + ' 不符');\n  if (g.length !== d) throw new Error('rmsnorm：g 的長度 ' + g.length + ' 與 d=' + d + ' 不符');\n  const y = new Float64Array(T * d);\n  for (let t = 0; t < T; t++) {\n    let s = 0;\n    for (let i = 0; i < d; i++) s += x[t * d + i] * x[t * d + i];\n    const inv = 1 / Math.sqrt(s / d + eps);\n    for (let i = 0; i < d; i++) y[t * d + i] = x[t * d + i] * inv * g[i];\n  }\n  return y;\n}\n\nconst WGSL_RMSNORM = `\nstruct P { rows: u32, d: u32, eps: f32, pad: u32 }\n@group(0) @binding(0) var<storage, read> x: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(1) var<storage, read> g: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(2) var<storage, read_write> y: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(3) var<uniform> p: P;\n// @kernel rmsnorm\n@compute @workgroup_size(64)\nfn main(@builtin(global_invocation_id) gid: vec3<u32>) {\n  let r = gid.x;\n  if (r >= p.rows) { return; }\n  var s: f32 = 0.0;\n  for (var i: u32 = 0u; i < p.d; i = i + 1u) { let v = x[r * p.d + i]; s = s + v * v; }\n  let inv = 1.0 / sqrt(s / f32(p.d) + p.eps);\n  for (var i: u32 = 0u; i < p.d; i = i + 1u) { y[r * p.d + i] = x[r * p.d + i] * inv * g[i]; }\n}\n`;\n\n// WebGL2 片段著色器：每個輸出像素算自己那一列的平方和（單趟、不用多趟縮減；列長度小時成本可接受，大列再改多趟）\nconst FS_RMSNORM = `#version 300 es\nprecision highp float;\nprecision highp int;\n// @kernel rmsnorm\nuniform highp sampler2D uX;\nuniform highp sampler2D uG;\nuniform int uW;\nuniform int uRows;\nuniform int uD;\nuniform float uEps;\nout vec4 fragColor;\nfloat fetchX(int i) { return texelFetch(uX, ivec2(i % uW, i / uW), 0).r; }\nfloat fetchG(int i) { return texelFetch(uG, ivec2(i % uW, i / uW), 0).r; }\nvoid main() {\n  int idx = int(gl_FragCoord.y) * uW + int(gl_FragCoord.x);\n  if (idx >= uRows * uD) { fragColor = vec4(0.0); return; }\n  int row = idx / uD;\n  int i = idx - row * uD;\n  float s = 0.0;\n  for (int j = 0; j < uD; j++) { float v = fetchX(row * uD + j); s += v * v; }\n  float inv = 1.0 / sqrt(s / float(uD) + uEps);\n  fragColor = vec4(fetchX(idx) * inv * fetchG(i), 0.0, 0.0, 1.0);\n}\n`;\n\nasync function rmsnorm(x, g, T, d, eps, opts) {\n  const xf = Float32Array.from(x), gf = Float32Array.from(g);\n  return tryLayers('rmsnorm', opts,\n    async (dev) => {\n      const uni = new ArrayBuffer(16);\n      new Uint32Array(uni, 0, 2).set([T, d]);\n      new Float32Array(uni, 8, 1)[0] = eps;\n      const outs = await runWgsl(dev, WGSL_RMSNORM,\n        [{ data: xf, out: false }, { data: gf, out: false }, { data: new Float32Array(T * d), out: true }],\n        uni, Math.ceil(T / 64));\n      return outs[0];\n    },\n    (gl) => glRun(gl, FS_RMSNORM, [xf, gf], { i: { uRows: T, uD: d }, f: { uEps: eps } }, T * d, ['uX', 'uG']),\n    () => rmsnormRef(xf, gf, T, d, eps));\n}\n\n// ---------- softmax（沿最後一維，數值穩定：先減最大值）----------\n// x 為 rows×cols 列主序；每列獨立\nfunction softmaxRef(x, rows, cols) {\n  if (x.length !== rows * cols) throw new Error('softmax：x 的長度 ' + x.length + ' 與 rows×cols=' + (rows * cols) + ' 不符');\n  const y = new Float64Array(rows * cols);\n  for (let r = 0; r < rows; r++) {\n    let mx = -Infinity;\n    for (let c = 0; c < cols; c++) if (x[r * cols + c] > mx) mx = x[r * cols + c];\n    let s = 0;\n    for (let c = 0; c < cols; c++) { const e = Math.exp(x[r * cols + c] - mx); y[r * cols + c] = e; s += e; }\n    for (let c = 0; c < cols; c++) y[r * cols + c] /= s;\n  }\n  return y;\n}\n\nconst WGSL_SOFTMAX = `\nstruct P { rows: u32, cols: u32, pad0: u32, pad1: u32 }\n@group(0) @binding(0) var<storage, read> x: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(1) var<storage, read_write> y: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(2) var<uniform> p: P;\n// @kernel softmax\n@compute @workgroup_size(64)\nfn main(@builtin(global_invocation_id) gid: vec3<u32>) {\n  let r = gid.x;\n  if (r >= p.rows) { return; }\n  var mx: f32 = x[r * p.cols];\n  for (var c: u32 = 1u; c < p.cols; c = c + 1u) { mx = max(mx, x[r * p.cols + c]); }\n  var s: f32 = 0.0;\n  for (var c: u32 = 0u; c < p.cols; c = c + 1u) { let e = exp(x[r * p.cols + c] - mx); y[r * p.cols + c] = e; s = s + e; }\n  for (var c: u32 = 0u; c < p.cols; c = c + 1u) { y[r * p.cols + c] = y[r * p.cols + c] / s; }\n}\n`;\n\n// WebGL2 片段著色器：每個輸出像素對自己那一列取最大值與指數和（單趟）\nconst FS_SOFTMAX = `#version 300 es\nprecision highp float;\nprecision highp int;\n// @kernel softmax\nuniform highp sampler2D uX;\nuniform int uW;\nuniform int uRows;\nuniform int uCols;\nout vec4 fragColor;\nfloat fetchX(int i) { return texelFetch(uX, ivec2(i % uW, i / uW), 0).r; }\nvoid main() {\n  int idx = int(gl_FragCoord.y) * uW + int(gl_FragCoord.x);\n  if (idx >= uRows * uCols) { fragColor = vec4(0.0); return; }\n  int row = idx / uCols;\n  float mx = fetchX(row * uCols);\n  for (int c = 1; c < uCols; c++) mx = max(mx, fetchX(row * uCols + c));\n  float s = 0.0;\n  for (int c = 0; c < uCols; c++) s += exp(fetchX(row * uCols + c) - mx);\n  fragColor = vec4(exp(fetchX(idx) - mx) / s, 0.0, 0.0, 1.0);\n}\n`;\n\nasync function softmax(x, rows, cols, opts) {\n  const xf = Float32Array.from(x);\n  return tryLayers('softmax', opts,\n    async (dev) => {\n      const uni = new ArrayBuffer(16);\n      new Uint32Array(uni, 0, 2).set([rows, cols]);\n      const outs = await runWgsl(dev, WGSL_SOFTMAX,\n        [{ data: xf, out: false }, { data: new Float32Array(rows * cols), out: true }],\n        uni, Math.ceil(rows / 64));\n      return outs[0];\n    },\n    (gl) => glRun(gl, FS_SOFTMAX, [xf], { i: { uRows: rows, uCols: cols } }, rows * cols, ['uX']),\n    () => softmaxRef(xf, rows, cols));\n}\n\n// ---------- SiLU（逐元素）：y = x · sigmoid(x) = x / (1 + e^(−x)) ----------\nfunction siluRef(x) {\n  const y = new Float64Array(x.length);\n  for (let i = 0; i < x.length; i++) y[i] = x[i] / (1 + Math.exp(-x[i]));\n  return y;\n}\n\nconst WGSL_SILU = `\nstruct P { n: u32, pad0: u32, pad1: u32, pad2: u32 }\n@group(0) @binding(0) var<storage, read> x: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(1) var<storage, read_write> y: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(2) var<uniform> p: P;\n// @kernel silu\n@compute @workgroup_size(64)\nfn main(@builtin(global_invocation_id) gid: vec3<u32>) {\n  let i = gid.x;\n  if (i >= p.n) { return; }\n  let v = x[i];\n  y[i] = v / (1.0 + exp(-v));\n}\n`;\n\n// WebGL2 片段著色器：逐元素 x / (1 + e^(−x))\nconst FS_SILU = `#version 300 es\nprecision highp float;\nprecision highp int;\n// @kernel silu\nuniform highp sampler2D uX;\nuniform int uW;\nuniform int uN;\nout vec4 fragColor;\nvoid main() {\n  int idx = int(gl_FragCoord.y) * uW + int(gl_FragCoord.x);\n  if (idx >= uN) { fragColor = vec4(0.0); return; }\n  float v = texelFetch(uX, ivec2(idx % uW, idx / uW), 0).r;\n  fragColor = vec4(v / (1.0 + exp(-v)), 0.0, 0.0, 1.0);\n}\n`;\n\nasync function silu(x, opts) {\n  const xf = Float32Array.from(x);\n  return tryLayers('silu', opts,\n    async (dev) => {\n      const uni = new ArrayBuffer(16);\n      new Uint32Array(uni, 0, 1).set([xf.length]);\n      const outs = await runWgsl(dev, WGSL_SILU,\n        [{ data: xf, out: false }, { data: new Float32Array(xf.length), out: true }],\n        uni, Math.ceil(xf.length / 64));\n      return outs[0];\n    },\n    (gl) => glRun(gl, FS_SILU, [xf], { i: { uN: xf.length } }, xf.length, ['uX']),\n    () => siluRef(xf));\n}\n\n// ---------- RoPE（旋轉位置編碼）----------\n// x 為 T×(H·hd) 列主序；每個 head 內相鄰兩維一組，角度 θ = t · 10000^(−2i/hd)；dir=−1 為反向（轉置旋轉）\nfunction ropeRef(x, T, H, hd, dir) {\n  if (x.length !== T * H * hd) throw new Error('rope：x 的長度 ' + x.length + ' 與 T×H×hd=' + (T * H * hd) + ' 不符');\n  if (hd % 2 !== 0) throw new Error('rope：hd 必須是偶數（收到 ' + hd + '）');\n  const y = new Float64Array(x.length), d = H * hd;\n  for (let t = 0; t < T; t++) for (let h = 0; h < H; h++) for (let i = 0; i < hd / 2; i++) {\n    const th = t * Math.pow(10000, -2 * i / hd), c = Math.cos(th), s = dir * Math.sin(th);\n    const o = t * d + h * hd + 2 * i;\n    const a = x[o], b = x[o + 1];\n    y[o] = a * c - b * s;\n    y[o + 1] = a * s + b * c;\n  }\n  return y;\n}\n\nconst WGSL_ROPE = `\nstruct P { T: u32, H: u32, hd: u32, dir: f32 }\n@group(0) @binding(0) var<storage, read> x: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(1) var<storage, read_write> y: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(2) var<uniform> p: P;\n// @kernel rope\n@compute @workgroup_size(64)\nfn main(@builtin(global_invocation_id) gid: vec3<u32>) {\n  let hp = p.hd / 2u;\n  let total = p.T * p.H * hp;\n  let k = gid.x;\n  if (k >= total) { return; }\n  let i = k % hp;\n  let h = (k / hp) % p.H;\n  let t = k / (hp * p.H);\n  let d = p.H * p.hd;\n  let th = f32(t) * pow(10000.0, -2.0 * f32(i) / f32(p.hd));\n  let c = cos(th);\n  let s = p.dir * sin(th);\n  let o = t * d + h * p.hd + 2u * i;\n  let a = x[o];\n  let b = x[o + 1u];\n  y[o] = a * c - b * s;\n  y[o + 1u] = a * s + b * c;\n}\n`;\n\n// WebGL2 片段著色器：每個輸出元素依自己在 (t, h, 對) 中的位置，取出同一對的兩個輸入做旋轉\nconst FS_ROPE = `#version 300 es\nprecision highp float;\nprecision highp int;\n// @kernel rope\nuniform highp sampler2D uX;\nuniform int uW;\nuniform int uT;\nuniform int uH;\nuniform int uHd;\nuniform float uDir;\nout vec4 fragColor;\nfloat fetchX(int i) { return texelFetch(uX, ivec2(i % uW, i / uW), 0).r; }\nvoid main() {\n  int idx = int(gl_FragCoord.y) * uW + int(gl_FragCoord.x);\n  int d = uH * uHd;\n  if (idx >= uT * d) { fragColor = vec4(0.0); return; }\n  int t = idx / d;\n  int rem = idx - t * d;\n  int r2 = rem % uHd;\n  int i = r2 / 2;\n  int o = idx - (r2 - 2 * i);\n  float th = float(t) * pow(10000.0, -2.0 * float(i) / float(uHd));\n  float c = cos(th);\n  float s = uDir * sin(th);\n  float a = fetchX(o);\n  float b = fetchX(o + 1);\n  float v = (r2 == 2 * i) ? (a * c - b * s) : (a * s + b * c);\n  fragColor = vec4(v, 0.0, 0.0, 1.0);\n}\n`;\n\nasync function rope(x, T, H, hd, dir, opts) {\n  const xf = Float32Array.from(x);\n  return tryLayers('rope', opts,\n    async (dev) => {\n      const uni = new ArrayBuffer(16);\n      new Uint32Array(uni, 0, 3).set([T, H, hd]);\n      new Float32Array(uni, 12, 1)[0] = dir;\n      const outs = await runWgsl(dev, WGSL_ROPE,\n        [{ data: xf, out: false }, { data: new Float32Array(xf.length), out: true }],\n        uni, Math.ceil(T * H * (hd / 2) / 64));\n      return outs[0];\n    },\n    (gl) => glRun(gl, FS_ROPE, [xf], { i: { uT: T, uH: H, uHd: hd }, f: { uDir: dir } }, xf.length, ['uX']),\n    () => ropeRef(xf, T, H, hd, dir));\n}\n\n// ---------- AdamW（逐元素，解耦權重衰減）----------\n// m ← b1·m + (1−b1)·g；v ← b2·v + (1−b2)·g²；p ← p − lr·wd·p − lr·(m/c1)/(sqrt(v/c2)+eps)\n// c1 = 1−b1^t、c2 = 1−b2^t 由主機算好傳入。wd=0 時與 lora_ref_train.js 的 adamStep 相同公式。\nfunction adamwCore(p, g, m, v, lr, b1, b2, eps, wd, c1, c2) {\n  const n = p.length, P2 = new Float64Array(n), M2 = new Float64Array(n), V2 = new Float64Array(n);\n  for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n    M2[i] = b1 * m[i] + (1 - b1) * g[i];\n    V2[i] = b2 * v[i] + (1 - b2) * g[i] * g[i];\n    P2[i] = p[i] - lr * wd * p[i] - lr * (M2[i] / c1) / (Math.sqrt(V2[i] / c2) + eps);\n  }\n  return { p: P2, m: M2, v: V2 };\n}\nfunction adamwRef(p, g, m, v, t, lr, b1, b2, eps, wd) {\n  if (p.length !== g.length || p.length !== m.length || p.length !== v.length) throw new Error('adamw：p、g、m、v 長度不同');\n  return adamwCore(p, g, m, v, lr, b1, b2, eps, wd, 1 - Math.pow(b1, t), 1 - Math.pow(b2, t));\n}\n\nconst WGSL_ADAMW = `\nstruct P { n: u32, lr: f32, b1: f32, b2: f32, eps: f32, wd: f32, c1: f32, c2: f32 }\n@group(0) @binding(0) var<storage, read_write> pp: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(1) var<storage, read> gg: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(2) var<storage, read_write> mm: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(3) var<storage, read_write> vv: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(4) var<uniform> u: P;\n// @kernel adamw\n@compute @workgroup_size(64)\nfn main(@builtin(global_invocation_id) gid: vec3<u32>) {\n  let i = gid.x;\n  if (i >= u.n) { return; }\n  let g = gg[i];\n  let m2 = u.b1 * mm[i] + (1.0 - u.b1) * g;\n  let v2 = u.b2 * vv[i] + (1.0 - u.b2) * g * g;\n  let p0 = pp[i];\n  mm[i] = m2;\n  vv[i] = v2;\n  pp[i] = p0 - u.lr * u.wd * p0 - u.lr * (m2 / u.c1) / (sqrt(v2 / u.c2) + u.eps);\n}\n`;\n\n// WebGL2：AdamW 三個輸出各一趟（不用多個 draw buffer）。每趟都從四個輸入重算 m2、v2，所以三趟互不依賴。\nfunction fsAdamw(tag, outExpr) {\n  return `#version 300 es\nprecision highp float;\nprecision highp int;\n// @kernel ${tag}\nuniform highp sampler2D uP;\nuniform highp sampler2D uG;\nuniform highp sampler2D uM;\nuniform highp sampler2D uV;\nuniform int uW;\nuniform int uN;\nuniform float uLr;\nuniform float uB1;\nuniform float uB2;\nuniform float uEps;\nuniform float uWd;\nuniform float uC1;\nuniform float uC2;\nout vec4 fragColor;\nfloat fetch(sampler2D t, int i) { return texelFetch(t, ivec2(i % uW, i / uW), 0).r; }\nvoid main() {\n  int idx = int(gl_FragCoord.y) * uW + int(gl_FragCoord.x);\n  if (idx >= uN) { fragColor = vec4(0.0); return; }\n  float p = fetch(uP, idx);\n  float g = fetch(uG, idx);\n  float m = fetch(uM, idx);\n  float v = fetch(uV, idx);\n  float m2 = uB1 * m + (1.0 - uB1) * g;\n  float v2 = uB2 * v + (1.0 - uB2) * g * g;\n  fragColor = vec4(${outExpr}, 0.0, 0.0, 1.0);\n}\n`;\n}\nconst FS_ADAMW_P = fsAdamw('adamw_p', 'p - uLr * uWd * p - uLr * (m2 / uC1) / (sqrt(v2 / uC2) + uEps)');\nconst FS_ADAMW_M = fsAdamw('adamw_m', 'm2');\nconst FS_ADAMW_V = fsAdamw('adamw_v', 'v2');\n\nasync function adamw(p, g, m, v, t, lr, b1, b2, eps, wd, opts) {\n  const pf = Float32Array.from(p), gf = Float32Array.from(g), mf = Float32Array.from(m), vf = Float32Array.from(v);\n  const n = pf.length;\n  return tryLayers('adamw', opts,\n    async (dev) => {\n      const c1 = 1 - Math.pow(b1, t), c2 = 1 - Math.pow(b2, t);\n      const uni = new ArrayBuffer(32);\n      new Uint32Array(uni, 0, 1)[0] = n;\n      const fl = new Float32Array(uni, 4, 7);\n      fl.set([lr, b1, b2, eps, wd, c1, c2]);\n      const outs = await runWgsl(dev, WGSL_ADAMW,\n        [{ data: pf, out: true }, { data: gf, out: false }, { data: mf, out: true }, { data: vf, out: true }],\n        uni, Math.ceil(n / 64));\n      return { p: outs[0], m: outs[1], v: outs[2] };\n    },\n    (gl) => {\n      const c1 = 1 - Math.pow(b1, t), c2 = 1 - Math.pow(b2, t);\n      const ins = [pf, gf, mf, vf], names = ['uP', 'uG', 'uM', 'uV'];\n      const uni = { i: { uN: n }, f: { uLr: lr, uB1: b1, uB2: b2, uEps: eps, uWd: wd, uC1: c1, uC2: c2 } };\n      return {\n        p: glRun(gl, FS_ADAMW_P, ins, uni, n, names),\n        m: glRun(gl, FS_ADAMW_M, ins, uni, n, names),\n        v: glRun(gl, FS_ADAMW_V, ins, uni, n, names),\n      };\n    },\n    () => adamwRef(pf, gf, mf, vf, t, lr, b1, b2, eps, wd));\n}\n\n// ---------- 交叉熵（O8）：前向 loss 與反向 dl 一次派發，一個工作群組算一列 ----------\n// 輸入 lg（T×V f32）、tg（T 個 u32 目標）、invT（=1/T）。輸出 dl（T×V）＝(softmax − onehot)·invT，rows（T）＝每列 −log p_t（未除 T）。\n// 主機把 rows 加總再除以 T 得到平均 loss。數值：列內先取最大值（數值穩定），再 exp 求和。\nconst WGSL_CE = `\nstruct P { T: u32, V: u32, invT: f32 }\n@group(0) @binding(0) var<storage, read> lg: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(1) var<storage, read> tg: array<u32>;\n@group(0) @binding(2) var<storage, read_write> dl: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(3) var<storage, read_write> rows: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(4) var<uniform> u: P;\nvar<workgroup> red: array<f32, 64>;\n// @kernel cross_entropy\n@compute @workgroup_size(64)\nfn main(@builtin(workgroup_id) wid: vec3<u32>, @builtin(local_invocation_id) lid: vec3<u32>) {\n  let row = wid.x;\n  let t = lid.x;\n  let base = row * u.V;\n  var mx: f32 = -3.0e38;\n  for (var j: u32 = t; j < u.V; j = j + 64u) { mx = max(mx, lg[base + j]); }\n  red[t] = mx;\n  workgroupBarrier();\n  for (var s: u32 = 32u; s > 0u; s = s >> 1u) { if (t < s) { red[t] = max(red[t], red[t + s]); } workgroupBarrier(); }\n  let rmax = red[0];\n  workgroupBarrier();\n  var sm: f32 = 0.0;\n  for (var j: u32 = t; j < u.V; j = j + 64u) { sm = sm + exp(lg[base + j] - rmax); }\n  red[t] = sm;\n  workgroupBarrier();\n  for (var s: u32 = 32u; s > 0u; s = s >> 1u) { if (t < s) { red[t] = red[t] + red[t + s]; } workgroupBarrier(); }\n  let total = red[0];\n  let tgt = tg[row];\n  for (var j: u32 = t; j < u.V; j = j + 64u) {\n    let p = exp(lg[base + j] - rmax) / total;\n    var one: f32 = 0.0;\n    if (j == tgt) { one = 1.0; }\n    dl[base + j] = (p - one) * u.invT;\n  }\n  if (t == 0u) { rows[row] = log(total) - (lg[base + tgt] - rmax); }\n}\n`;\n// f64 參考：rows[t] = −log p_t；dl = (p − onehot)·invT。\nfunction crossEntropyRef(lg, tg, T, V, invT) {\n  const rows = new Float64Array(T), dl = new Float64Array(T * V);\n  for (let t = 0; t < T; t++) {\n    let mx = -Infinity; for (let j = 0; j < V; j++) if (lg[t * V + j] > mx) mx = lg[t * V + j];\n    let s = 0; for (let j = 0; j < V; j++) s += Math.exp(lg[t * V + j] - mx);\n    rows[t] = Math.log(s) - (lg[t * V + tg[t]] - mx);\n    for (let j = 0; j < V; j++) dl[t * V + j] = (Math.exp(lg[t * V + j] - mx) / s - (j === tg[t] ? 1 : 0)) * invT;\n  }\n  return { rows, dl };\n}\n// 獨立呼叫（與其他運算一樣走三層降級）。回傳 { result: { loss（平均）, dl }, info }。\nasync function crossEntropy(lg, tg, T, V, opts) {\n  if (T > 65535) throw new Error('cross_entropy：T 超過 65535（一列一個工作群組，單維派發上限）');\n  const invT = 1 / T;\n  return tryLayers('cross_entropy', opts,\n    async (dev) => {\n      const uni = new ArrayBuffer(16); new Uint32Array(uni, 0, 2).set([T, V]); new Float32Array(uni, 8, 1)[0] = invT;\n      const outs = await runWgsl(dev, WGSL_CE,\n        [{ data: Float32Array.from(lg), out: false }, { data: Uint32Array.from(tg), out: false },\n          { data: new Float32Array(T * V), out: true }, { data: new Float32Array(T), out: true }],\n        uni, T);\n      const rows = outs[1]; let s = 0; for (let t = 0; t < T; t++) s += rows[t];\n      return { loss: s / T, dl: outs[0] };\n    },\n    null,\n    () => { const r = crossEntropyRef(lg, tg, T, V, invT); let s = 0; for (let t = 0; t < T; t++) s += r.rows[t]; return { loss: s / T, dl: r.dl }; });\n}\n\n// ---------- 逐元素批次運算（O8 每層一次提交用）：axpy、mul、scal ----------\nconst WGSL_AXPY_B = `\nstruct P { n: u32, s: f32 }\n@group(0) @binding(0) var<storage, read> xa: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(1) var<storage, read> xb: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(2) var<storage, read_write> yo: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(3) var<uniform> u: P;\n// @kernel axpy_batch\n@compute @workgroup_size(64)\nfn main(@builtin(global_invocation_id) gid: vec3<u32>) {\n  let i = gid.x; if (i >= u.n) { return; }\n  yo[i] = xa[i] + u.s * xb[i];\n}\n`;\nconst WGSL_MUL_B = `\nstruct P { n: u32, s: f32 }\n@group(0) @binding(0) var<storage, read> xa: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(1) var<storage, read> xb: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(2) var<storage, read_write> yo: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(3) var<uniform> u: P;\n// @kernel mul_batch\n@compute @workgroup_size(64)\nfn main(@builtin(global_invocation_id) gid: vec3<u32>) {\n  let i = gid.x; if (i >= u.n) { return; }\n  yo[i] = xa[i] * xb[i];\n}\n`;\nconst WGSL_SCAL_B = `\nstruct P { n: u32, s: f32 }\n@group(0) @binding(0) var<storage, read> xa: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(1) var<storage, read_write> yo: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(2) var<uniform> u: P;\n// @kernel scal_batch\n@compute @workgroup_size(64)\nfn main(@builtin(global_invocation_id) gid: vec3<u32>) {\n  let i = gid.x; if (i >= u.n) { return; }\n  yo[i] = u.s * xa[i];\n}\n`;\n// IEEE 半精度：f32 → f16 位元（就近偶數捨入；溢位成 ±Inf、極小值成次正規數或 0）與反向解碼。\nconst _f32buf = new Float32Array(1), _u32buf = new Uint32Array(_f32buf.buffer);\nfunction f32ToF16Bits(x) {\n  _f32buf[0] = x; const b = _u32buf[0];\n  const sign = (b >>> 16) & 0x8000, exp = (b >>> 23) & 0xff; let mant = b & 0x7fffff;\n  if (exp === 0xff) return sign | 0x7c00 | (mant ? 0x200 : 0);\n  const e = exp - 127 + 15;\n  if (e >= 31) return sign | 0x7c00;\n  if (e <= 0) {\n    if (e < -10) return sign;\n    mant |= 0x800000; const shift = 14 - e; let half = mant >>> shift;\n    const rem = mant & ((1 << shift) - 1), halfway = 1 << (shift - 1);\n    if (rem > halfway || (rem === halfway && (half & 1))) half++;\n    return sign | half;\n  }\n  let half = (e << 10) | (mant >>> 13); const rem = mant & 0x1fff;\n  if (rem > 0x1000 || (rem === 0x1000 && (half & 1))) half++;\n  return sign | half;\n}\nfunction f16ToF32(h) {\n  const s = (h & 0x8000) ? -1 : 1, e = (h >>> 10) & 0x1f, m = h & 0x3ff;\n  if (e === 0) return s * m * Math.pow(2, -24);\n  if (e === 0x1f) return m ? NaN : s * Infinity;\n  return s * (1024 + m) * Math.pow(2, e - 25);\n}\nconst MM_F16_CODE = core.mmTileWgsl({ marker: 'matmul_f16', dtype: 'f16' });\n\n// ---------- 批次提交：同一個 command encoder、中間結果留在 GPU 緩衝區，只在 read() 時回讀 ----------\n// 用法：const b = createBatch(dev); const x = b.upload(arr); const y = b.rmsnorm(x, g, T, d, eps); ...\n//       const [out] = await b.read([[y, n]]);   // 整批只 submit 一次、回讀只在最後\n// 目前涵蓋 RMSNorm、softmax、SiLU、RoPE（同一層內的逐元素與列運算）與 matmul（2026-11-18 加入，與 gpu_core 共用核心）。\n// 注意力、q8mm、MatMulNBits 還沒進批次（見 docs/CHECKLIST.cudaweb-optimize.md 的 O6）。\n// 動態量化（O6，與 infer_ops.quantizeDynamicRef 同一套規則）：兩段。\n// 第一段：單一工作群組求全域最小／最大（先含 0，與參考版一致），算出 scale、zp，寫進 st[0..3] = [mn, mx, scale, zp]。\n// 第二段：逐元素 q = clamp(round(x/scale)+zp, 0, 255) − zp（int32）。scale 為 0 時 scale 記 1、zp 記 0（與參考版一致）。\nconst WGSL_QDYN_STATS = `\n// @kernel qdyn_stats\n@group(0) @binding(0) var<storage, read> x: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(1) var<storage, read_write> st: array<f32>;\nstruct U { n: u32 };\n@group(0) @binding(2) var<uniform> u: U;\nvar<workgroup> smn: array<f32, 256>;\nvar<workgroup> smx: array<f32, 256>;\n@compute @workgroup_size(256)\nfn main(@builtin(local_invocation_id) lid: vec3<u32>) {\n  let t = lid.x;\n  var mn: f32 = 0.0;\n  var mx: f32 = 0.0;\n  var i: u32 = t;\n  loop {\n    if (i >= u.n) { break; }\n    let v = x[i];\n    mn = min(mn, v);\n    mx = max(mx, v);\n    i = i + 256u;\n  }\n  smn[t] = mn;\n  smx[t] = mx;\n  workgroupBarrier();\n  var s: u32 = 128u;\n  loop {\n    if (s == 0u) { break; }\n    if (t < s) {\n      smn[t] = min(smn[t], smn[t + s]);\n      smx[t] = max(smx[t], smx[t + s]);\n    }\n    workgroupBarrier();\n    s = s >> 1u;\n  }\n  if (t == 0u) {\n    let mnv = smn[0];\n    let mxv = smx[0];\n    let scale = (mxv - mnv) / 255.0;\n    var sc: f32 = scale;\n    var zp: f32 = 0.0;\n    if (scale == 0.0) { sc = 1.0; } else { zp = clamp(round(-mnv / scale), 0.0, 255.0); }\n    st[0] = mnv;\n    st[1] = mxv;\n    st[2] = sc;\n    st[3] = zp;\n  }\n}`;\nconst WGSL_QDYN = `\n// @kernel qdyn\n@group(0) @binding(0) var<storage, read> x: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(1) var<storage, read> st: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(2) var<storage, read_write> q: array<i32>;\nstruct U { n: u32 };\n@group(0) @binding(3) var<uniform> u: U;\n@compute @workgroup_size(64)\nfn main(@builtin(global_invocation_id) gid: vec3<u32>) {\n  let i = gid.x;\n  if (i >= u.n) { return; }\n  let sc = st[2];\n  let zp = st[3];\n  let qf = clamp(round(x[i] / sc) + zp, 0.0, 255.0);\n  q[i] = i32(qf) - i32(zp);\n}`;\n// O7 融合：單列（解碼 T=1）的 RMSNorm＋動態量化，一個工作群組（256 執行緒）一次派發完成。\n// 步驟：平方和（並行歸約）→ inv → 每個元素 v = x·inv·g（寫進 y，給殘差或需要時用）→ min／max 歸約 → scale、zp 寫進 st → 逐元素量化（重算 v，不讀 y，避免儲存緩衝的跨執行緒可見性問題）。\n// 與「rmsnorm（每列一個執行緒、逐元素串列）＋quantizeDyn（兩段）」比，派發數 1 對 3。\nconst WGSL_RMSQ_FUSED = `\n// @kernel rmsq_fused\nstruct P { d: u32, eps: f32 }\n@group(0) @binding(0) var<storage, read> x: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(1) var<storage, read> g: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(2) var<storage, read_write> y: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(3) var<storage, read_write> q: array<i32>;\n@group(0) @binding(4) var<storage, read_write> st: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(5) var<uniform> p: P;\nvar<workgroup> sh: array<f32, 256>;\nvar<workgroup> smn: array<f32, 256>;\nvar<workgroup> smx: array<f32, 256>;\n@compute @workgroup_size(256)\nfn main(@builtin(local_invocation_id) lid: vec3<u32>) {\n  let t = lid.x;\n  var s: f32 = 0.0;\n  var i: u32 = t;\n  loop { if (i >= p.d) { break; } let v = x[i]; s = s + v * v; i = i + 256u; }\n  sh[t] = s;\n  workgroupBarrier();\n  var r: u32 = 128u;\n  loop { if (r == 0u) { break; } if (t < r) { sh[t] = sh[t] + sh[t + r]; } workgroupBarrier(); r = r >> 1u; }\n  let inv = 1.0 / sqrt(sh[0] / f32(p.d) + p.eps);\n  var mn: f32 = 0.0;\n  var mx: f32 = 0.0;\n  i = t;\n  loop {\n    if (i >= p.d) { break; }\n    let v = x[i] * inv * g[i];\n    y[i] = v;\n    mn = min(mn, v);\n    mx = max(mx, v);\n    i = i + 256u;\n  }\n  smn[t] = mn;\n  smx[t] = mx;\n  workgroupBarrier();\n  var c: u32 = 128u;\n  loop {\n    if (c == 0u) { break; }\n    if (t < c) { smn[t] = min(smn[t], smn[t + c]); smx[t] = max(smx[t], smx[t + c]); }\n    workgroupBarrier();\n    c = c >> 1u;\n  }\n  let mnv = smn[0];\n  let mxv = smx[0];\n  let scale = (mxv - mnv) / 255.0;\n  var sc: f32 = scale;\n  var zp: f32 = 0.0;\n  if (scale == 0.0) { sc = 1.0; } else { zp = clamp(round(-mnv / scale), 0.0, 255.0); }\n  if (t == 0u) { st[0] = mnv; st[1] = mxv; st[2] = sc; st[3] = zp; }\n  i = t;\n  loop {\n    if (i >= p.d) { break; }\n    let v = x[i] * inv * g[i];\n    q[i] = i32(clamp(round(v / sc) + zp, 0.0, 255.0)) - i32(zp);\n    i = i + 256u;\n  }\n}`;\n// 對照用（O7 拆開量）：單列 RMSNorm，同樣的並行歸約，但只輸出 f32（不量化）。用來分開「rmsnorm 並行化」與「融合」的貢獻。\nconst WGSL_RMS_PAR = `\nstruct P { d: u32, eps: f32 }\n@group(0) @binding(0) var<storage, read> x: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(1) var<storage, read> g: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(2) var<storage, read_write> y: array<f32>;\n@group(0) @binding(3) var<uniform> p: P;\nvar<workgroup> sh: array<f32, 256>;\n@compute @workgroup_size(256)\nfn main(@builtin(local_invocation_id) lid: vec3<u32>) {\n  let t = lid.x;\n  var s: f32 = 0.0;\n  var i: u32 = t;\n  loop { if (i >= p.d) { break; } let v = x[i]; s = s + v * v; i = i + 256u; }\n  sh[t] = s;\n  workgroupBarrier();\n  var r: u32 = 128u;\n  loop { if (r == 0u) { break; } if (t < r) { sh[t] = sh[t] + sh[t + r]; } workgroupBarrier(); r = r >> 1u; }\n  let inv = 1.0 / sqrt(sh[0] / f32(p.d) + p.eps);\n  i = t;\n  loop { if (i >= p.d) { break; } y[i] = x[i] * inv * g[i]; i = i + 256u; }\n}`;\nconst MM_TILED_CODE = core.mmTileWgsl({ marker: 'matmul', dtype: 'f32' });\nconst MM_VEC4_CODE = core.mmTileWgslVec4({ marker: 'matmul_vec4' });\nfunction createBatch(dev) {\n  const enc = dev.createCommandEncoder();\n  let submitted = false;\n  const pool = GP.poolFor(dev);\n  // 這個批次借來的緩衝區；submit 之後整批歸還池（佇列依序執行，之後的寫入排在這次讀取之後，安全）\n  const temps = [];\n  const stats = { dispatches: 0, readbacks: 0, submits: 0, pipelineHits: 0, pipelineMisses: 0, pool: pool.stats };\n  function storage(n) {\n    const buf = pool.acquire(Math.max(4, n * 4), USAGE.STORAGE | USAGE.COPY_SRC | USAGE.COPY_DST);\n    temps.push(buf);\n    return buf;\n  }\n  function upload(arr) { const f = arr instanceof Float32Array ? arr : Float32Array.from(arr); const buf = storage(f.length); dev.queue.writeBuffer(buf, 0, f); return { buf: buf, n: f.length }; }\n  // f16 上傳：每個值存成半精度位元（2 位元組），長度為奇數時補一個 0 讓 writeBuffer 的長度是 4 的倍數\n  function uploadF16(arr) {\n    const n = arr.length, bits = new Uint16Array(n + (n & 1));\n    for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) bits[i] = f32ToF16Bits(arr[i]);\n    const buf = storage(bits.length / 2); dev.queue.writeBuffer(buf, 0, bits);\n    return { buf: buf, n: n, f16: true };\n  }\n  function uploadU32(arr) { const u = arr instanceof Uint32Array ? arr : Uint32Array.from(arr); const buf = storage(u.length); dev.queue.writeBuffer(buf, 0, u); return { buf: buf, n: u.length }; }\n  function dispatch(code, bindBufs, uniform, groups) {\n    if (submitted) throw new Error('批次已經提交，不能再加入運算');\n    const ub = pool.acquire(Math.max(16, Math.ceil(uniform.byteLength / 16) * 16), USAGE.UNIFORM | USAGE.COPY_DST);\n    temps.push(ub);\n    dev.queue.writeBuffer(ub, 0, uniform);\n    const got = GP.pipelineFor(dev, code);\n    if (got.hit) stats.pipelineHits++; else stats.pipelineMisses++;\n    const pipe = got.pipe;\n    const entries = bindBufs.map((b, i) => ({ binding: i, resource: { buffer: b } }));\n    entries.push({ binding: bindBufs.length, resource: { buffer: ub } });\n    const bg = dev.createBindGroup({ layout: pipe.getBindGroupLayout(0), entries: entries });\n    const pass = enc.beginComputePass();\n    pass.setPipeline(pipe); pass.setBindGroup(0, bg);\n    if (Array.isArray(groups)) pass.dispatchWorkgroups(groups[0], groups[1], groups[2]); else pass.dispatchWorkgroups(groups);\n    pass.end();\n    stats.dispatches++;\n  }\n  const b = {\n    upload: upload,\n    uploadU32: uploadU32,\n    uploadF16: uploadF16,\n    rmsnorm(x, g, T, d, eps) {\n      const y = storage(T * d);\n      const uni = new ArrayBuffer(16); new Uint32Array(uni, 0, 2).set([T, d]); new Float32Array(uni, 8, 1)[0] = eps;\n      dispatch(WGSL_RMSNORM, [x.buf, g.buf, y], uni, Math.ceil(T / 64));\n      return { buf: y, n: T * d };\n    },\n    softmax(x, rows, cols) {\n      const y = storage(rows * cols);\n      const uni = new ArrayBuffer(16); new Uint32Array(uni, 0, 2).set([rows, cols]);\n      dispatch(WGSL_SOFTMAX, [x.buf, y], uni, Math.ceil(rows / 64));\n      return { buf: y, n: rows * cols };\n    },\n    // （批次內的 rmsnorm、softmax、silu、rope 都只走 T1；批次是 GPU 內連續運算，不經過 WebGL2）\n    silu(x) {\n      const y = storage(x.n);\n      const uni = new ArrayBuffer(16); new Uint32Array(uni, 0, 1)[0] = x.n;\n      dispatch(WGSL_SILU, [x.buf, y], uni, Math.ceil(x.n / 64));\n      return { buf: y, n: x.n };\n    },\n    rope(x, T, H, hd, dir) {\n      const y = storage(T * H * hd);\n      const uni = new ArrayBuffer(16); new Uint32Array(uni, 0, 3).set([T, H, hd]); new Float32Array(uni, 12, 1)[0] = dir;\n      dispatch(WGSL_ROPE, [x.buf, y], uni, Math.ceil(T * H * (hd / 2) / 64));\n      return { buf: y, n: T * H * hd };\n    },\n    // 矩陣乘（與 gpu_core 的 wgMatmul 同一組核心：K、N 為 4 的倍數時用 vec4 版）。A 是 M×K 的句柄，B 是 K×N 的句柄（常駐權重也可以）\n    // fl（選用）：{ transA, transB }（O5 的轉置版，走同一份平鋪核心的 p0 旗標；轉置時不用 vec4 版）\n    // fl.f16 = true：輸入必須是 uploadF16 的句柄（儲存 f16、累加 f32），走 f16 平鋪核心（需要 shader-f16）。\n    matmul(A, B, M, K, N, fl) {\n      const y = storage(M * N);\n      const flags = core.mmTileFlags(fl);\n      const f16 = !!(fl && fl.f16);\n      if (f16 && !(A.f16 && B.f16)) throw new Error('matmul f16：輸入必須用 uploadF16 上傳');\n      if (!f16 && (A.f16 || B.f16)) throw new Error('matmul：f16 句柄必須帶 fl.f16');\n      const v4 = !f16 && core.mmTileVec4Ok(M, K, N, flags);\n      const uni = new ArrayBuffer(32); new Uint32Array(uni).set(core.mmTileWords(M, K, N, flags, 1));\n      dispatch(f16 ? MM_F16_CODE : (v4 ? MM_VEC4_CODE : MM_TILED_CODE), [A.buf, B.buf, y], uni, core.mmTileDispatch(M, N, 1));\n      return { buf: y, n: M * N };\n    },\n    // 逐元素（同一命令編碼器內，不回讀）：axpy＝x + s·y、mul＝x·y、scal＝s·x\n    axpy(x, y, s) { const o = storage(x.n); const uni = new ArrayBuffer(16); new Uint32Array(uni, 0, 1)[0] = x.n; new Float32Array(uni, 4, 1)[0] = s; dispatch(WGSL_AXPY_B, [x.buf, y.buf, o], uni, Math.ceil(x.n / 64)); return { buf: o, n: x.n }; },\n    mul(x, y) { const o = storage(x.n); const uni = new ArrayBuffer(16); new Uint32Array(uni, 0, 1)[0] = x.n; dispatch(WGSL_MUL_B, [x.buf, y.buf, o], uni, Math.ceil(x.n / 64)); return { buf: o, n: x.n }; },\n    scal(x, s) { const o = storage(x.n); const uni = new ArrayBuffer(16); new Uint32Array(uni, 0, 1)[0] = x.n; new Float32Array(uni, 4, 1)[0] = s; dispatch(WGSL_SCAL_B, [x.buf, o], uni, Math.ceil(x.n / 64)); return { buf: o, n: x.n }; },\n    // 交叉熵（O8）：logits 是 T×V 的句柄，tgt 是 uploadU32 的句柄；回傳 dl（T×V，已乘 invT）與 rows（T，未除 T）\n    crossEntropy(logits, tgt, T, V, invT) {\n      const dl = storage(T * V), rows = storage(T);\n      const uni = new ArrayBuffer(16); new Uint32Array(uni, 0, 2).set([T, V]); new Float32Array(uni, 8, 1)[0] = invT;\n      dispatch(WGSL_CE, [logits.buf, tgt.buf, dl, rows], uni, T);\n      return { dl: { buf: dl, n: T * V }, rows: { buf: rows, n: T } };\n    },\n    // O7 融合：單列 RMSNorm＋動態量化，一次派發。回傳 { y: {buf,n}（正規化後的 f32）, q: {buf,n,st}（i32 xq；st＝[mn,mx,scale,zp]） }\n    rmsQuantFused(x, g, d, eps) {\n      const y = storage(d), q = storage(d), st = storage(4);\n      const uni = new ArrayBuffer(16); new Uint32Array(uni, 0, 1)[0] = d; new Float32Array(uni, 4, 1)[0] = eps;\n      dispatch(WGSL_RMSQ_FUSED, [x.buf, g.buf, y, q, st], uni, 1);\n      return { y: { buf: y, n: d }, q: { buf: q, n: d, st: { buf: st, n: 4 } } };\n    },\n    // 對照用（O7）：單列 RMSNorm 並行版（一次派發，只輸出 f32）\n    rmsParallel(x, g, d, eps) {\n      const y = storage(d);\n      const uni = new ArrayBuffer(16); new Uint32Array(uni, 0, 1)[0] = d; new Float32Array(uni, 4, 1)[0] = eps;\n      dispatch(WGSL_RMS_PAR, [x.buf, g.buf, y], uni, 1);\n      return { buf: y, n: d };\n    },\n    // 動態量化：回傳 { buf, n }（i32 的 xq，已扣 zero point）與 st（[mn, mx, scale, zp] 的句柄，讀回用 read([[st, 4]])）\n    quantizeDyn(x) {\n      const n = x.n;\n      const st = storage(4), q = storage(n);\n      const u1 = new ArrayBuffer(16); new Uint32Array(u1, 0, 1)[0] = n;\n      dispatch(WGSL_QDYN_STATS, [x.buf, st], u1, 1);\n      dispatch(WGSL_QDYN, [x.buf, st, q], u1, Math.ceil(n / 64));\n      return { buf: q, n: n, st: { buf: st, n: 4 } };\n    },\n    // 一次 submit，整批的回讀都在這裡；specs = [[handle, n], ...]，回傳 Float32Array 陣列\n    async read(specs) {\n      if (submitted) throw new Error('批次已經提交過');\n      submitted = true;\n      const rbs = specs.map(([h, n]) => {\n        const rb = pool.acquire(Math.max(4, n * 4), USAGE.MAP_READ | USAGE.COPY_DST);\n        enc.copyBufferToBuffer(h.buf, 0, rb, 0, n * 4);\n        return rb;\n      });\n      dev.queue.submit([enc.finish()]);\n      stats.submits++;\n      // 命令已排進佇列，中間緩衝區可以歸還（之後的重用排在這次提交之後）\n      for (const t of temps) pool.release(t);\n      temps.length = 0;\n      const out = [];\n      for (let i = 0; i < rbs.length; i++) {\n        const rb = rbs[i], n = specs[i][1];\n        await rb.mapAsync(1);\n        // 池裡的緩衝區可能比要求的大（分桶），只取前 n 個值\n        out.push(new Float32Array(rb.getMappedRange().slice(0, n * 4)));\n        rb.unmap();\n        pool.release(rb);\n        stats.readbacks++;\n      }\n      return out;\n    },\n    // 給其他模組（infer_ops 的批次 q8mm）用的底層介面：配置輸出、以指定的儲存緩衝區與 uniform 派發一個核心\n    alloc(n) { return { buf: storage(n), n: n }; },\n    dispatchRaw(code, bindBufs, uniform, groups) { dispatch(code, bindBufs, uniform, groups); },\n    stats: stats,\n  };\n  return b;\n}\n\n// 訓練器用的運算介面（lora_ref_train.js 的 lossAndGradsAsync／adamStepAsync 接受的 ops）。\n// 每次呼叫都走三層降級（T1 → T3 → cpu-js），並把實際使用的層記在 stats 裡，給後端選單與測試用。\nfunction trainerOps(opts) {\n  const o = opts || {};\n  const stats = { calls: 0, layers: {}, last: null };\n  const rec = (op, info) => {\n    stats.calls++;\n    const key = op + ':' + info.layer;\n    stats.layers[key] = (stats.layers[key] || 0) + 1;\n    stats.last = info;\n  };\n  return {\n    stats: stats,\n    rmsnorm: async (x, g, T, d, eps) => { const r = await rmsnorm(x, g, T, d, eps, o); rec('rmsnorm', r.info); return r.result; },\n    softmax: async (x, rows, cols) => { const r = await softmax(x, rows, cols, o); rec('softmax', r.info); return r.result; },\n    silu: async (x) => { const r = await silu(x, o); rec('silu', r.info); return r.result; },\n    rope: async (x, T, H, hd, dir) => { const r = await rope(x, T, H, hd, dir, o); rec('rope', r.info); return r.result; },\n    adamw: async (p, g, m, v, t, lr, b1, b2, eps, wd) => { const r = await adamw(p, g, m, v, t, lr, b1, b2, eps, wd, o); rec('adamw', r.info); return r.result; },\n  };\n}\n\nmodule.exports = { trainerOps, crossEntropy, crossEntropyRef, WGSL_CE, f32ToF16Bits, f16ToF32, WGSL_AXPY_B, WGSL_MUL_B, WGSL_SCAL_B, MM_F16_CODE, rmsnormRef, rmsnorm, softmaxRef, softmax, siluRef, silu, ropeRef, rope, adamwCore, adamwRef, adamw, createBatch, runWgsl, getDevice, getGl, glSupport, glRun, tryLayers, nnBackendInfo, withMeasureLock, measureLockState, requestExclusiveGpu, registerIdleGpuHolder, NN_OPS, WGSL_RMSNORM, WGSL_SOFTMAX, WGSL_SILU, WGSL_ROPE, WGSL_ADAMW, WGSL_RMSQ_FUSED, NOTE_T3 };\n\n};\nMODS[\"onnx_lite\"] = function (module, exports, require) {\n/* onnx_lite.js — 極簡 ONNX 讀取器與改寫器（只用 Uint8Array，Node 與瀏覽器都能跑，不需要 Buffer）。\n * 用途：從現有 q8 模型檔取出權重（推論概念驗證），以及產生「輸出隱藏狀態、不算 lm_head」的變體圖（DESIGN.webgpu-cuda.md §7.3）。\n * 純 UMD。桌面版的 nr-onnx-lite.js 是這份檔案的拷貝（改一邊要同步）。\n *\n * parseModel 的回傳形狀：\n *   { buf, nodes, inits（物件：名稱→張量資訊，舊呼叫端用 m.inits[名稱]）, inputs, outputs（名稱字串）,\n *     graph: { nodes, inits（Map：名稱→同一批張量資訊）, inputs, outputs }（llm_q8_onnx 用）}\n * 2026-11-19 修正：O12f（ffbd0462d）把回傳改成只有 { graph }，舊呼叫端的 m.inits／m.nodes 變成 undefined，\n * 於是 Qwen3 GPU 整段解碼報「Cannot read properties of undefined」與「m.nodes is not iterable」。這裡把舊形狀還原，graph 保留給 O12f。\n * 輸入不合法（空檔、文字／網頁、截斷、缺 graph）會丟出寫明位元組數與檔頭的錯誤，不再回傳 undefined。\n */\n(function (root, factory) {\n  if (typeof module === 'object' && module.exports) module.exports = factory();\n  else root.FaOnnxLite = factory();\n})(typeof self !== 'undefined' ? self : this, function () {\n  'use strict';\n\n  const td = typeof TextDecoder !== 'undefined' ? new TextDecoder('utf-8') : null;\n  const te = typeof TextEncoder !== 'undefined' ? new TextEncoder() : null;\n  const decodeUtf8 = (u8) => (td ? td.decode(u8) : Buffer.from(u8.buffer, u8.byteOffset, u8.length).toString('utf8'));\n  const encodeUtf8 = (s) => (te ? te.encode(s) : new Uint8Array(Buffer.from(s, 'utf8')));\n  const f32At = (u8, p) => new DataView(u8.buffer, u8.byteOffset, u8.byteLength).getFloat32(p, true);\n\n  // 位元組的描述：長度與前 16 位元組（十六進位）。錯誤訊息用，讓人看得出是截斷、空檔還是網頁。\n  function describe(u8) {\n    const head = Array.from(u8.subarray(0, 16), (b) => b.toString(16).padStart(2, '0')).join(' ');\n    return u8.length + ' 位元組，前 16 位元組：' + (head || '（無）');\n  }\n  // 讀 varint，回傳 [值, 新位置]；超出檔案範圍就丟錯（截斷的檔案會在這裡露出來）\n  function varint(buf, pos) {\n    let r = 0, mul = 1;\n    for (;;) {\n      if (pos >= buf.length) throw new Error('onnx_lite：varint 讀到檔案結尾（位置 ' + pos + '，共 ' + buf.length + ' 位元組，可能是截斷）');\n      const b = buf[pos++];\n      r += (b & 0x7f) * mul;\n      if (!(b & 0x80)) break;\n      mul *= 128;\n    }\n    return [r, pos];\n  }\n  // 一段長度為 len 的欄位內容必須在 end 與檔案長度之內；否則丟出寫明數字的錯誤\n  function checkRange(buf, pos, len, field, end) {\n    const limit = Math.min(end, buf.length);\n    if (pos + len > limit) throw new Error('onnx_lite：欄位 ' + field + ' 宣告 ' + len + ' 位元組，但只剩 ' + Math.max(0, limit - pos) + ' 位元組（位置 ' + pos + '，檔案共 ' + buf.length + ' 位元組）；檔案可能被截斷');\n  }\n  // 走一段訊息，對每個欄位呼叫 fn(欄位號, 線型, 值或[起,迄])；線型 2 的值是 [起, 迄]\n  function walk(buf, start, end, fn) {\n    let pos = start;\n    while (pos < end) {\n      let t; [t, pos] = varint(buf, pos);\n      const field = Math.floor(t / 8), wt = t % 8;\n      if (wt === 0) { let v; [v, pos] = varint(buf, pos); fn(field, 0, v); }\n      else if (wt === 2) { let len; [len, pos] = varint(buf, pos); checkRange(buf, pos, len, field, end); fn(field, 2, [pos, pos + len]); pos += len; }\n      else if (wt === 5) { checkRange(buf, pos, 4, field, end); fn(field, 5, [pos, pos + 4]); pos += 4; }\n      else if (wt === 1) { checkRange(buf, pos, 8, field, end); fn(field, 1, [pos, pos + 8]); pos += 8; }\n      else throw new Error('onnx_lite：不支援的線型 ' + wt + '（位置 ' + (pos - 1) + '）');\n    }\n  }\n  const str = (buf, r) => decodeUtf8(buf.subarray(r[0], r[1]));\n\n  function parseTensor(buf, r) {\n    const t = { name: '', dims: [], dtype: 0, raw: null, ext: {} };\n    walk(buf, r[0], r[1], (f, wt, v) => {\n      if (f === 1) { if (wt === 0) t.dims.push(v); else { let p = v[0]; while (p < v[1]) { let x; [x, p] = varint(buf, p); t.dims.push(x); } } }\n      else if (f === 2) t.dtype = v;\n      else if (f === 8) t.name = str(buf, v);\n      else if (f === 9) t.raw = v;  // [起, 迄]，不複製\n      else if (f === 4) { if (!t.floats) t.floats = []; if (wt === 2) { for (let p = v[0]; p < v[1]; p += 4) t.floats.push(f32At(buf, p)); } else t.floats.push(f32At(buf, v[0])); }\n      else if (f === 5) { if (!t.ints) t.ints = []; if (wt === 2) { let p = v[0]; while (p < v[1]) { let x; [x, p] = varint(buf, p); t.ints.push(x); } } else t.ints.push(v); }\n      else if (f === 7) { if (!t.ints) t.ints = []; if (wt === 2) { let p = v[0]; while (p < v[1]) { let x; [x, p] = varint(buf, p); t.ints.push(x); } } else t.ints.push(v); }   // int64_data（小的 int64 常數，例如 Split 的 splits）\n      else if (f === 13) { // external_data：StringStringEntryProto\n        let k = '', val = '';\n        walk(buf, v[0], v[1], (ff, w2, vv) => { if (ff === 1) k = str(buf, vv); else if (ff === 2) val = str(buf, vv); });\n        t.ext[k] = val;\n      }\n    });\n    return t;\n  }\n  function parseAttr(buf, r) {\n    const a = { name: '', i: null, f: null, ints: [], s: null };\n    walk(buf, r[0], r[1], (f, wt, v) => {\n      if (f === 1) a.name = str(buf, v);\n      else if (f === 3) a.i = v;\n      else if (f === 2) a.f = f32At(buf, v[0]);\n      else if (f === 8) { if (wt === 0) a.ints.push(v); }\n      else if (f === 4) a.s = str(buf, v);\n      else if (f === 5) a.tensor = v;  // TensorProto 範圍（Constant 節點的 value）\n      else if (f === 6) a.graph = v;   // GraphProto 範圍（If／Loop 的子圖）\n      else if (f === 9) { if (!a.strings) a.strings = []; a.strings.push(str(buf, v)); }\n    });\n    return a;\n  }\n  // 取得 Constant 節點的值：{ dims, dtype, values（Float32Array 或 BigInt/數字陣列） }\n  function constantValue(m, node) {\n    const a = node.attrs && node.attrs.value;\n    if (!a || !a.tensor) throw new Error('onnx_lite：節點 ' + node.name + ' 不是 tensor 常數');\n    const t = parseTensor(m.buf, a.tensor);\n    let values = null;\n    if (t.floats) values = Float32Array.from(t.floats);\n    else if (t.ints) values = t.ints.slice();\n    else if (t.raw) {\n      const bytes = m.buf.subarray(t.raw[0], t.raw[1]);\n      const dv = new DataView(bytes.buffer, bytes.byteOffset, bytes.byteLength);\n      const n = bytes.byteLength;\n      if (t.dtype === 1) { values = new Float32Array(n / 4); for (let i = 0; i < n / 4; i++) values[i] = dv.getFloat32(i * 4, true); }\n      else if (t.dtype === 6) { values = new Int32Array(n / 4); for (let i = 0; i < n / 4; i++) values[i] = dv.getInt32(i * 4, true); }\n      else if (t.dtype === 7) { values = []; for (let i = 0; i < n / 8; i++) values.push(Number(dv.getBigInt64(i * 8, true))); }\n      else if (t.dtype === 9) { values = Array.from(bytes); }\n      else values = bytes.slice();\n    }\n    return { dims: t.dims, dtype: t.dtype, values };\n  }\n  function parseNode(buf, r) {\n    const n = { name: '', op: '', inputs: [], outputs: [], attrs: {} };\n    walk(buf, r[0], r[1], (f, wt, v) => {\n      if (f === 1) n.inputs.push(str(buf, v));\n      else if (f === 2) n.outputs.push(str(buf, v));\n      else if (f === 3) n.name = str(buf, v);\n      else if (f === 4) n.op = str(buf, v);\n      else if (f === 5) { const a = parseAttr(buf, v); n.attrs[a.name] = a; }\n    });\n    return n;\n  }\n  // 解析一個 GraphProto（範圍 [起, 迄]）：節點、初始值（物件：名稱→張量資訊）、圖輸入名、圖輸出名（輸入不含初始值）\n  function parseGraph(buf, graph) {\n    const nodes = [], inits = {}, inputs = [], outputs = [];\n    const vname = (r) => { let s = ''; walk(buf, r[0], r[1], (f, wt, v) => { if (f === 1) s = str(buf, v); }); return s; };\n    walk(buf, graph[0], graph[1], (f, wt, v) => {\n      if (f === 1) nodes.push(parseNode(buf, v));\n      else if (f === 5) { const t = parseTensor(buf, v); inits[t.name] = t; }\n      else if (f === 11) inputs.push(vname(v));\n      else if (f === 12) outputs.push(vname(v));\n    });\n    return { nodes: nodes, inits: inits, inputs: inputs.filter((x) => !inits[x]), outputs: outputs };\n  }\n  // 輸入檢查：空檔、看起來是文字或網頁的內容，要在解析前就說清楚（否則會變成不知所云的例外）\n  function checkInput(buf) {\n    if (!buf || typeof buf.length !== 'number' || !(buf instanceof Uint8Array)) throw new Error('onnx_lite：輸入不是位元組（需要 Uint8Array）');\n    if (buf.length === 0) throw new Error('onnx_lite：檔案是空的（0 位元組）；常見原因是下載中斷或快取寫入失敗');\n    const n = Math.min(buf.length, 64);\n    let text = true;\n    for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) { const b = buf[i]; if (!(b === 9 || b === 10 || b === 13 || (b >= 32 && b < 127))) { text = false; break; } }\n    if (text) throw new Error('onnx_lite：看起來是文字或網頁，不是 ONNX 二進位（' + describe(buf) + '）；常見原因是下載到錯誤頁');\n  }\n  // 讀整個模型。回傳形狀見檔案開頭。\n  function parseModel(buf) {\n    checkInput(buf);\n    let graph = null; const top = new Set();\n    walk(buf, 0, buf.length, (f, wt, v) => { top.add(f); if (f === 7) graph = v; });\n    if (!graph) throw new Error('onnx_lite：找不到 graph（ModelProto 欄位 7）；頂層欄位號：[' + Array.from(top).sort((a, b) => a - b).join(', ') + ']（' + describe(buf) + '）');\n    const g = parseGraph(buf, graph);\n    const initMap = new Map(Object.keys(g.inits).map((k) => [k, g.inits[k]]));\n    return { buf: buf, nodes: g.nodes, inits: g.inits, inputs: g.inputs, outputs: g.outputs,\n      graph: { nodes: g.nodes, inits: initMap, inputs: g.inputs, outputs: g.outputs } };\n  }\n\n  // ---- 張量的 typed array（llm_q8_onnx 用）：raw_data 不對齊時複製一份；小張量用 float_data／int 欄位 ----\n  const TYPED = { 1: Float32Array, 2: Uint8Array, 3: Int8Array, 6: Int32Array, 10: Uint16Array };\n  function tensorArray(buf, t) {\n    const elems = t.dims.reduce((a, b) => a * b, 1);\n    const C = TYPED[t.dtype];\n    if (t.raw) {\n      if (!C) throw new Error('onnx_lite：dtype ' + t.dtype + ' 暫不取陣列（' + t.name + '）');\n      const bytes = buf.subarray(t.raw[0], t.raw[1]);\n      const need = elems * C.BYTES_PER_ELEMENT;\n      if (bytes.length !== need) throw new Error('onnx_lite：' + t.name + ' 的 raw_data 長度 ' + bytes.length + ' 與形狀需要的 ' + need + ' 不符');\n      if (bytes.byteOffset % C.BYTES_PER_ELEMENT === 0) return new C(bytes.buffer, bytes.byteOffset, elems);\n      return new C(bytes.slice().buffer, 